{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "file": "Event_Languages/Taiwu_EventPackage_SectMainStoryXuehou_Language_EN.txt",
  "glossaryVersion": 5,
  "units": {
    "b1f1290c-4334-4d48-87dc-b1348c914251/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Life or death, it all ends in a tomb...\"<NL>Jixi repeats, lost in thought...",
      "cn": "“死与不死，皆归坟墓……”<NL>姬穸复道，若有所思……",
      "ru": "\"Жизнь или смерть, все заканчивается в могиле...\"<NL>Повторяет Джикси, погруженная в свои мысли...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1dc3a08a53ae67d4",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b1f1290c-4334-4d48-87dc-b1348c914251/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6f0e49b5-bc50-4ad0-84ff-650c76c2c256/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"My origins...\"<NL>Jixi responds calmly, followed by a moment of silence. It seems like memories of the past resurfaced.<NL>After a while, Jixi sighs, saying:",
      "cn": "“我的身世……”<NL>姬穸淡淡地应道，随后半晌未语，也不知回忆起了什么往事，<NL>如此又过了许久，姬穸方才叹气道：",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6de1213605efd113",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6f0e49b5-bc50-4ad0-84ff-650c76c2c256/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9495527f-25d7-4995-bf58-f82b59939847/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Past events are complicated and hard to fully describe.<NL>This is not the first time I have been buried in a grave...<NL>In the beginning, my parents thought I was dead and buried me.<NL>Later, the Taoists knew I wasn't dead but still banished me to the grave...\"<NL>Jixi casually explained, showing little concern.",
      "cn": "“往事繁杂，难以尽述，<NL>这已不是我第一次被埋入坟墓……<NL>最开始，我父母以为我死了，将我葬下墓来，<NL>后来，道士们知道我不会死，仍是将我驱赶至墓中……”<NL>姬穸漫不经心地说道，似乎并不如何在意此事。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "df8acc79ea981f5d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9495527f-25d7-4995-bf58-f82b59939847/Option_1": {
      "en": "Life or death, it all ends in a tomb. It's ironic...",
      "cn": "死与不死，皆归坟墓，好不讽刺……\n",
      "ru": "Жизнь или смерть, все заканчивается в могиле. Ирония судьбы...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "d279b3d3df4e6eb9",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1f0dec77-0cf5-4d32-b347-a8df3b839e22/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Do you know about the technique of Ultimate Yin Remold?\"<NL>Jixi asked. \"The red-robed Jiangshi is created through that technique...\"",
      "cn": "“你可知何为太阴炼形之术？<NL>那红衣活尸便是此术炼制而成……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f9bdbf7e4a887c7c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1f0dec77-0cf5-4d32-b347-a8df3b839e22/Option_1": {
      "en": "What's that technique?",
      "cn": "这是何等邪法？\n",
      "ru": "Что это за техника?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1b474dfcb6302e4d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "91d0330e-1723-4bf9-9ef3-6abe90e7c674/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So it was <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>...<NL>I understand your sentiment, and it's not that I don't appreciate you cooking for me.<NL>I just have a small appetite. I really can't eat another bite...\"<NL>Looking into her clear and calm eyes, it was obvious Jixi was being sincere...",
      "cn": "“原是<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>……<NL>你之心意，我未曾不知，亦并非不喜你亲手料理饭食，<NL>只是我胃口小，确是再吃不下了……”<NL>望之双眸，澄澈泰然，姬穸此言显然真心实意……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f69e76933f1af441",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "91d0330e-1723-4bf9-9ef3-6abe90e7c674/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Guess that's how it has to be...)",
      "cn": "（只好如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Думаю, так и должно быть...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6e390e39dac24598",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "da1f37db-0fa9-4396-84d2-d07828fc81a8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Is this... a bat?\"<NL>Jixi asked. \"Bats seen flying low during twilight, dancing around lights at night, their forms eerie...<NL>Yes, this suits me well. Thank you for finding it for me...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi seems to have a great fondness for the Ancient Jade Bat...)</color>",
      "cn": "“此物……可是蝙蝠？<NL>黄昏来时，能见蝙蝠低飞，夜翻灯舞，形态鬼魅……<NL>不错，此物甚合我之心意，多谢你特意为我寻来……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸似乎非常喜爱古老的玉蝙蝠……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "59082de84e2de0ec",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "da1f37db-0fa9-4396-84d2-d07828fc81a8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "52e194eb-8697-444d-a7ae-eda4c1d207da/EventContent": {
      "en": "A person approached, emanating a strong killing intent and covered in blood.<NL>Judging by the vicious aura, they must have committed numerous atrocities on their way here.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> becomes extremely cautious...",
      "cn": "只见来人杀气腾腾，浑身血腥，<NL>今日来至此处，不知途中作恶几何，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见此情状，自是心生万分警惕……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b2466be16b83d23b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "52e194eb-8697-444d-a7ae-eda4c1d207da/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A battle may be inevitable...)",
      "cn": "（或许不免一战……）\n",
      "ru": "(Битва может оказаться неизбежной...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1a5f732c71987715",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "bffd86c5-7882-47d2-9a9b-d08d3b250e48/EventContent": {
      "en": "Inside the house, the sound of chickens crowing became more joyful.<NL>The Chickens rushed over, circling around the two,<NL>flapping its wings and making joyful calls. It was pecking at the rice grains with single-minded determination, yet still maintained its proud posture...",
      "cn": "屋舍之中，鸡鸣之声愈发欢快，<NL>只见元鸡埋头奔来，环绕两人足边，<NL>时而振翅扑腾，时而欢声鸣叫，一心啄食稻谷，却仍傲然昂首……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5815edf2caa30123",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bffd86c5-7882-47d2-9a9b-d08d3b250e48/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f4f47b01-1e11-4664-98ac-6fc894099bae/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi casually turned her face, her gaze seemingly lost in the distance.<NL>\"During these days, thank you for taking me in, providing me with food,<NL>taking care of my daily life,<NL>and allowing me to witness the gentle breeze and the myriad of creatures...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸轻轻侧过脸，视线却不知落于何方：<NL>“这些时日，多谢有你收留我在此，<NL>你予我饭食，照料我之起居，<NL>亦令我得见和风煦日，万物生灵……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "73784ab52e8edf1e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f4f47b01-1e11-4664-98ac-6fc894099bae/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ea13b6f0-8c5a-4031-a7cd-e8fbad10a5ea/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> knows something is amiss and looks around.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees a woman kneeling down, leaning over the body of a recently deceased woodcutter.<NL>The woodcutter's body has been dismembered, and blood stained the ground! That woman is no one else but Jixi!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，放眼望去，<NL>正看见一个女子半跪于地，俯身看着一个刚死不久的樵夫，<NL>那樵夫身首异处，鲜血流了一地！而那女子，却不是姬穸又是何人！？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "22273c44f6db0ed2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ea13b6f0-8c5a-4031-a7cd-e8fbad10a5ea/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! Why did you leave without a word...",
      "cn": "姬穸！你为何……不告而别……\n",
      "ru": "Джикси! Почему ты ушла, не сказав ни слова?..",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4e2f2742031a9504",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e53f4606-057f-4b83-b657-0b6dcb20bdcd/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You are tender-hearted and compassionate,<NL>and I am well aware of that... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你多情善感，心慈手软，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "21c68d1e15990141",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e53f4606-057f-4b83-b657-0b6dcb20bdcd/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5fd0efba-302e-4b08-9387-b9efb9029d91/EventContent": {
      "en": "The disciples of the Sanguine Sect were filled with hostility, making the situation difficult to resolve.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> chose not to engage, swiftly moving away from the crowd.",
      "cn": "血犼教弟子气势汹汹，恐难善了，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不愿应战，一个转身，便闪出了人群……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5fddf8ad4ea7fbba",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5fd0efba-302e-4b08-9387-b9efb9029d91/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Leaving quickly...)",
      "cn": "（快步离去……）\n",
      "ru": "(Быстро уходит...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "504058407e7b7f12",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d98ead6a-4a52-4e1a-8e2f-f861aa6631f1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Ah... you are proud and resolute,<NL>and I am well aware of that... Let us have done with this.<NL>Once this matter is over, your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“唉……你心高气傲，誓不甘休，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，你我多说已是无用，<NL>此间事了，日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "03d8ba71f698cdb3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d98ead6a-4a52-4e1a-8e2f-f861aa6631f1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "65c3a6ab-3443-4da9-b9f1-ab35e514cef3/EventContent": {
      "en": "Lately, there have been rumors circulating, even on the road that<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> travels...",
      "cn": "近日，忽有一传言四起，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>行路途中，亦有听闻……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d052956414079605",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "65c3a6ab-3443-4da9-b9f1-ab35e514cef3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "cb248a6b-6a79-404c-bccb-1a3c2731d361/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> frowns,<NL>not knowing when Jixi came back or when she left again.<NL>She is currently taking a walk outside, seemingly heading toward the outskirts and wandering through the woods.",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>眉头紧锁，<NL>却不知姬穸何时归来、又是何时起身，<NL>此刻正于屋外散步，似要前往山野之外，漫步林中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "89cf04540f68b515",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cb248a6b-6a79-404c-bccb-1a3c2731d361/Option_1": {
      "en": "Last night... Well, what are you going to do today?",
      "cn": "昨夜……今日你可有何要事……\n",
      "ru": "Прошлой ночью... Ну, и что ты собираешься делать сегодня?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "63d644265e65e6ee",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "40e09cf5-15c9-4c41-961a-26003ba91e07/EventContent": {
      "en": "On this day,<NL>as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is walking along the road,<NL>several disciples of the Sanguine Sect appear.<NL>It is unclear how they found out about <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s whereabouts, but they approach with an imposing manner...",
      "cn": "这一日，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>正自行路，<NL>却有数名血犼教弟子，<NL>不知自何处探得<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>行踪，气势汹汹，寻上门来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "08fb93392c6efbee",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "40e09cf5-15c9-4c41-961a-26003ba91e07/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "88012cdf-36ff-4947-a51b-bb1d7e1583ac/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I've been sleeping in the grave. How could I found some sect?<NL>They are just a group of fools who dabbled in a bit of ghost tricks and randomly tampered with the laws.<NL>They borrowed some power from me. Now that my strength is dwindling, they can't cause any waves anymore...\"<NL>Jixi said coldly, displaying clear disdain for these so-called \"fools.\"<NL>It seemed that the strength of these \"fools\" was somehow connected to her own power.",
      "cn": "“我长眠墓中，岂会是别人的祖师，<NL>不过是些妄人，窥得一二鬼道，胡乱变易法度，从我这里借了些力而已，<NL>如今我力量衰微，他们也兴不起什么风浪来……”<NL>姬穸冷冷地说道，似乎极其厌恶她口中的这些“妄人”，<NL>而那些“妄人”的功力强弱似乎也与她的力量息息相关。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "18a0d7e61ff12b8c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "88012cdf-36ff-4947-a51b-bb1d7e1583ac/Option_1": {
      "en": "If the Sanguine Sect were to learn of this, it would likely be quite hurtful...",
      "cn": "此话若为血犼教得知，恐怕会有些伤人……\n",
      "ru": "Если бы Багряная секта узнала об этом, это, вероятно, было бы весьма обидно...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "42ba18462eb4973e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dcd22979-bac7-45c9-ad75-5b912b097477/EventContent": {
      "en": "The rabbit in Jixi's hands, startled, tried to escape again.<NL>It kicked its hind legs frantically, its round eyes staring fixedly into Jixi's.<NL>Jixi pursed her lips in silence for a moment, then finally relaxed her right hand, letting the rabbit scamper away...",
      "cn": "只见姬穸手中野兔，受此惊吓，又意欲逃离，<NL>不免直蹬后腿，一双眼睛更是圆溜溜，定定望向姬穸双目，<NL>姬穸先是抿嘴不言，片刻之后，终是松开右手，任那野兔飞窜而逃……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "787fee5be1e37e19",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dcd22979-bac7-45c9-ad75-5b912b097477/Option_1": {
      "en": "Why did you let the rabbit go again?",
      "cn": "何故又放走野兔？\n",
      "ru": "Почему ты снова отпустил кролика?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2bd321c0ec493845",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f0279313-d8df-4c6f-8719-925ab131b360/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You've chosen wisely. I will spare you...<NL>With this artifact, our founder will see the light of day again...\"<NL>The Red-Robed Senior takes the bell, his grim face alight with joy as he mutters a few ominous words...",
      "cn": "“如此倒也还算识趣，今日我便放你一马……<NL>得此法器，我之祖师，必将重见天日……”<NL>红衣老人接过铃铛，阴鸷面容一时大喜，口中喃喃数语，几分不祥……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7d1ccc430c20aa2d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f0279313-d8df-4c6f-8719-925ab131b360/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "17fb8f68-7752-4595-9600-a11ac3987d7f/EventContent": {
      "en": "The person shakes the head<NL>and wears a mysterious look when saying,<NL>\"While our Yangzhou remains prosperous,<NL>the 'red-clothed ghost' is not within the city walls, yet it's causing panic...<NL>This is a long story, and if you hear the details, you may be too scared to step foot outside...\"",
      "cn": "那人闻言，徐徐摇头，<NL>又显出一副神秘鬼祟的神情说道：<NL>“我们扬州城内自然繁华，<NL>那‘红衣鬼怪’却并非出在城内，仍是闹得人心惶惶……<NL>此事说来话长，只怕你听了详细，亦是吓得再不敢出门半步……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9b3644c21534756e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "17fb8f68-7752-4595-9600-a11ac3987d7f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Asking for more details...)",
      "cn": "（细细询问……）\n",
      "ru": "(Прошу предоставить более подробную информацию...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ae628b7a90da9f97",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f2032c2b-fc55-4767-b0d5-1a35886a5f8d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You just relax...<NL>This time, I will fight for you...\"",
      "cn": "“你且安心……<NL>这一次，当是我为你而战……”",
      "ru": "- Ты просто расслабься...<NL>На этот раз я буду сражаться за тебя...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ab0bf0a360560517",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f2032c2b-fc55-4767-b0d5-1a35886a5f8d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b1032b73-84a5-4cd7-b8b1-a0a9921f23fc/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I couldn't find where my founder is... It's my regret in this lifetime...<NL>If... If I use my own body as material and remold it... maybe...\"<NL>Fresh blood flows from the old man's mouth, and his eyes widened.<NL>Before finishing his words, he has ran out of strength, leaving no signs of life...",
      "cn": "“未能寻得祖师爷所在……乃我此生之憾……<NL>若……若是以我自身为材料，炼作……或可……”<NL>汩汩鲜血自老人口中涌出，只见老人双瞳圆瞪，话语未尽，终究力竭，<NL>眨眼之间已是气息全无，回天乏术……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1476308ecbbc4eed",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b1032b73-84a5-4cd7-b8b1-a0a9921f23fc/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1f53134f-82a7-4fec-9ecf-a9aa6f51cde6/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I live here peacefully,<NL>and I also enjoy being with you day and night in this Taiwu Village...\"",
      "cn": "“我在此处，生活宁静，<NL>又能再与你朝夕共处，亦是极喜爱这太吾村……”",
      "ru": "\"Я живу здесь мирно,<NL>и мне также нравится быть с тобой днем и ночью в этой Деревне Тайу...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "727d955a80219607",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1f53134f-82a7-4fec-9ecf-a9aa6f51cde6/Option_1": {
      "en": "It seems so many years have slipped away since you first came to Taiwu Village...",
      "cn": "昔日你初来太吾村，似是已过许多岁月……\n",
      "ru": "Кажется, столько лет пролетело с тех пор, как вы впервые приехали в Деревню Тайу...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "bf08f26a81720945",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f0e70784-0b84-4999-be63-51d1d02b9f01/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"That red-robed Jiangshi...<NL>seems to be a descendant of my old friend.<NL>That friend once learned some forbidden techniques from me, and perhaps, they have been passed down until now...\"<NL>Jixi says as she extends her five fingers, forming a claw with her palm facing up.<NL>Five blood marks flashes between her fingers, resembling the martial arts of the Sanguine Sect.",
      "cn": "“那红衣老僵……<NL>似乎是我故人之后，便是你口中的血犼邪教弟子，<NL>我那位故人，曾经从我这里学了些异法，或许，流传至今……”<NL>姬穸边说，边伸出五指，掌心向上成爪，<NL>五道血痕便从她指间闪过，望之极似血犼教之功法。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e5ac383a50fa9997",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f0e70784-0b84-4999-be63-51d1d02b9f01/Option_1": {
      "en": "Could it be that you are the Sanguine founder mentioned by the Red-Robed Senior?",
      "cn": "莫非，你便是那红衣老人口中的血犼祖师？\n",
      "ru": "Может ли быть так, что вы и есть тот самый Сангвиничный основатель, о котором упоминал Старший в Красном одеянии?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ea781042f3ad513f",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "a64a516b-f3f7-4b65-add8-8c6dd450eba9/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2643a1c2-68b9-4dcb-b81d-9e87e81ce1e8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Working at sunrise and resting at sunset,<NL>I have seen this beautiful sight before...\"<NL>Jixi stopped speaking at this point,<NL>her gaze fixes on a distant place, seemingly unwilling to say more...",
      "cn": "“日出而作，日落而息，<NL>此种好景，旧时我也曾见过……”<NL>话至此处，姬穸却是止住话语，<NL>目光不知看向远处何方，似已不愿多言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "45ad2c5b30d91516",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2643a1c2-68b9-4dcb-b81d-9e87e81ce1e8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(In silence...)",
      "cn": "（无言相伴……）\n",
      "ru": "(В тишине...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "549af62e169a49de",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7b760f96-ecab-40ad-a9af-7fc00baae8d0/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Even in this dangerous place, I can still find peace.<NL>You don't have to worry about me...\"",
      "cn": "“此处纵是刀山火海，我亦能够安身，<NL>你且不必担心我……”",
      "ru": "\"Даже в этом опасном месте я все еще могу обрести покой.<NL>Тебе не нужно беспокоиться обо мне...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "d4823d4767ace196",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7b760f96-ecab-40ad-a9af-7fc00baae8d0/Option_1": {
      "en": "Are you truly fearless?",
      "cn": "你果真什么也不怕？\n",
      "ru": "Вы действительно бесстрашны?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "19cc7f1ecbec4a13",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7d72a28f-3b2f-4948-9c15-fa760639c65a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Without hesitation, Jixi nods at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, saying,<NL>\"I have long since slept in the ancient tomb. I am no longer a living person, and I naturally need to feed on human blood to survive...<NL>Before, because of my unbearable hunger, I went out at midnight and tasted the blood of several people in your village...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸却是未有迟疑，<NL>只望着<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，点头道：<NL>“我长眠古墓，早非活人，自然需吸食人血为生……<NL>此前确是我难耐饥饿，夜半外出，便尝了你村中几人之鲜血……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0506668f080ee64b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7d72a28f-3b2f-4948-9c15-fa760639c65a/Option_1": {
      "en": "No... it couldn't be you!",
      "cn": "不……岂会是你？！\n",
      "ru": "Нет... это не мог быть ты!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "dbf5a156fd894c36",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0d4e61ed-b2c2-4898-893c-fef44dc0f01e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Seeing this,<NL>the people around panicked and scattered, fleeing in every direction.<NL>The Sanguine Sect disciples laughed heartily, satisfied with the display of power, and then left.<NL><NL>After the chaos, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> finds it difficult to gather any more information about the ghostly incidents.<NL>It seems that <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> would have to investigate again another day...",
      "cn": "周围众人见此，<NL>皆惊慌失措，四散而逃，<NL>那血犼教弟子哈哈大笑，见已尽显威风，心满意足而去，<NL><NL>一场骚乱之后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>也难以再打探消息，<NL>鬼怪之事，看来只得择日再探了……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "56a8bbbc0cfd8c07",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0d4e61ed-b2c2-4898-893c-fef44dc0f01e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So be it...)",
      "cn": "（只得如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Да будет так...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "76bb94ba87e9e5c3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "574193bc-7ca4-4edb-94fa-50526b07eab5/EventContent": {
      "en": "It turned out that a few days ago,<NL>a disciple of the Sanguine Sect happened to discover the ancient tomb of the Sect's founder<NL>while patrolling outside the mountains!<NL><NL>Driven by ambition, he rallied his fellows to unseal the tomb and venture deep within.<NL>They had hoped to uncover their founder's legendary legacy, only to find the chambers barren and devoid of any treasure...",
      "cn": "原来，几日之前，<NL>曾有血犼教中弟子，巡查教外山林之时，<NL>机缘巧合，竟寻得血犼教祖师古墓！<NL><NL>此人纠集众多弟子，重开墓门，入内细探，<NL>本以为能得祖师真传，却不料墓中空空，一无所获……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "54a1d4b80d643628",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "574193bc-7ca4-4edb-94fa-50526b07eab5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c795711a-1e51-4dba-9efc-dc0ae3fc298a/EventContent": {
      "en": "There is no time for words. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> moves to shield Jixi,<NL>pulling her clear of the ambush. As they steady themselves,<NL>they find a familiar black-and-red form—the Red-Robed Senior! He emerges from the shadows, more a corpse than before!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>未及多言，只挡在姬穸身前，<NL>携她一同闪过这始料未及的突袭，待得回过神来，定睛一望，<NL>眼前黑红身影分外眼熟，竟是已然更似尸鬼的红衣老人，不知从何处现身！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "98305e6c061d83f0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c795711a-1e51-4dba-9efc-dc0ae3fc298a/Option_1": {
      "en": "The Red-Robed Senior emerges from the ancient tomb!",
      "cn": "红衣老人竟出得古墓！\n",
      "ru": "Старейшина в Красном выходит из древней гробницы!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "157a94ddef05e4f9",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "33c0b5d2-560c-4c96-9841-cd9e3f913efc/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The villagers' deaths... the signs...<NL>It must be the Ultimate Yin Jiangshi in its hunt for me. It has broken free from the tomb, hiding in Taiwu Village...\"<NL>Hearing Jixi's blunt confession and the truth of the villagers' fate,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s mind reels, a tumult of emotions warring within <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>...",
      "cn": "“如今我见村人丧命，种种迹象，<NL>必是那太阴老尸为了寻我，破墓而出，潜入了太吾村中……”<NL>见姬穸毫无隐瞒，坦然承认，又提及村人遇害之事，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时思绪混杂，心中种种想法，起伏不定……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ed309814d029c420",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/Option_1": {
      "en": "Though you are not ordinary, your integrity runs deep. Now is the perfect time for us to join hands and eliminate that Jiangshi Senior...",
      "cn": "你虽非常人，但身正心直，此时正可与我携手，除去那僵尸老人……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fa02499bc6770446",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/Option_2": {
      "en": "So that's the truth! I know your goodness, unlike that Jiangshi Senior who dares harm the innocent...",
      "cn": "竟是如此！我知你心存善念，不似那僵尸老人，竟如此害人性命……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f064c7aac4adadb4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/Option_3": {
      "en": "Our paths are worlds apart—human and ghost. Even if we defeat that Jiangshi, what future is there for us together?",
      "cn": "人鬼殊途，无可奈何，即便除了那老人，今后你我又当如何共处……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ef3cea96314250a8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/Option_4": {
      "en": "Why should this matter bother us? That troublesome Jiangshi may be a plague, but today, I'll willingly take this fight for your sake...",
      "cn": "此事何碍？这僵尸老人虽是麻烦，今日我且为你主动招惹一回……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2e035779ae7b8cc6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff1b28aa-e530-4337-87fc-49f1aae7468e/Option_5": {
      "en": "Oh? So that brazen Jiangshi dares to challenge me again and again...",
      "cn": "哦？这僵尸老人竟是胆大包天，胆敢一而再，再而三来犯于我……\n",
      "ru": "Ой? Итак, этот наглый Цзянши осмеливается бросать мне вызов снова и снова...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5974134f3af208ed",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c2d7c35e-fa5d-4cea-9c15-8701ae97352a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's eyes became distant, lost in thought:<NL>\"The pain of consuming human flesh against my will... and the suffering of being separated from you...<NL>I understand them deeply... Now, I can finally find peace...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸眼神空茫，不知所望何处：<NL>“违心食人之痛……与你别离……之苦，<NL>我知之甚深……如今终于……得以安宁……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5e184ed270fabfe3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c2d7c35e-fa5d-4cea-9c15-8701ae97352a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9a3ce36a-7a60-461e-900b-f55f67ced7d5/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I just told you that I did indeed consume blood, but every time I thought of you,<NL>I suppress my bloodthirst and withdraw,<NL>making some noise to attract your attention, hoping that you would discover the wounded and heal them...\"",
      "cn": "“我刚刚已向你言明，确有吸食人血之事，<NL>只是每每思及你，方才按捺渴血之意，抽身而去，<NL>作出些许动静引你注意，亦是盼你早日发现伤者，为其疗伤……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c3e9cb08af6c74b4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9a3ce36a-7a60-461e-900b-f55f67ced7d5/Option_1": {
      "en": "So those sounds... It was you...",
      "cn": "那些动静……原是你有意为之……\n",
      "ru": "Итак, эти звуки... Это был ты...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "85f6c2b15b51c94e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c9d14015-d389-43d4-a7f6-113face5c63b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Got buried. Obviously...\"",
      "cn": "“自然是被人埋进去的……”",
      "ru": "\"Был похоронен. Очевидно...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "daede0b156742281",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c9d14015-d389-43d4-a7f6-113face5c63b/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f1a2cb8a-fca3-4dc5-817d-5354b79ac9e7/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You don't need to understand.<NL>My loved one has passed away, leaving me alone...<NL>Just as I expected.\"The person in front of me had a sorrowful expression and muttered a few words before falling into silence, no longer showing any emotions...",
      "cn": "“你亦不必听懂，<NL>我之故人，如今已逝，此后不过再余我孤独一人……”<NL>只见眼前之人神色微恸，喃喃数语后，终是归于寂静，再无波澜……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "55a2bf60557378ce",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f1a2cb8a-fca3-4dc5-817d-5354b79ac9e7/Option_1": {
      "en": "Now... where do you want to go?",
      "cn": "如今……你要去往何处……\n",
      "ru": "Сейчас... куда ты хочешь пойти?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8ed05a8fbf51a93b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "52672b84-4f76-4224-b852-f2c3832e25e1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I am delighted by both you and Taiwu Village...<NL>However, the world is ever-changing, and nothing lasts forever.<NL>Today, I will sacrifice myself for you, as a gratitude for your company, fulfilling my final wish...\"",
      "cn": "“你与太吾村，我皆甚是欢喜，<NL>只是阴晴圆缺，世上圆满终无长久，<NL>今日此战，我舍身为你，就当是谢你朝夕相伴，圆我一梦……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3d026b4be5e1abe4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "52672b84-4f76-4224-b852-f2c3832e25e1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": "(Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9f020028-7294-4e15-9ae3-efebd6545ba9/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Eat slower... There's not much left...\"<NL>Although Jixi seemed uneasy, she focused on feeding the chicken,<NL>and for some reason, began to speak to the chicken in a low, gentle voice...",
      "cn": "“你且吃慢一些……再多可就没有了……”<NL>只见姬穸虽是跼蹐不安，亦是专心喂食，<NL>不知何故，竟低声与那元鸡细细对话起来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "997319aeb6337fb8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9f020028-7294-4e15-9ae3-efebd6545ba9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Watch with a smile...)",
      "cn": "（含笑旁观……）\n",
      "ru": "(Наблюдайте с улыбкой...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "20827e7f4c2bf9ba",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dc18e38a-e6fc-4155-a7dd-451d038607ba/EventContent": {
      "en": "Ignoring the sense of loss and filled with doubt,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks around and sees a crow carrying a message flying toward the dark clouds in the north...",
      "cn": "顾不得怅然有失，满心疑虑，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>举目四望，只见送信的乌鸦正往北面阴云密布之处飞去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6126f43897915649",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dc18e38a-e6fc-4155-a7dd-451d038607ba/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Following the direction of the crow...)",
      "cn": "（循着乌鸦的方向追去……）\n",
      "ru": "(Следуя указаниям вороны...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "bbc5e5d4d6443937",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "101c79fc-4652-4407-96c6-005e89346aa2/EventContent": {
      "en": "Bizarre occurrences plague Taiwu Village, and now some innocent lie dead.<NL>Upon the careful investigation of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, it seems that Jixi may be involved...",
      "cn": "如今太吾村中怪事连连，更有村人遇害枉死，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>细思调查至今，种种迹象，<NL>只觉此事或与姬穸脱不了干系……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fe8d7d6b4cbb0dcf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "101c79fc-4652-4407-96c6-005e89346aa2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Wonder if Jixi truly knows about it...)",
      "cn": "（不知姬穸是否当真知情……）\n",
      "ru": "(Интересно, действительно ли Джикси знает об этом...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "573e0e64116407a7",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "798851e9-0c9c-4bf8-8bc1-113ec098ac6a/EventContent": {
      "en": "The Red-Robed Senior is no match for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>.<NL>He retreats, his posture stiff and strange, as if trying to escape...",
      "cn": "只见红衣老人与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>几番交手，实在不敌，<NL>竟脚尖竖直、跳跃后退，其姿态诡异僵直，仿若意欲逃之夭夭……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "223ae899f5ad6867",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "798851e9-0c9c-4bf8-8bc1-113ec098ac6a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So be it...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Да будет так...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "76bb94ba87e9e5c3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "3ee73ab6-354e-467d-94fb-7732b4cfa541/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The object remains, but the person does not exist anymore...<NL>I should have known. The past and the old dreams are nothing but emptiness. His life and fate can never be continued...\"",
      "cn": "“其物如故，其人不存……<NL>我早该知晓，前尘旧梦本为空，他生因缘自难续……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dac5aedfc22cae5e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3ee73ab6-354e-467d-94fb-7732b4cfa541/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Doesn't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": "(Не понимает смысла...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8402620a8c17d479",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "aa2c4a10-c423-4b3d-9e2c-c64956ffe097/EventContent": {
      "en": "The person keeps shaking the head<NL>and mysteriously says,<NL>\"It's alright, it's alright. Since you don't know about the 'red robed ghost' matter, there's no need to worry...<NL>This is a long story, and I'm afraid if you know the details, you won't dare to step out of the house.\"",
      "cn": "那人闻言，连连摆手，<NL>又显出一副神秘鬼祟的神情说道：<NL>“无妨无妨，你既然不知‘红衣鬼怪’之事，又何来唐突……<NL>此事说来话长，只怕你听了详细，亦是吓得再不敢出门半步……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2da47b8b8680eeb4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aa2c4a10-c423-4b3d-9e2c-c64956ffe097/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Asking for more details...)",
      "cn": "（细细询问……）\n",
      "ru": "(Прошу предоставить более подробную информацию...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ae628b7a90da9f97",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ca9564a1-33a2-4068-ac95-70f92d20510d/EventContent": {
      "en": "The branches and grass rustled as the beast was about to pounce!<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> immediately turned sideways to shield Jixi, protecting her behind <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject />self.",
      "cn": "草木摇晃，猛兽即要扑来！<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>旋即侧身，挡在姬穸身前，将其护在身后，<NL>未及片时，那猛兽便已现于眼前——",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "88678f857f52c007",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ca9564a1-33a2-4068-ac95-70f92d20510d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Prepare for battle!)",
      "cn": "（准备应战！）\n",
      "ru": "(Приготовиться к битве!)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "de117969fcd6967e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "36b7f3af-aee0-4da9-803c-0c80be9868ce/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi has become a ghost...<NL>If she continues to feed on humans and stays in this world,<NL>not only would the innocent suffer, but she would also experience the agony of going against her own nature.<NL>Caught between loyalty and morality, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot just sit back idly...",
      "cn": "姬穸已是妖鬼，<NL>若终将食人为生，再留她于世，<NL>不仅世人何其无辜，她亦要受尽违心食人之苦，<NL>情义两难，进退不得，事已至此，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>绝难坐视不理……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fb343eaf9bc5c085",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "36b7f3af-aee0-4da9-803c-0c80be9868ce/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7b663bf7-2ff7-4134-a512-6c31a33c7f8e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Is this... a fox?<NL>I've heard that there are fox spirits in the Qingqiu Mountains, with beautiful tails and cunning intelligence...<NL>Yes, this suits me well. Thank you for finding it for me...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi seems to have a great fondness for the Ancient Jade Fox...)</color>",
      "cn": "“此物……可是狐狸？<NL>听闻青丘之山，生有灵狐，丰尾绰约，狡猾多智……<NL>不错，此物甚合我之心意，多谢你特意为我寻来……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸似乎非常喜爱古老的玉狐狸……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dac02e010be1e353",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7b663bf7-2ff7-4134-a512-6c31a33c7f8e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d9b28b7d-cb45-4892-86df-de4847c6dba2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Is this... a butterfly?<NL>In spring, red butterflies often compete in flight, leaving fragrance in the air as they drink dew and rest on flowers...<NL>Yes, this suits me well. Thank you for finding it for me...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi seems to have a great fondness for the Ancient Jade Butterfly...)</color>",
      "cn": "“此物……可是蝴蝶？<NL>春来日暖，便常有红蝶争飞，蝶粉遗香，饮露宿花……<NL>不错，此物甚合我之心意，多谢你特意为我寻来……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸似乎非常喜爱古老的玉蝴蝶……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9ab917dc60b2ed8b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d9b28b7d-cb45-4892-86df-de4847c6dba2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "70954c3d-2589-4930-861b-afc291146744/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Ah...\"<NL>Jixi didn't answer, only shakes her head with a long sigh, her gaze fixed intently on <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "“唉……”<NL>问及此处，姬穸却摇头不语，只深深凝望<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，长叹一声……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0e661470f287a37f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "70954c3d-2589-4930-861b-afc291146744/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Doesn't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": "(Не понимает смысла...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8402620a8c17d479",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2a46bd5c-1f6a-4286-8857-7878371a9d4d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...<NL>Now that we part ways, we may never meet again.<NL>You know that I am the Lord of Ghosts, yet you free me. Since you are so bold... would you dare let me bite you?\"",
      "cn": "“<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>……<NL>此次一别，或难再见，<NL>你既已知我乃鬼王，却仍敢放我离去，既有此胆，可敢任我咬你一口？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "545d6ce58c91c3ae",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2a46bd5c-1f6a-4286-8857-7878371a9d4d/Option_1": {
      "en": "I know you, so why would I fear?",
      "cn": "我知你晓你，有何不敢？\n",
      "ru": "Я знаю тебя, так чего же мне бояться?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "009f7e36d01014f6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "90e3fba9-635b-47e6-b855-52f44bf0fb08/EventContent": {
      "en": "Recently, there have been rumors circulating wherever <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> passes by:<NL>There is a wild grave near the Sanguine Sect.<NL>No one knows who's buried there, but it's known for being deeply unnatural and shrouded in mystery. They say a ghost crawls out of it every night...",
      "cn": "近日以来，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>途经之处，常有耳闻：<NL>传言血犼教近处有一野坟，所埋不知何人，<NL>妖异非常，诡秘莫测，夜里更有鬼怪破坟而出……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d58e6f727fe18b6d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "90e3fba9-635b-47e6-b855-52f44bf0fb08/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Sounds somewhat familiar...)",
      "cn": "（听来几分耳熟……）\n",
      "ru": "(Звучит несколько знакомо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c7a0dbb305fca66b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "abb7afb8-5cce-4ae6-9343-91936ac18404/EventContent": {
      "en": "Furthermore, a wave of villagers have arrived, their hearts softened by pity for the young Jixi.<NL>They've brought new clothes for all seasons and homemade food,<NL>treating her like a lonely child and attending to her every need...",
      "cn": "此间话语未尽，便又有村中乡亲，因听闻姬穸年幼心生怜意而来，<NL>既送来四季新衣，又有家中自作吃食，<NL>似将姬穸看作孤犊孩童，嘘寒问暖，无微不至……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "59bef092cdd4bb59",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "abb7afb8-5cce-4ae6-9343-91936ac18404/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "938c7b2d-8e87-4d99-8bc1-a617633bc5a5/EventContent": {
      "en": "After experiencing these events, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> believes that the rumors about ghostly shadows in Yangzhou City has been dispelled.<NL>The terrifying incidents turned out to be mere hearsay. However, the true intentions behind the Red-Robed Senior's words remained a mystery...",
      "cn": "经此一事，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只道扬州城鬼影传言已破，<NL>邪祟骇人之事，不过是流言风传，<NL>只是不知，红衣老人口中大计，究竟为何……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b4736fe927e25bf4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "938c7b2d-8e87-4d99-8bc1-a617633bc5a5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A sense of unease...)",
      "cn": "（隐隐不安……）\n",
      "ru": "(Чувство неловкости...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "11d23c69f4fa2733",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "16614e50-dfad-4740-9899-a7848c16acb3/EventContent": {
      "en": "The gentle breeze and endless birdsong of Yangzhou, together with the painted boats on the river,<NL>create a view so lovely that it should have been the perfect escape from worries...",
      "cn": "扬州城内，清风拂面，莺语连绵，<NL>江上画舫悠悠，满目风光正好，正该是一处忘忧之地……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d92f95f69d6a3807",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "16614e50-dfad-4740-9899-a7848c16acb3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Strolling down the street...)",
      "cn": "（漫步街头……）\n",
      "ru": "(Прогуливаясь по улице...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4c8e47dda55d8fc2",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f2ff50fd-c29e-4413-a8f1-b405d37d0a25/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, the Red-Robed Senior becomes even more formidable.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> senses the danger and breaks into a cold sweat. However, just at that moment,<NL>Jixi, who has been protecting <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, steps forward and stands between <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> and the Red-Robed Senior...",
      "cn": "此时的红衣老人，比之从前，更为难缠，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，冷汗已下，却就在此时，<NL>方才护在身后的姬穸已然闪身而出，挡在<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与僵尸老人之间……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ef9064241da5f92f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f2ff50fd-c29e-4413-a8f1-b405d37d0a25/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! No!",
      "cn": "姬穸！不可如此！\n",
      "ru": "Джикси! Нет!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4aabe7eef748e3a3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "bf6b2c2e-ff46-43b9-af25-4b36dd382669/EventContent": {
      "en": "Even as a hollowed corpse, the Red-Robed Senior is still laid low by <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>.<NL>But before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s smile can form, the senior remains motionless—<NL>his fatal wounds healed in an instant, as if never touched by blade...",
      "cn": "纵已化为活尸，那红衣老人仍败于<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>之手！<NL>不待<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>面露喜色，却见老人呆立原地，<NL>浑身伤势转眼愈合，竟如毫发无损一般……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "54d35e97acc7eb14",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bf6b2c2e-ff46-43b9-af25-4b36dd382669/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Bewildered...)",
      "cn": "（不明所以……）\n",
      "ru": "(Сбитый с толку...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c37585dc680aa205",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "3b130c02-a2dd-4b18-b582-426637a72aca/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Do not speak further...<NL>When you awakened me in your past life, you have already witnessed it,\"<NL>Jixi whispers lightly, hinting at many things left unsaid.",
      "cn": "“多说无益……<NL>你的前世，昔日你唤醒我时，就已见过了……”<NL>姬穸轻声道，似有许多言语，不便细说。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "db9baf1e8d0070d8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3b130c02-a2dd-4b18-b582-426637a72aca/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f65f4fe8-fc61-4bed-844e-08a51b9bb101/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Your high and mighty demeanor, your deep schemes and calculations,<NL>how could I be unaware... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你心高气傲，深谋远计，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c9353b0929f4f7d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f65f4fe8-fc61-4bed-844e-08a51b9bb101/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6ad75601-ea57-4df2-a362-ccf8392f74d6/EventContent": {
      "en": "Feeling astonished, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> turns around, only to see Jixi frowning and rushing toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>, teeth bared, as if she is about to bite <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> neck...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>诧异之间，回过头去，<NL>却见姬穸蹙眉之间，面露几分得色，竟朝自己直扑而来，<NL>须臾利齿现出，似是要一口咬在自己侧颈之上……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "05e9cc7b98a04088",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ad75601-ea57-4df2-a362-ccf8392f74d6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": "(Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d995bc9b-3863-4b00-9a1f-bcd58eca526f/EventContent": {
      "en": "The Red-Robed Senior sees <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s hesitation and continues with arrogance,<NL>\"The sounds of the bell had me convinced my work was nearly complete.<NL>To think the bell would be stolen by you... you have ruined everything I've built...\"",
      "cn": "红衣老人见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>神情动摇，自是倨傲，<NL>又再说道：“近日闻得铃动，本以为秘法将成，<NL>却不料这法器竟叫你给夺了去，倒叫你坏了我等大计……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "abececfbe9327e80",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d995bc9b-3863-4b00-9a1f-bcd58eca526f/Option_1": {
      "en": "Refining corpses... It sounds like an extremely wicked and forbidden practice that goes against the nature...",
      "cn": "炼化尸体，听来竟似逆天邪法……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4a0af218bedb6824",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ea4ff01b-ab28-49aa-99dd-6b9c1ebb3aea/EventContent": {
      "en": "As it turned out, a few days ago,<NL>disciples from the Sanguine Sect discovered the vacant tomb of their founder.<NL>Bitter and seeking answers, they were led by the rumor: Successor of Taiwu was traveling the lands, slaying demons and monsters.<NL>They concluded that since their founder was the Lord of Ghosts, their disappearance must be related to Successor of Taiwu...",
      "cn": "原来，几日之前，<NL>血犼教中弟子探得祖师空墓，心有不甘，<NL>更不知自何处听得消息，称太吾传人游走四方，斩妖除魔，<NL>墓中既有血犼教之祖师，必是鬼怪之祖，如今失踪必与太吾传人有关……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b61c06d445f0e1dc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ea4ff01b-ab28-49aa-99dd-6b9c1ebb3aea/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0724bdf7-0cc8-426c-894e-a410b8b6b1d1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Rumors say that some have seen a ghostly figure.<NL>This figure is dressed in red, likely stained with human blood.<NL>It's unclear whether it's the spirit of someone who died unjustly or a thousand-year-old monster that eats people.<NL>But what's certain is that anyone who encounters this 'ghostly figure' on the road will never return...\"<NL>A cold sweat breaks out on the informant as he recounts the horror. Around him, a wave of uneasy murmurs spread through the crowd.",
      "cn": "“传言道，有人曾见鬼影，<NL>此‘鬼怪’身着红衣，必是人血浸染，<NL>不知是枉死的魂作祟，还是千年的妖食人，<NL>只晓得路上行人若见了‘鬼怪’，便是再不得归返……”<NL>知情人说到此处，已是冷汗连连，旁侧诸人更是议论纷纷……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4be03d7db23c23f1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0724bdf7-0cc8-426c-894e-a410b8b6b1d1/Option_1": {
      "en": "How many people have fallen victim to this \"ghostly figure\" remains unknown...",
      "cn": "如此“鬼怪”，不知如今有几人遇害……\n",
      "ru": "Сколько людей стало жертвами этой \"призрачной фигуры\", остается неизвестным...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "db283af95344f778",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "533ad431-52e8-405f-8c9f-009272c9277f/EventContent": {
      "en": "Upon hearing this, Jixi also recalls the past,<NL>showing a hint of melancholy as she talks with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> about the ancient tomb...<NL><NL>\"Fortunately, we sealed that Red-Robed Senior in the tomb, which brings us today's tranquility...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸听闻此言，亦是忆起旧日，<NL>不免流露几分怅然之色，与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>叙起昔日古墓之事……<NL><NL>“所幸当日将那红衣老人封在墓中，方有今日宁静……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e39dadea19a390c3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "533ad431-52e8-405f-8c9f-009272c9277f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(If only that senior would remain entombed there forever...)",
      "cn": "（若那老人再无出墓之日，便好了……）\n",
      "ru": "(Если бы только этот старший остался погребенным там навсегда...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9d9b83061e91bb1c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "4f8b8948-1fc7-4818-9136-d74fa652fe37/EventContent": {
      "en": "Seeing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is victorious, Jixi sags in relief.<NL>Just as she's about to collapse, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> turns around, supporting her and sitting by her side...",
      "cn": "眼见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>得胜，姬穸亦是浑身一松，<NL>摇摇欲坠之时，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>立时回身而来，伸手搀扶，又与她并肩席地而坐……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "045cd9c592aae09e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4f8b8948-1fc7-4818-9136-d74fa652fe37/Option_1": {
      "en": "It seems this matter is finally resolved... Are you alright?",
      "cn": "此事总算已了……你可有大碍……\n",
      "ru": "Похоже, этот вопрос наконец решен... Ты в порядке?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ced66d1121b97ef3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d624352d-070e-43db-8773-5644676cb0d9/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You've deviated from the right path, indulging your desires.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你离经叛道，从心所欲，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1ed5c76f44dfafb5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d624352d-070e-43db-8773-5644676cb0d9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9df1af76-71cf-48bc-bf67-eac57ef4ae9b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The sound of the bell led me here. That bell clearly comes from you!<NL>Your sweet words won't deceive me. I advise you not to underestimate me...\"",
      "cn": "“铃音响动，我循音而至，那铃铛分明在你身上！<NL>你这般花言巧语，骗我不得，劝你莫要不识抬举……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d215443a78d27244",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9df1af76-71cf-48bc-bf67-eac57ef4ae9b/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6620d458-a8d1-493c-9939-a696c21db755/EventContent": {
      "en": "In the desperate fight, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> manages to strike a final blow.<NL>His iron defense compromised by Jixi, the Red-Robed Senior has reached his limit.<NL>His body crumbles into countless pieces, returning to dust in the end!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>拼死一战，直至最后使出奋力一击，<NL>那红衣老人被姬穸破了钢筋铁骨，再受不得，<NL>竟是躯体崩裂，碎尸万段，终归于尘土之中！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "aea86827ea23c08a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6620d458-a8d1-493c-9939-a696c21db755/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "af5704c7-dd39-480d-bb5a-03c7bc951477/EventContent": {
      "en": "Silence has returned to the world around <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>.<NL>The earth is still, and the battle with the Red-Robed Senior now seems a fleeting dream.<NL>Yet the scent of blood and a grave of raw earth remain as a testament to the brutal reality...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>眼前已然重归寂静，<NL>泥土再无异动，此前与那红衣老人一战，亦恍若幻梦，<NL>唯有鼻间血腥之气，与那土堆自成之野坟，绝无虚假……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ea2a3ae9ce8bfe37",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "af5704c7-dd39-480d-bb5a-03c7bc951477/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This whole situation is truly bizarre...)",
      "cn": "（此事实在怪异……）\n",
      "ru": "(Вся эта ситуация действительно странная...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "080b21f35d0b2240",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "17541a2d-74c8-4a14-b7ad-355cfaa1db52/EventContent": {
      "en": "Everything about the Red-Robed Senior is unnatural.<NL>A single glance is all it takes for the realization to strike <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>:<NL>Jixi consumed blood, but never murdered.<NL>The murderer is this Jiangshi Senior right in front of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>!",
      "cn": "只见那红衣老人周身迹象，皆不寻常，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只多瞧一眼，便转瞬了悟，<NL>姬穸虽曾吸食人血，却未伤人性命，害人性命者，便是眼前这僵尸老人！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5775c1111fdcb2a7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "17541a2d-74c8-4a14-b7ad-355cfaa1db52/Option_1": {
      "en": "You wicked ghost! You deserve to die!",
      "cn": "你这恶鬼！死不足惜！\n",
      "ru": "Ты злой призрак! Ты заслуживаешь смерти!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6ed553bf70bd721c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "65644051-b654-4b25-a205-4410c15149d8/EventContent": {
      "en": "Upon hearing this, the man sighs deeply<NL>and assumes a mysterious and elusive expression as he says,<NL>\"So you still don't know about the 'red robed ghost'...<NL>This is a long story, and if I were to tell you all the details, you might be too frightened to step out of your door ever again...\"",
      "cn": "那人闻言，深深叹气，<NL>又显出一副神秘鬼祟的神情说道：<NL>“原来你竟不知‘红衣鬼怪’之事……<NL>此事说来话长，只怕你听了详细，亦是吓得再不敢出门半步……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2129361d9b6312e7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "65644051-b654-4b25-a205-4410c15149d8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Asking for more details...)",
      "cn": "（细细询问……）\n",
      "ru": "(Прошу предоставить более подробную информацию...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ae628b7a90da9f97",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "792b6fcf-c66f-42e3-8886-095b5e3268ce/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh? If that's the case,<NL>then be careful...\"<NL>Jixi's brow twitched. She whispered and listened intently.<NL>The commotion from the beast was considerable, shaking the branches and startling the birds from the forest.<NL>Observing the rustling greenery and listening closely, they couldn't tell what kind of beast was approaching...",
      "cn": "“哦？既是如此，<NL>你且小心……”<NL>姬穸眉头微动，低语一声，亦凝神细听，<NL>此兽动静不小，竟使林间枝叶摇晃，飞鸟出林，<NL>静观草木形迹，两人侧耳分辨之际，不知是何野兽已逐渐逼近……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c7192a69ea4093de",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "792b6fcf-c66f-42e3-8886-095b5e3268ce/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Protect Jixi!)",
      "cn": "（保护姬穸！）\n",
      "ru": "(Защити Джикси!)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "61f73484e7d04267",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "19d5bd44-d0e5-4bf0-ab81-66e8507a3d22/EventContent": {
      "en": "The disciples of the Sanguine Sect are no match for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>.<NL>Seeing the unfavorable situation, they retreat a few steps and scurry away in fear...",
      "cn": "那血犼教弟子一时不敌<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，<NL>见势不妙，竟后退数步，抱头鼠窜而去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ebdb9d102ec373cf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "19d5bd44-d0e5-4bf0-ab81-66e8507a3d22/Option_1": {
      "en": "(What a bunch of cowards...)",
      "cn": "（妖魔小丑，全无骨气……）\n",
      "ru": "(Что за сборище трусов...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "262809b7e784a446",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2403ee46-fee4-49de-a438-6fa5cfb3d61f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"However, you did... um, someone once claimed: 'The Path of Ghosts too can reach the divine.<NL>People who seek enlightenment in the sea of blood and seek truth amidst all evils may still attain perfection!'\"<NL>Jixi says, then adds softly that she still did not believe it...",
      "cn": "“不过，你……那人曾说过：‘鬼道之力，亦通神佛，<NL>世人自血海中悟道，于万恶里求真，也未必不能修成正果！’”<NL>姬穸说，说完又补充道，此话她仍是不信的……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6eb8dcd8073e5b04",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2403ee46-fee4-49de-a438-6fa5cfb3d61f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e1a51519-39f8-4236-8b7e-b13b12f64fd2/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi nods at first, but then shakes her head.<NL>\"I am no longer among the living. My appearance may never age.<NL>If we were to delve into it, my age would be several hundred times your own...<NL>Nevertheless, you can just think of me as a ghost lady from the tomb. Even if I were to revive, the separation between our realms would remain.<NL>There is no need to worry about me like a child...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸先是点头，复又摇头：<NL>“我已非活人，自是容颜不老，<NL>若要细细论起来，我之年岁，当是如今你的数百倍……<NL>也罢，你只当我是墓中女鬼，纵然重又苏生，仍是阴阳两隔，<NL>更无须再将我视作稚子，百般忧心……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "55e0b5ff86158242",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e1a51519-39f8-4236-8b7e-b13b12f64fd2/Option_1": {
      "en": "Though she says this... I still can't help but worry...",
      "cn": "话虽如此……仍难放心……\n",
      "ru": "Хотя она так говорит... Я все еще не могу избавиться от беспокойства...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b4e084818f6a4d00",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "64aa091c-244f-4953-abbb-60aae1c64327/EventContent": {
      "en": "Taking advantage of Jixi's distraction, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> manages to slip away from the battle.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> turns around, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> isn't sure if it's because <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> couldn't bring <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>self to harm Jixi or because <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> couldn't win against her...",
      "cn": "趁姬穸不备，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>竟从战中抽身逃跑，<NL>转身之际，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>亦不知自己究竟是难敌姬穸，还是终难下手……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e91d61db3733ce6f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "64aa091c-244f-4953-abbb-60aae1c64327/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "63c5db44-cebd-4ccd-8b7a-869cbf050b5e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Knowing that <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> has made up <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> mind,<NL>Jixi relaxes and nods gently.<NL><NL>The calm farewell is almost tearing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> apart. To act now is an agony beyond any blade...",
      "cn": "姬穸既知<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>决意，<NL>竟是神情放松，轻轻点头，别离之际，何其平静……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只觉心如刀绞，终到动手之时，更如切肤之痛……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7f706a6c760343b9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "63c5db44-cebd-4ccd-8b7a-869cbf050b5e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "bcbcaeed-7804-45ba-ba49-520b030d1cb8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It would probably be happy to have some food...\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> immediately fetched some chicken feed and started scattering it with Jixi.<NL>Jixi was still wary and unwilling to get too close, but judging by her expression, she didn't seem to dislike it...",
      "cn": "“若有食物，想必它亦会欢喜……”<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>旋即取来元鸡饲料，与姬穸一道抛撒喂食，<NL>姬穸虽仍是警惕不已，不愿太过靠近，但观其面色，却也不似厌恶……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a674a76352eb2b5a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bcbcaeed-7804-45ba-ba49-520b030d1cb8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Feed the chickens together...)",
      "cn": "（一同喂鸡……）\n",
      "ru": "(Покормите цыплят вместе...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f28c307ff75e3da9",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ced9615a-9efd-4bb9-b635-71ab991712f8/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"I have long anticipated what the future holds,<NL>since I am already dead, there is no need to regret anything...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“日后如何，我早有意料，<NL>既然我乃已死之人，自然再无可惜遗憾之事……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1abbb63838c86412",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ced9615a-9efd-4bb9-b635-71ab991712f8/Option_1": {
      "en": "If you were prepared for this, then it is for the best...",
      "cn": "你若早有准备，亦是好事……\n",
      "ru": "Если вы были готовы к этому, то это к лучшему...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b68fa269606e1265",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b4e09b71-bd14-4f75-9a4e-ccf3464fbce8/EventContent": {
      "en": "As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is about to turn around, there is a faint and crisp sound from the shadows,<NL>followed by a peculiar object falling to the ground as the bones disintegrate...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>正欲转身之时，阴翳之中，隐约有清脆之响，<NL>原来是一奇特之物，随白骨消散而坠落在地……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "695b13e14a0ac2fe",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4e09b71-bd14-4f75-9a4e-ccf3464fbce8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Go and check...)",
      "cn": "（上前探查……）\n",
      "ru": "(Пойди и проверь...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ed29e7fa1cc11b00",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "bba56c05-1e3b-425c-9856-b445559d4a78/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Throughout my life, I have searched for the founder in vain for eighty years. Now that my secret technique has been disturbed,<NL>I have no choice but to sacrifice myself and transform into a living corpse using the Ultimate Yin Remold method.<NL>For the next thousand years, if disciples of the Sanguine Sect encounter me,<NL>they must not attack and instead serve as protectors, helping me find our founder and elevate our Sanguine Sect\"<NL>...",
      "cn": "「老朽此生，苦寻祖师八十年未果，如今秘法又遭庸人扰乱，<NL>只得牺牲自身，以太阴之法，炼作活尸，<NL>此后千年百年，若血犼弟子遇我，不得袭扰，可为护法，<NL>务必助我寻得祖师，宏我血犼神教」<NL>……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5d320389c7312f3b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bba56c05-1e3b-425c-9856-b445559d4a78/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So that's how it is...)",
      "cn": "（原是如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Так вот как это бывает...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "92dfc8287dde33c6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d50b592f-f0da-4463-9530-8247c65e90d1/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi softly speaks,<NL>\"I understand deeply the pain of our separation...<NL>It's just that humans and ghosts ultimately follow different paths. Now that you are here to save the world and I am a flesh eater,<NL>we are like water and fire, unable to coexist. I had foreseen this day since I emerged from the tomb...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸幽幽说道：<NL>“与你别离之苦，我知之甚深……<NL>只是人鬼终究殊途，如今你为救世人，我乃吃人鬼，<NL>犹如水火，不能相容，昔日出墓之时，我便知必有今日……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f656865610b0e42f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d50b592f-f0da-4463-9530-8247c65e90d1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "be03018a-3758-44f2-938d-3d81b699cca8/EventContent": {
      "en": "What's done is done. Jixi is at peace, her slumber finally undisturbed.<NL>This truth, now lost to the world, leaves <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> suspended between relief and sorrow...",
      "cn": "事已至此，姬穸已然安宁长眠，不再受扰，<NL>此事已是无人能知，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此处，亦不知是喜是悲……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a0b4484681969fac",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "be03018a-3758-44f2-938d-3d81b699cca8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dbd82305-8021-4a73-916b-e1e19b92e08a/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "78902930-82c0-45ca-a8cf-d8b69fe45b9e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi had lived in Taiwu Village for a long time but rarely ate, often claiming she was full after just a few bites.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> assumed the food just wasn't to her liking.<NL>With some rare time to spare, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> decided to cook her a meal...",
      "cn": "姬穸久居太吾村，却鲜有饮食，常常只两三口称腹中饱食，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只道是饭菜不合姬穸之胃口，<NL>难得闲暇，决意为其烹饪餐食……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1ff20947dd0975f6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "78902930-82c0-45ca-a8cf-d8b69fe45b9e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Cook something myself...)",
      "cn": "（亲自烹饪……）\n",
      "ru": "(Приготовлю что-нибудь сама...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "94645efb58d8a71c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "a7fd1ac2-dd4e-4bb2-b3ef-6c5c58d8ec54/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi has been living in Taiwu Village for some time.<NL>Reflecting on the recent bizarre occurrences in the village and her inexplicable whereabouts,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot help but worry about her—danger is always lurking...",
      "cn": "自姬穸住进太吾村以来，已有一段时日，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及近日村中怪事，又常感姬穸行踪不定，<NL>不知何时便可能遭逢危险，不免忧心不止……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0ed6564b45edd276",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a7fd1ac2-dd4e-4bb2-b3ef-6c5c58d8ec54/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Being worried and anxious...)",
      "cn": "（忧心忡忡……）\n",
      "ru": "(Будучи обеспокоенным и встревоженной...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "91b246b80a2ea23a",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ee8c0c34-913f-49d2-a23e-2a96bfe4c257/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You are are impartial and upright.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你中正无私，刚直不阿，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e7d6af029ed03218",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ee8c0c34-913f-49d2-a23e-2a96bfe4c257/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "11c424c7-832c-4fad-bd4e-7b75033c5328/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It's you... You've returned...<NL>We've parted ways repeatedly, and even today's reunion feels belated...\"",
      "cn": "“是你……你回来了……<NL>你我一再分别，纵是今日重逢，亦为时晚矣……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "543f6a59adfc37cc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "11c424c7-832c-4fad-bd4e-7b75033c5328/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Don't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": "(Не понимаю смысла...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ccffb5c3ba4ccff6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "63593acb-35cf-40fa-a1f9-fee2b01bdab9/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If it weren't for the sound of the bell calling me,<NL>I would've been lying in my grave, never able to see the light of day again.<NL>It's fortunate that we can have this brief reunion in this life.\"<NL><NL>Jixi's final words seem to suggest that she has already learned about the meaning of life, her eyes filled with indifference.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> and she look at each other quietly, speechless for a while...",
      "cn": "“若非昔日铃音唤我，<NL>我本该长眠墓中，再不见天日，<NL>你我能得此短暂重聚，亦是此生之幸，不必伤怀……”<NL><NL>姬穸最后说至此处，似是已人事看透，眸中尽是凉薄，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与她静静相望，一时亦是无言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7c809d4e4653af29",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "63593acb-35cf-40fa-a1f9-fee2b01bdab9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(The brief reunion?)",
      "cn": "（短暂重聚？）\n",
      "ru": "(Краткое воссоединение?)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "43ec6c3ae6aedcd5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b41ea74b-25a4-4ae5-bf0d-d77fd891da6c/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi remained unfazed and continued,<NL>\"However... I have never harmed anyone's life...<NL>Even when I was human, even after death, I have accompanied people...<NL>But as a monster, I have no control over myself. Now, feeding on human blood is only out of extreme hunger...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸仍未有惊异之色，继续说道：<NL>“只是……我未曾害人性命……<NL>我亦曾为人类，便是死后，也曾与人相伴……<NL>然而身为妖怪，身不由己，如今吸食人血，实乃饿极方才为之……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "404c83fb58035daa",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b41ea74b-25a4-4ae5-bf0d-d77fd891da6c/Option_1": {
      "en": "You have no control over yourself...",
      "cn": "你身不由己……\n",
      "ru": "Ты не можешь контролировать себя...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9c50573078e0472c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e2150c23-b28a-4201-83c7-69792597a8e4/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lowers her head and ponders for a moment. It is unclear what she has realized, but her expression gradually becomes indifferent.<NL>As a gust of cold wind blows, she finally raises her head and meets eyes with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, saying,<NL>\"I'm the ghost? Some villagers did see my figure. I could be the ghost... if that's what you want...\"<NL><NL>Upon hearing these words, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s mind immediately becomes chaotic...",
      "cn": "姬穸闻言，低头思索片刻，也不知想到了什么，神情逐渐变得漠然，<NL>待得一阵阴风吹过，终于再又抬起头来与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>对视道：<NL>“确有村人曾见我身影，道我是妖鬼，亦无不妥！”<NL><NL>此言一出，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>脑中当即一片混乱……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "447426b54b81182a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e2150c23-b28a-4201-83c7-69792597a8e4/Option_1": {
      "en": "I am puzzled. What is the truth...",
      "cn": "我心中疑惑，不知真相究竟为何……\n",
      "ru": "Я озадачен. В чем же правда?..",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b93bfe4a79924b51",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7676b427-e688-4e55-824e-7c88b0fa4c85/EventContent": {
      "en": "Separation and loss in this world are heart-wrenching. Despite countless unwillingness,<NL>thinking of various helplessness, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can only end Jixi's life...",
      "cn": "世间生离死别，皆是摧心剜骨，纵有百般不愿，<NL>思及种种无奈之处，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>终究只得诛杀姬穸……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f4c56300892faad1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7676b427-e688-4e55-824e-7c88b0fa4c85/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8be622c1-7d2b-48e2-8ef0-91993570d1e4/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oink... oink...<NL>Squeal... snort...\"",
      "cn": "“哦咿……哦咿……<NL>哼哼唧唧……”",
      "ru": "- Хрю... хрю...<NL>Визг... фырканье...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1612d8eb1e85a959",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8be622c1-7d2b-48e2-8ef0-91993570d1e4/Option_1": {
      "en": "...?",
      "cn": "……？\n",
      "ru": "...?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "10044b5fce90b593",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b41f5711-30f9-4481-8a25-04ad515f3aa5/EventContent": {
      "en": "Seeing that <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> still curious,<NL>the informant has no choice but to warn again and again:<NL><NL>\"Everyone who saw the true form of the 'ghost' has never returned.<NL>If you still wish to explore, remember to know your limits and retreat in time.<NL>This journey is perilous. It's better to leave behind a few letters and have someone handle your affairs...\"",
      "cn": "见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>仍有探究之意，<NL>知情人亦是无可奈何，便只得再三告诫道：<NL><NL>“凡得见‘鬼怪’真容者，无一人归，<NL>你若仍想一探究竟，切记知难而退，及时归返，<NL>此行凶险，不如再留下几封家书，早日托人料理后事……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a8939e2c9f7282e8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b41f5711-30f9-4481-8a25-04ad515f3aa5/Option_1": {
      "en": "You can rest assured...",
      "cn": "你且放心便是……\n",
      "ru": "Вы можете быть уверены...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2079f2b2ce9779fa",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f687e505-91ab-4d21-830e-889faedfb608/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The sounds bring me joy,<NL>but worry follows. Joy that I can roam the world again, worry that I will be alone...\"<NL>When Jixi mentioned being alone, she glanced briefly at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, but the moment slipped away.",
      "cn": "“闻之则喜，听完却忧，<NL>喜的是我又能游历人间，忧的是只剩我孤身一人……”<NL>姬穸说到孤身一人时，眼角余光从<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>面上扫过，稍显即逝。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b079e8051d16d5c6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f687e505-91ab-4d21-830e-889faedfb608/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0a41c8e8-18c1-46de-8035-998a6ac6e369/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I am delighted by both you and Taiwu Village...<NL>However, the world is ever-changing, and nothing lasts forever.<NL>Today, I will sacrifice myself for you, as a gratitude for your company, fulfilling my final wish...\"",
      "cn": "“你与太吾村，我皆甚是欢喜，<NL>只是阴晴圆缺，世上圆满终无长久，<NL>今日此战，我舍身为你，就当是谢你朝夕相伴，圆我一梦……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3d026b4be5e1abe4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0a41c8e8-18c1-46de-8035-998a6ac6e369/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": "(Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "13e68ef2-02fd-411d-aa23-701fbbdd556b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You're just like this...<NL>Still the same as before...\"<NL>Jixi said deeply and said no more...",
      "cn": "“你这般……<NL>竟与从前仍是一样……”<NL>姬穸长叹一声，不再多言……",
      "ru": "\"Ты такой же, как сейчас...<NL>Все такой же, как и раньше...\"<NL>- С чувством произнесла Джикси и больше ничего не сказала...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0769ecbdd00d5cb8",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "13e68ef2-02fd-411d-aa23-701fbbdd556b/Option_1": {
      "en": "(As before? What does it mean again...?)",
      "cn": "（从前？又是何意……）\n",
      "ru": "(Как и раньше? Что это опять значит...?)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1582d2b8d9cecd8d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f75e1622-2f81-4bdf-b716-c6b89741887c/EventContent": {
      "en": "As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> inquires further,<NL><Character key=CharacterId str=Name/> takes out an item from <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> pocket and says: \"I brought a souldew this time, just to ask you to speak well for me and request the founder to bestow divine power,<NL>to bless our disciples,<NL>and strengthen our Sanguine Sect...'\"",
      "cn": "见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>细问，<NL><Character key=CharacterId str=Name/>便自怀中取出一物，方才说道：<NL>“我此次前来，带了一件血露，只为托你替我等多多美言，<NL>求得祖师降下神通，施以庇佑，<NL>强我弟子，壮我血犼……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ff194031234b94f1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f75e1622-2f81-4bdf-b716-c6b89741887c/Option_1": {
      "en": "If that's the case... Is this item a gift for me?",
      "cn": "既是如此……此物乃是赠送于我？\n",
      "ru": "Если это так... Является ли этот предмет подарком для меня?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3af392d88273a673",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b5c87387-53c1-4ed0-857a-d4586d55ad73/EventContent": {
      "en": "With time running out and the crisis at hand, Jixi sighs, but says no more.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> sees her raise her hand, concentrate, and shout loudly at the Jiangshi senior, \"I am the Lord of Ghosts, the Dominator of All Graves.<NL>Even if I'm bound by countless calamities, I won't tolerate your insolence here!\"",
      "cn": "时间紧迫，危机当前，<NL>姬穸轻叹一声，却是再无别话，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只见她抬手一挥，凝神捏诀，向那僵尸老人大喊一声：<NL><NL>“我乃千鬼之王，万墓老祖，<NL>纵受百般劫缚，也容不得你在此放肆！”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0d6e4d19a3dec387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b5c87387-53c1-4ed0-857a-d4586d55ad73/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi!",
      "cn": "姬穸！\n",
      "ru": "Джикси!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a2132f13233c264e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "35e0b074-7417-49a0-9418-ab14d0e581f1/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"You claim to follow me, but I wonder if your intentions are genuine.<NL>I am a harmful ghost, yet you show no fear...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“你此刻说要与我一道，却不知真心假意，<NL>我乃伤人恶鬼，你竟是半点也不害怕吗……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7d0d18ab4c369c5a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "35e0b074-7417-49a0-9418-ab14d0e581f1/Option_1": {
      "en": "Since it's you, what is there to fear...",
      "cn": "既然是你，此事有何可怕……\n",
      "ru": "Раз это ты, то чего тут бояться?..",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e09fc1cef501d299",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c5de585e-9107-4f84-807d-2cfb46f54897/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"The Ultimate Yin Jiangshi has emerged from the tomb,<NL>originally coming for me.<NL>I cannot bear to involve you...<NL>If I were not a ghost who feeds on humans, I would only hope to stay with you day and night...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那太阴老尸如今破墓而出，<NL>原是为寻我而来，我不忍连累与你……<NL>朝夕共处……日夜相伴……我若非吃人妖鬼，亦只盼长长久久……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6d45e0af453d640d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c5de585e-9107-4f84-807d-2cfb46f54897/Option_1": {
      "en": "So that's the truth... The pain in my heart is unbearable, too...",
      "cn": "真相原是如此……我又何尝不是……锥心苦痛难当……\n",
      "ru": "Значит, это правда... Боль в моем сердце тоже невыносима...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e03d4ae12ca49452",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "89c7dee8-d1d5-499a-bd41-054236b45701/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh... You are are impartial and upright.<NL>How could I not know... Let us have done with this.<NL>Once this matter is over, your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“唉……你中正无私，刚直不阿，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，你我多说已是无用，<NL>此间事了，日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1d56515e5068b09c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "89c7dee8-d1d5-499a-bd41-054236b45701/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5acbb200-9df9-4d0a-a546-55f7b9aa692a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Their eyes meet, yet Jixi only shakes her head slowly. A scene so familiar...<NL>\"You've won, eliminating the Red-Robed Jiangshi Senior.<NL>I can rest assured... Yet this matter is far from over...\"",
      "cn": "两人四目相对，姬穸却只是徐徐摇头，此情此景，恍若昨日……<NL>“如今你能得胜，红衣老人活尸已除，<NL>我便已是安心……只是此事仍未了结……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ac94ac1d353c6caa",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5acbb200-9df9-4d0a-a546-55f7b9aa692a/Option_1": {
      "en": "What do you mean by that?...",
      "cn": "此话怎讲……\n",
      "ru": "Что вы хотите этим сказать?...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e194bb9a3d707c47",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f9840a9a-bb9a-44cb-a51b-d45b087a49ed/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> steps forward to examine the area carefully. Among the dust on the ground lies an old bell with a peculiar pattern.<NL>Dropped from the skeleton, it is clearly no ordinary artifact...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>上前细细查看，满地灰尘之中，竟掉有一个花纹奇特的古旧铃铛，<NL>观之似乎是骷髅身上之物，不似寻常……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5a852aedc3f1307f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f9840a9a-bb9a-44cb-a51b-d45b087a49ed/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Put it away in the bag...)",
      "cn": "（收入囊中……）\n",
      "ru": "(Убери это в сумку...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8317218357f4635b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "207f548a-68b7-44ab-962a-fb3978cc9a72/EventContent": {
      "en": "The Red-Robed Senior sneers,<NL>\"Hmph, you naturally wouldn't recognize the secret technique of our Sanguine Sect!<NL>I deliberately hung this bell on the body of a sect disciple, remolding it underground.<NL>Eventually, the body will become undead, rising at night to help me find the founder...\"",
      "cn": "红衣老人冷笑曰：<NL>“哼，我血犼教中不宣之秘法，你自然识不得！<NL>此前我特意将此铃悬挂于教中弟子尸体之上，自可炼形于地下，<NL>久之便能死而如生，活尸夜起，助我寻得祖师……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bde5d4f6de30d72f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "207f548a-68b7-44ab-962a-fb3978cc9a72/Option_1": {
      "en": "Living corpse?!",
      "cn": "活尸？！\n",
      "ru": "Живой труп?!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "46f6d367ad49edef",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c81de45d-8809-4e12-93a6-03c2f3407a28/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Could this... be a wild boar from the mountains...\"<NL>Jixi was stunned at the sight, and her battle-ready stance relaxed.<NL>The little boar looked around, saw no one else, and trotted forward, nuzzling against Jixi and grunting continuously...",
      "cn": "“莫非……此为山中野豕……”<NL>姬穸见状，顿时愕然，应战之势亦随之松懈，<NL>那小山猪左右张望，不见旁人，便拱蹭上前，朝着姬穸不断哼唧……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c59b85654dc326e6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c81de45d-8809-4e12-93a6-03c2f3407a28/Option_1": {
      "en": "(It is... actually quite cute...)",
      "cn": "（确是……可爱非常……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это... на самом деле довольно мило...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6c80791110ae716e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b36969cb-07d8-473b-a28e-e92844e59f2a/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> wants to inquire further, but sees the senior retreat quickly,<NL>his footwork mysterious, disappearing in an instant...<NL><NL>From this, it seemed that although the old man was indeed alive, there was a hint of ghostliness about him...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>还欲再问，却见老者疾步后退，<NL>脚下不知何种诡邪步法，变幻莫测，须臾之间便已抽身离去……<NL><NL>如此看来，老者虽实为活人，又确有几分鬼魅之意……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fa2197e515d2f4f8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b36969cb-07d8-473b-a28e-e92844e59f2a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": "(Поразмыслите...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "404153d3-8d75-4074-823c-8cf0fc2694d4/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> pondered, but it was futile. The strange occurrences are mounting,<NL>and villagers now bear neck injuries—pairs of crimson holes—likely the bites of ghosts...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>苦思无果，此怪状却愈演愈烈，<NL>更有村民直言脖颈受伤，伤口形似一对朱红圆孔，必是遭鬼魅啃咬……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "262b64b1ef859135",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "404153d3-8d75-4074-823c-8cf0fc2694d4/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This matter could be significant, not to be taken lightly, perhaps worth investigating in secret...)",
      "cn": "（此事可大可小，不可掉以轻心，或当暗中查探一番……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0fe86d4d0485a342",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1cd34b2a-84c5-49ba-855d-896f1ff2d8cc/EventContent": {
      "en": "On this day, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> returns to Taiwu Village,<NL>and Jixi is indeed following <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "此日，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>回到太吾村中，<NL>回望身侧姬穸，果真随<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一同归返……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4401203e349764d8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1cd34b2a-84c5-49ba-855d-896f1ff2d8cc/Option_1": {
      "en": "This is where I belong...",
      "cn": "此处便是我栖身之所……\n",
      "ru": "Это то место, которому я принадлежу...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5bcb204a4f427307",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "fe479d84-2400-4751-9f3a-99af9e2b9f88/EventContent": {
      "en": "Lately, there have been rumors circulating, even on the road that<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> travels...",
      "cn": "近日，忽有一传言四起，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>行路途中，亦有听闻……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d052956414079605",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fe479d84-2400-4751-9f3a-99af9e2b9f88/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "677ebe8a-1e47-4084-b26e-6dcc57eb4546/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi nods slowly,<NL>lost in thought. After a moment of silence, she spoke again:<NL>\"In life, I was not ordinary... and in death, I am no longer human. And yet... I too have known such warmth.<NL>Since Taiwu Village is your cherished place, I will cherish it as well...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸徐徐点头，<NL>似是若有所思，静默片刻，半晌之后方才又言：<NL>“我生前虽非布衣，死后也再非常人，此种温情，却也曾体会……<NL>既然太吾村是你如今珍重之处，我亦将珍重待之……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "633e32f2c0449e93",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "677ebe8a-1e47-4084-b26e-6dcc57eb4546/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "38d4d6e5-a57a-4fb6-ba06-248a34ee563f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>!<NL>...Old Jiangshi! Can't you just stay down?<NL>Your insolence ends today!\"<NL>In a haze of consciousness, Jixi's voice cut through, filled with hatred, as chilling as ice...",
      "cn": "“<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>！<NL>……你这老僵，如此难缠，<NL>今日我绝不容你再三放肆！”<NL>意识朦胧之间，却听得姬穸一声大喝，语中憎恨难掩，寒如坚冰……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cfe86e8007779bc1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "38d4d6e5-a57a-4fb6-ba06-248a34ee563f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": "(Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "4d39a3e9-d784-4bc7-ba21-2c6476da9c5e/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is outpowered,<NL>seizing the opportunity while the Sanguine Sect disciple is distracted,<NL>fleeing the scene...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时不敌，<NL>只得趁那血犼教弟子不备，<NL>寻得机会，逃离此处……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a7357e43852e3d6b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4d39a3e9-d784-4bc7-ba21-2c6476da9c5e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/EventContent": {
      "en": "Seeing Jixi's openness,<NL>nodding calmly and admitting to harming others,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is stunned at the moment, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> thoughts swirling...",
      "cn": "见姬穸毫无隐瞒，<NL>坦然颔首，竟立时承认伤人之事，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时愕然，心中种种想法，起伏不定……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7f250cb108899b0b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/Option_1": {
      "en": "Regardless of the reasons, you have harmed and killed. You cannot continue making mistakes...",
      "cn": "纵有百般缘由，你已是伤人害命，岂可一错再错……",
      "ru": "Независимо от причин, вы причиняли вред и убивали. Вы не можете продолжать совершать ошибки...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9ee9f8ff3545ab60",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/Option_2": {
      "en": "You clearly have your reasons, if you had spoken to me earlier, I would have helped you...",
      "cn": "你分明亦有苦衷，若早日与我诉说，我自然助你……",
      "ru": "У вас явно есть свои причины, и если бы вы поговорили со мной раньше, я бы вам помог...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f3ab463f7131f8cd",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/Option_3": {
      "en": "If you must feed on blood to survive, it's inevitable, but I fear you will end up harming yourself and others...",
      "cn": "既是食血为生，亦是无可奈何，只怕你终害人害己……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "136ad4af5f34de61",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/Option_4": {
      "en": "Interesting. If I'd known that this was your doing, I must have followed you...",
      "cn": "有趣有趣，早知此事是你所为，我必要随你一道……",
      "ru": "Интересный. Если бы я знал, что это твоих рук дело, я бы, наверное, последовал за тобой...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c688d5c6e2c24df2",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "2e6c78bc-e125-4257-a63e-6bfb1b7b35a0/Option_5": {
      "en": "Oh? If you feed on blood like this, could you possibly cultivate some kind of divine skill?",
      "cn": "哦？若是如你这般吸食人血，莫非能练得什么神功？\n",
      "ru": "Ой? Если ты будешь питаться такой кровью, сможешь ли ты развить в себе какой-нибудь божественный навык?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a2c8a98f21d8fea4",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8323a67c-afc6-4351-a32e-b1bf9e2b7dec/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Over the millennia, I've long since forgotten...\"",
      "cn": "“这千载春秋，我早已记不清了……”",
      "ru": "\"За прошедшие тысячелетия я уже давно забыл...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a7c5d7874082ac50",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8323a67c-afc6-4351-a32e-b1bf9e2b7dec/Option_1": {
      "en": "So it's been a thousand years...",
      "cn": "竟有千载不成……\n",
      "ru": "Значит, прошла тысяча лет...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "456ab618dc15717a",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8e9cfd44-0922-444b-9841-5ab704d02bb1/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f220c477-3873-49b1-acdf-2037fcc379dc/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You...\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s breathless exclamation makes Jixi freeze for a moment.<NL>She swiftly rises to her feet, but find herself speechless, unable to explain her sudden departure.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices her inner turmoil and decides not to inquire further...",
      "cn": "“是你……”<NL>姬穸听到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>失声唤道，猛地一怔，迅速站起身来，<NL>对不告而别之事，姬穸一时无言以对，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>看出姬穸心事，也只好不再多问……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "10cac4e741a8c7dd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f220c477-3873-49b1-acdf-2037fcc379dc/Option_1": {
      "en": "How did this person die? Did you witness it?",
      "cn": "此人因何而死？你可曾目睹？\n",
      "ru": "Как умер этот человек? Вы были свидетелем этого?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "699181e568b67aa0",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "afd3e77b-6fa1-4b88-ae58-2a0c032f2752/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I spent my whole life searching for the founder...<NL>but I never expected... you would take away the bell... my efforts were in vain...\"",
      "cn": "“我一生追寻祖师……却不想……<NL>被你夺了铃铛……终究功亏一篑……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11fdb211b317d567",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "afd3e77b-6fa1-4b88-ae58-2a0c032f2752/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5442adf1-b795-4998-8fbb-0e20a8f5817e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi is speechless, reaching out and grabbing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s sleeve,<NL>seemingly caught in her own thoughts with countless words unspoken...",
      "cn": "姬穸无言，伸出手来，拉住<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>衣袖，<NL>似是流连，又似有万语千言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2fc2209778e4600a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5442adf1-b795-4998-8fbb-0e20a8f5817e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b617975b-bce8-4dc9-be86-2673c1774e34/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"You need not worry about this matter...<NL>our paths diverge and cannot converge... I understand this well...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“你且不必忧心此事……<NL>你我殊途，不得同归，此理我自是明白……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b48f088fa1c5aecc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b617975b-bce8-4dc9-be86-2673c1774e34/Option_1": {
      "en": "Fate is difficult to defy... such is life...",
      "cn": "天意难违，命中如此……\n",
      "ru": "Судьбе трудно противостоять... такова жизнь...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2c2c248badc1f8f3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0546a580-5791-48ea-a062-fdc335c88a30/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"If you say that I have harmed people, then so be it.<NL>I have nothing more to say...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“若你说是我害人，那便如此，<NL>我自然无话可说……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "19f5f3142a7dda8f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0546a580-5791-48ea-a062-fdc335c88a30/Option_1": {
      "en": "Only hope that you will repent and no longer harm others...",
      "cn": "只盼你悔过之后，再不伤人……\n",
      "ru": "Остается только надеяться, что вы раскаетесь и больше не будете причинять вред другим...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "46ac234ee94cb01a",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "027e953b-0ae2-40a6-97b8-eb06bc7db3fb/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Evil deeds... will be punished by the natural order...<NL>This body... is a small price to pay... Let us die together... become dust...\"",
      "cn": "“邪祟妄行……必绝于天……<NL>此身……不足惜……同死……作尘土……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f2ad0d41bf8675cb",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "027e953b-0ae2-40a6-97b8-eb06bc7db3fb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "914f91bc-8827-467f-816c-7d57ac8dad69/EventContent": {
      "en": "Boars are roaming wild and Chickens are crowing,<NL>spent days together in the village, witnessing the passage of time. The memories of past companionship are vivid,<NL>but now they seem like illusions, fleeting and dissipating like fleeting dreams...",
      "cn": "山猪莽撞，元鸡啼鸣，<NL>曾在小村度流年，坐看朝夕同归路，<NL>昔日共处，历历在目，却如幻梦泡影，流光消逝……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "199d595859e37cfc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "914f91bc-8827-467f-816c-7d57ac8dad69/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi...",
      "cn": "姬穸……\n",
      "ru": "Джикси...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6cac0a8a3adc122d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b2e08d80-56a8-48a7-8581-a5575e815482/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> watched from the side and felt that although Jixi didn't smile,<NL>amidst her apprehension, she seemed very happy. The chickens at her feet were also round and adorable.<NL>It was just that Jixi, who feared nothing, was now afraid of a small chicken, which <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> found surprising...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>在旁静观，只觉姬穸虽然未露笑颜，<NL>惊慌之余，却似乎很是欢欣，而她足下元鸡，亦是圆滚可爱，<NL>只是姬穸向来天不怕地不怕，如今竟然畏惧小小元鸡，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不免惊奇……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bca36fd5a438e21b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b2e08d80-56a8-48a7-8581-a5575e815482/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": "(Поразмыслите...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "74ff17ca-db57-4289-ab5d-2807e3ba4b8c/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"If we stand together,<NL>that evil Jiangshi will be no threat...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“若你我并肩，<NL>想必那妖魔邪祟，无足可惧……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8f7d7fad33adc130",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "74ff17ca-db57-4289-ab5d-2807e3ba4b8c/Option_1": {
      "en": "With our great power, all ghosts will tremble in fear...",
      "cn": "你我神威无穷，自然鬼见鬼怕……\n",
      "ru": "С нашей великой силой все призраки будут дрожать от страха...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0b60b4b27087a6da",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "afc308c8-f256-4668-96fb-8ca520c4e82e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So, it turns out I still find joy in life...\"<NL>Jixi shook her head and said no more. Her expression was calm as she began to play with the little boar.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> stayed by her side. Although <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> found the scene incredibly cute, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> couldn't help but feel a little contemplative...",
      "cn": "“原来，我仍是为‘生’而喜……”<NL>姬穸摇摇头，不再言语，神情平静，与那小山猪玩耍起来，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>相伴一旁，虽觉此景实在可爱，心中却亦不免多了几分思忖……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "79fb49c4fa224399",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "afc308c8-f256-4668-96fb-8ca520c4e82e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "4ba2ea58-b2ad-4c28-bebf-efd8974236d6/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If you want to ask how many years I have lived<NL>and how I became a ghost trapped in that ancient tomb...\"",
      "cn": "“你若是要问我如今年岁几何，<NL>何时成了这古墓女鬼，困于幽冥……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5ea4323cbf48cb46",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4ba2ea58-b2ad-4c28-bebf-efd8974236d6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Waiting for an answer...)",
      "cn": "（静待回答……）\n",
      "ru": "(Жду ответа...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8a8635aaab975fb",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "cd4cc17d-3b88-4b84-8b36-4a8d797c5070/EventContent": {
      "en": "A moment later, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> led Jixi to the village's Chicken Coop.<NL>Before they even entered, they heard the clucking of chickens, and a look of alarm immediately appeared on Jixi's face...",
      "cn": "片刻之后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>携姬穸来到村中元鸡舍，<NL>未及入内，便闻得声声鸡鸣，姬穸面上随即显出警惕之色……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2b3f62dbe210f7cd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cd4cc17d-3b88-4b84-8b36-4a8d797c5070/Option_1": {
      "en": "Are you still scared?",
      "cn": "你可还害怕？\n",
      "ru": "Ты все еще боишься?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "04be1299c191d7f9",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1c99488b-9f7a-43b9-9e84-e7cc2da577b6/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Mmm... this place is spacious...<NL>I will temporarily stay here with you...\"<NL>Upon arriving in the village, Jixi looked around and made up her mind.<NL>Although she didn't ask for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s opinion, she said it naturally...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi has temporarily resided in Taiwu Village...)</color>",
      "cn": "“唔……此处宽敞……<NL>我便暂且与你同住一处……”<NL>到得村中，姬穸左右张望，便如此拿定主意，<NL>虽未问及<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心意，姬穸亦是面无异色……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸暂时在太吾村住下了……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "35bbdb3b49b02cc2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c99488b-9f7a-43b9-9e84-e7cc2da577b6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "86cd8761-1293-4ebd-8673-2e68b862bfde/EventContent": {
      "en": "There seems to be a sigh from Jixi behind <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, and <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> doesn't look back...",
      "cn": "身后似有姬穸长叹之声，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>亦是再未回头……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1a832bd64dffda67",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86cd8761-1293-4ebd-8673-2e68b862bfde/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Let it be so...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Пусть это будет так...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a03d6d3a6b2fc1c0",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0d0eca9f-d64b-4af2-8be6-b952185bf9be/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Your high and mighty demeanor, your deep schemes and calculations,<NL>how could I be unaware... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你心高气傲，深谋远计，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c9353b0929f4f7d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0d0eca9f-d64b-4af2-8be6-b952185bf9be/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ff3404b8-3c47-4429-976e-23acddbcdf30/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"After the heavy rain last night, it has finally cleared up.<NL>I intend to go out and clear my mind, to see the various living beings in the mountains and fields...\"<NL>Seeing that Jixi's tone was ordinary, and her facial expression remained unchanged, appearing to show no signs of any abnormalities.",
      "cn": "“昨夜大雨，如今总算放晴，<NL>我意欲外出散心，去看看山野中诸多生灵……”<NL>只见姬穸语气寻常，面色如故，似乎并无任何异常……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1bf32bd340131665",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ff3404b8-3c47-4429-976e-23acddbcdf30/Option_1": {
      "en": "You have been living in Taiwu Village for a while now, and it seems like you have adapted well...",
      "cn": "你在太吾村中居住已久，似乎适应得很好……\n",
      "ru": "Вы уже некоторое время живете в Деревне Тайу, и, похоже, вы хорошо адаптировались...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "57eec6d4ce861fad",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b5c4d32f-1986-4894-a43e-f41f785a11f7/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You remain calm and composed, always going with the flow.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你从容自若，安时处顺，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "560764e7da94f306",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b5c4d32f-1986-4894-a43e-f41f785a11f7/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "876ca2db-22a1-4e12-bba0-13b8b5de0765/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"When a dead body is buried, Yin energy seeps in, refining its form...\"<NL>Over time, the body grows claws and hair, gradually transforming into a living corpse...\"<NL>Seeing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s bewilderment, Jixi began to elaborate...",
      "cn": "“人死之后，埋于地下，便能以阴气炼形……<NL>此后爪发潜长，尸体如生，久而久之，便成了那活尸鬼怪……”<NL>姬穸见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不知，遂细细为<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>说来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e105a60c41a45816",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "876ca2db-22a1-4e12-bba0-13b8b5de0765/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "00adc0c6-2c3b-4245-b655-f1ca0860e9d3/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"How can you help me?<NL>You are not the kind of person who would harm others. Do not speak of such things again...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“你如何助我？<NL>你非是那忍心伤人之人，且莫要再说此话……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "122a1fd462211d0a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "00adc0c6-2c3b-4245-b655-f1ca0860e9d3/Option_1": {
      "en": "No matter what, I will always be by your side...",
      "cn": "无论如何，我总在你身边……\n",
      "ru": "Несмотря ни на что, я всегда буду рядом с тобой...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "79691db6ff90dcf3",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "57d6449a-c5fe-4d06-b8f3-cdf2701b8156/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "3c4b3728-8007-4a17-92c4-001779467961/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So that's how it is...<NL>Although it's not my hometown, it feels like home.<NL>I suppose the people in the village must be different from ordinary people in your eyes...\"",
      "cn": "“原是如此……<NL>虽非家乡，亦似家乡，<NL>想必村中村人于你而言，自与常人不同……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "71a2b740b665f641",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3c4b3728-8007-4a17-92c4-001779467961/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's right...)",
      "cn": "（便是如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это верно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f06186c8fae5c592",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=CharacterId str=Name/> quickly waves <Character key=CharacterId str=GenderPossessive/> hands and says,<NL>\"No, no... It's meant as an offering to the founder...\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=CharacterId str=Name/>又连忙摆手道：<NL>“非也非也……自然是孝敬给祖师的……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0f02846db38f44b1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/Option_1": {
      "en": "I may deliver this gift to your founder on your behalf, but do not expect me to curry favor for you or aid your wicked cause!",
      "cn": "此物我可替你们转赠姬穸，但若要我为你等美言，助纣为虐，则万万不能！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c0c073c7047acf0b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/Option_2": {
      "en": "I'm afraid your founder may not be interested in this gift. I shall take it for now, but do not cling to false hopes or endless entreaties...",
      "cn": "只怕姬穸无意收此赠礼，我且收下此物，你们也不必寄予希望，过多祈求……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0fcea9c7bd7fe2e0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/Option_3": {
      "en": "Since you come seeking my help, I will accept this. I may attempt what you ask, but make no further demands of me...",
      "cn": "既是你等有求于我，我便收下此物，你等所求亦只做一试，其余一概不管……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "211aad1670ea8689",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/Option_4": {
      "en": "This would hardly please your founder. A pity. But perhaps I might grudgingly accept it myself. How would that be?",
      "cn": "此物可讨不得你等祖师之欢心，可惜可惜，只好由我勉强笑纳，如此可好？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b8a59a4b4852c88e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ccfe99af-5884-46b9-91fe-1bd881d69687/Option_5": {
      "en": "Oh? If this is an offering, yet your founder does not want it... then consider it an offering to me. Your 'devotion' shall be received...",
      "cn": "哦？既是孝敬姬穸，姬穸不喜，那便算是孝敬我的，你等孝心我便收下了……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "72d84cfc2ae787ba",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fb5a6ca3-7a2b-4db8-9765-5dc6573f6c74/EventContent": {
      "en": "That figure in red, flitting in and out of view at varying distances,<NL>seems to be approaching <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "那红衣之影，神出鬼没，往复徘徊，<NL>忽远又忽近，时隐又时现，却似是要朝<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>而来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "790b6f49428d859b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fb5a6ca3-7a2b-4db8-9765-5dc6573f6c74/Option_1": {
      "en": "I am about to look into the ghostly beings, so this is perfect timing!",
      "cn": "我正欲探鬼怪虚实，如此来得正好！\n",
      "ru": "Я собираюсь познакомиться с призрачными существами, так что сейчас самое подходящее время!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "076f45d3424a2480",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dc05de60-844e-43bc-9a1e-e25f0a2a5de6/EventContent": {
      "en": "Seeing that Jixi is already resting in peace here, and there is no longer any ghostly presence...",
      "cn": "眼见姬穸已长眠地下，此间重归宁静，亦再无鬼气……",
      "ru": "Видя, что Джикси уже покоится здесь с миром, и больше нет никакого призрачного присутствия...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "17d29d30a4f32e05",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dc05de60-844e-43bc-9a1e-e25f0a2a5de6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c1c1d957-f0d2-4d57-8094-21ff8060db0c/EventContent": {
      "en": "Recently, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> has heard rumors during the journey:<NL>there are frequent sightings of ghostly figures near the Sanguine Sect, often a figure in red, appearing and disappearing,<NL>and in the disciples' graves in the Sanguine Valley, there are often mournful bell sounds and eerie ghostly music.<NL>It is said that restless spirits and vengeful ghosts are crying out for justice. Those who hear it are all shocked and terrified...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Perhaps it would be wise to investigate the tombs near the Sanguine Sect...)</color>",
      "cn": "近日以来，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>途经之处，常有耳闻：<NL>传言血犼教近处鬼影憧憧，常有红衣之影，往复徘徊，<NL>血犼谷内，弟子坟中，更常有恻恻铃音，阴森鬼乐，<NL>皆道是枉死冤魂不散，鬼哭狼嚎伸冤，闻者无一不惊恐骇然……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（或许应当前往血犼教附近墓穴查探一番……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "909978fa4013e874",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c1c1d957-f0d2-4d57-8094-21ff8060db0c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": "(Поразмыслите...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "77245113-31ed-4c62-a249-a9a68a30dc78/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> witnesses this situation and doesn't want to get entangled with the Red-Robed Senior,<NL>so <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> takes out a bell from <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> bag and hands it to the Senior as instructed...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见此情状，亦不愿与红衣老人多作纠缠，<NL>只得从行囊中取出铃铛，依言交于老人手中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "90959f4a3c36fc77",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "77245113-31ed-4c62-a249-a9a68a30dc78/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1dc6b7bf-2c21-40e0-9c6d-74fc7009ec8e/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": "бабушка",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "31368dee-482e-459b-805e-e2761eff054b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You...\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s breathless exclamation makes Jixi freeze for a moment.<NL>She swiftly rises to her feet, but find herself speechless, unable to explain her sudden departure.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices her inner turmoil and decides not to inquire further...",
      "cn": "“是你……”<NL>姬穸听到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>失声唤道，猛地一怔，迅速站起身来，<NL>对不告而别之事，姬穸一时无言以对，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>看出姬穸心事，也只好不再多问……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "10cac4e741a8c7dd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "31368dee-482e-459b-805e-e2761eff054b/Option_1": {
      "en": "Why did this person die? Could it be... because of you?",
      "cn": "此人因何而死？莫非……是你所为？\n",
      "ru": "Почему этот человек умер? Может ли это быть... из-за тебя?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "445fd072acb67028",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "223ce563-6560-4ab3-b914-0ee9cd29c796/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"You actually trust me to this extent?<NL>Although I don't want to, I cannot shake off this ghostly nature...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“你竟然信我至此？<NL>纵是我不愿，此身却是鬼性难除……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bda2ae24573da43d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "223ce563-6560-4ab3-b914-0ee9cd29c796/Option_1": {
      "en": "You did it out of necessity, and you must have suffered as well...",
      "cn": "不得已而为之，你亦觉苦痛……\n",
      "ru": "Вы сделали это по необходимости и, должно быть, тоже страдали...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "31eddc7213dc71ca",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5f5164dc-6ef4-46bb-99ec-89871b58a886/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The ancient nomads guarded a dark secret technique...<NL>It can turn people into ghost puppets.<NL>Perhaps I was born unlucky, or perhaps I owed my parents too much, so even before I was born, I protected my father, the king, from the evil magic of the demons...\"<NL>Jixi shakes her head and falls silent.",
      "cn": "“古之犬戎，有一秘术……<NL>可将人变为妖鬼，供其驱策，<NL>许是我生来福薄，又或者亏欠父母太多，便在未出世时，替我父王挡了妖人的邪术……”<NL>姬穸摇摇头，不再多说。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d56df7c0c7f53ace",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5f5164dc-6ef4-46bb-99ec-89871b58a886/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "3709028f-bc4b-4ff3-90c9-415a2a5c6bb2/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi first nodded, then asked again:<NL>\"Are the chickens here usually allowed to move freely in and out of the coop?\"",
      "cn": "姬穸先是颔首，复又问道：<NL>“莫非此处元鸡，平日皆可自由出入鸡舍？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "94abd2ca05b41112",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3709028f-bc4b-4ff3-90c9-415a2a5c6bb2/Option_1": {
      "en": "That's right. Don't be afraid, the \"Imperial Chicken\" won't hurt anyone...",
      "cn": "确是如此，你且莫怕，“大王”不会伤人……\n",
      "ru": "Это верно. Не бойтесь, \"Императорский цыпленок\" никому не причинит вреда...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "63f5e63deafeeec5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e05ff60f-fafd-44c8-8735-6566102bea09/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The years in the tomb have been too long, and I have slept for too long.<NL>The world has changed, and everything is no longer the same as before...\"",
      "cn": "“墓中岁月久长，我睡了太久，<NL>沧海桑田，往事皆非，世间万物皆已不似当年景象……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fde1dd40ee3e5caa",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e05ff60f-fafd-44c8-8735-6566102bea09/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5f4bc678-13cf-40c8-ac70-fc86dd9ce9cb/EventContent": {
      "en": "In the final moments of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s life,<NL>a gentle touch seems to brush against <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> forehead.<NL>It is fleeting, barely there, like everything in this world, ephemeral and transient. It dissipates in an instant...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>弥留之际，<NL>只觉额头之上，似有轻柔触感，<NL>转瞬即逝，若有似无，恰如世间万物，如梦似幻，须臾消散……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9c9904847ca3e2df",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5f4bc678-13cf-40c8-ac70-fc86dd9ce9cb/Option_1": {
      "en": "It feels... so... warm...",
      "cn": "如此……温暖……\n",
      "ru": "Это кажется... таким... теплым...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e7c7ca4108b8bbba",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "513b9f45-5a8c-4539-83e4-e0c72ca18f6a/EventContent": {
      "en": "On this day,<NL>as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> approaches the Sanguine Sect,<NL>a disciple of the Sanguine Sect<NL>approaches with an imposing manner...",
      "cn": "这一日，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>方至血犼，<NL>便有一名血犼弟子，<NL>气势汹汹，迎面而来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1fd06a6a709b4ec0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "513b9f45-5a8c-4539-83e4-e0c72ca18f6a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "24063f8f-8fdf-4f38-b6f9-844523a11f92/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"That Jiangshi Senior has caused great harm.<NL>Naturally, I will join you in eradicating it...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那老尸害人不浅，<NL>我自然与你一道，将之斩草除根……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "30a2f5571471bad5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "24063f8f-8fdf-4f38-b6f9-844523a11f92/Option_1": {
      "en": "If we join forces, that would be great...",
      "cn": "你我齐心，如此甚好……\n",
      "ru": "Если мы объединим усилия, это было бы здорово...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6c8636a6026fd91e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d1e01084-b552-4c72-9875-f004968f778d/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi finishes speaking and falls into silence, looking at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, waiting for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s decision...",
      "cn": "姬穸话语已尽，不再多言，<NL>静静望向<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，只等<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>作出决定……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5c9605b508b2288f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d1e01084-b552-4c72-9875-f004968f778d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Kill Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": "(Убей Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cbd25a9059309301",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d1e01084-b552-4c72-9875-f004968f778d/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Part ways here...)",
      "cn": "（就此分离……）\n",
      "ru": "(Здесь пути расходятся...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "48ecc8ffb323ec49",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d8878cc0-c603-4a29-b02a-d29706c24673/EventContent": {
      "en": "Recently, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> has heard rumors during the journey:<NL>There have been frequent strange incidents in the Sanguine Sect at night, with ghostly bell sounds suddenly appearing,<NL>and it is said that some disciples have seen ghosts and died on the spot. The area is now covered in blood, and new graves can be seen...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Perhaps it would be wise to investigate the tombs near the Sanguine Sect...)</color>",
      "cn": "近日以来，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>途经之处，常有耳闻：<NL>传言血犼教夜半异事频发，招鬼铃音，凭空四起，<NL>甚有弟子似见鬼怪，当场丧命，如今正乃是血色笼罩，新坟茕茕……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（或许应当前往血犼教附近墓穴查探一番……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fa0ae356ac909cb3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d8878cc0-c603-4a29-b02a-d29706c24673/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": "(Поразмыслите...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "41814924-e60c-4286-b851-7562e4b1ca96/EventContent": {
      "en": "One of the Sanguine Sect disciples sneers,<NL>paying no attention to the commotion and saying with a stern expression,<NL>\"You commoners dare to gossip about our Sanguine Sect? How dare you! You have no idea what you're messing with.<NL>As a disciple, it is my duty to punish you. On your knees, and beg!\"",
      "cn": "血犼教弟子冷哼一声，<NL>也不理会四下一片哗然，神情一凛道：<NL>“你等小民，竟敢公然议论我血犼神教之事，实在是胆大包天，不知死活！<NL>我身为教中弟子，自当出手惩戒，还不速速跪地求饶……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6cf148ead3e69021",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "41814924-e60c-4286-b851-7562e4b1ca96/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So the Sanguine Sect has already infiltrated Yangzhou City. Even casual conversations over tea are monitored...)",
      "cn": "（原来血犼教早已渗透扬州城内，连品茶闲聊亦受监视……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc4355b02c6831af",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0f7851ed-d010-4c54-868d-839bc47042b5/EventContent": {
      "en": "Under the dark clouds, the malevolent energy grows stronger.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> pushes on, breath quickening as the air grows cold.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> turns a corner on the forest path, a crimson flash, thick with the stench of blood, lashes out at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> face!",
      "cn": "乌云之下，阴气大盛，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>提气急奔，只觉得空气越来越冷，随着林间小道忽地一转，<NL>一道血光伴随着一阵浓重的血腥之气便就往<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>面上扑来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc08616a9f854278",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0f7851ed-d010-4c54-868d-839bc47042b5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Uh oh!)",
      "cn": "（不好！）\n",
      "ru": "(О-о-о!)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "eaef6f99663d65a6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "822df3b9-4547-42aa-99cc-2cfcb6c41cc3/EventContent": {
      "en": "But at this moment, there is no mournful ghostly music, no cries of despair.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is prepared for the worst, but the scene before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> seems quite ordinary, unlike the rumors of ghosts...",
      "cn": "只是此时此刻，未闻哀怨鬼乐，亦未闻凄恻之声，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>本已做足准备，此景却颇有几分寻常，不似传言般鬼魅……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c6c49d2114417993",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "822df3b9-4547-42aa-99cc-2cfcb6c41cc3/Option_1": {
      "en": "Let me investigate the true identity of the \"ghost\" then...",
      "cn": "待我一探“鬼怪”真身……\n",
      "ru": "Тогда позвольте мне выяснить истинную личность \"призрака\"...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "211108ae6c4c606b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9daa9b5b-7ef1-404f-8486-19e497e42059/EventContent": {
      "en": "The man's face showed displeasure upon hearing that<NL>and he assumed a mysterious and secretive expression as he spoke,<NL>\"The word 'ghost' itself carries an ominous connotation, let alone this wicked creature dressed in red, which is even more sinister.<NL>This is a long story, and I'm afraid that if you hear the details, you will be too scared to step out of your door...\"",
      "cn": "那人闻言，面露不满，<NL>又显出一副神秘鬼祟的神情说道：<NL>“‘鬼怪’本已不祥，更何况此妖邪身着红衣，更是凶戾，<NL>此事说来话长，只怕你听了详细，亦是吓得再不敢出门半步……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "32e9877601f70d2b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9daa9b5b-7ef1-404f-8486-19e497e42059/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Asking for more details...)",
      "cn": "（细细询问……）\n",
      "ru": "(Прошу предоставить более подробную информацию...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "ae628b7a90da9f97",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "40374218-745f-4a15-9d07-5a146fa9e7b0/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh, yes, of course.<NL>You decide what's to be done with it...\"<NL>Upon hearing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s words, <Character key=CharacterId str=Name/> hesitates but does not object.<NL><Character key=CharacterId str=UpperGenderSubject/> hands the Souldew to <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, exchanges a few polite gestures, and hastily leaves...",
      "cn": "“这……自然自然，<NL>要如何转赠处置此物，自然是你说了算……”<NL><Character key=CharacterId str=Name/>听闻<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>之话，虽有迟疑，却未有异议，<NL>只将血露交于<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，几番拱手，便匆匆而别……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7941d7bfa90338f4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "40374218-745f-4a15-9d07-5a146fa9e7b0/Option_1": {
      "en": "(It seems that this person has no persistence, and the the act of giving was merely a formality, lacking sincerity...)",
      "cn": "（此人似乎并无坚持，送礼亦只是草草了事，倒不见几分真心……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fb8325e639976265",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "37454304-a802-4a51-94ca-ae19dd4c4cb8/EventContent": {
      "en": "The red-robed senior has a body covered in dark and black fur,<NL>with eyes void of life, and claws as sharp as iron.<NL>On his tattered clothes, the stench of death is mixed with the scent of blood, traces of blood can be vaguely seen...",
      "cn": "眼前红衣老者，浑身青黑，长满骇人毛发，<NL>双目浑然死气，利爪削铁如泥，铜皮铁骨，庞然如山，<NL>浓浓尸气之中混杂血腥之气，破碎衣衫之上，隐约可见红褐血迹……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0a425862105aaec5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "37454304-a802-4a51-94ca-ae19dd4c4cb8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Fresh bloodstains... various strange signs... the truth is revealed!)",
      "cn": "（新鲜血迹……种种异状……真相已显！）\n",
      "ru": "(Свежие пятна крови... различные странные знаки... истина раскрыта!)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f1ac65356a7ef3a6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8b9c8b9c-ae07-4071-b5ea-056393852921/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi nods slowly as if deep in thought.<NL>After a moment of silence, she spoke again,<NL>\"Although it is difficult for you to stay in the village for long, Taiwu Village is still a place of value for you now, and I will treat it with care...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸徐徐点头，<NL>似是若有所思，静默片刻，半晌之后方才又言：<NL>“虽你难以久居村中，太吾村仍是你如今珍重之处，我亦将珍重待之……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4e796247eb40f51c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8b9c8b9c-ae07-4071-b5ea-056393852921/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это хорошо...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "da6711cd-34e9-4e9e-b69a-1f157a42127e/EventContent": {
      "en": "An overwhelming stench of decay and death fill the air,<NL>and <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks around in astonishment, only to see that the Red-Robed Senior, now a Jiangshi,<NL>is hissing and leaping straight toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>!",
      "cn": "腐臭袭近，死气扑面，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>惊而一望，竟是那早已化作僵尸的红衣老人，<NL>此时口中嘶嘶，脚尖趯趯，直直朝自己而来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e22ae9f9c8563b7a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "da6711cd-34e9-4e9e-b69a-1f157a42127e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Stay vigilant!)",
      "cn": "（凝神以待！）\n",
      "ru": "(Будьте бдительны!)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9736255234b7493e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d14cc304-a290-475a-b7cd-312c0a72ce7a/EventContent": {
      "en": "However, as Jixi enters the house and passes by,<NL>a faint scent of fresh blood lingers on her.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> senses something amiss, yet cannot grasp the reason why...",
      "cn": "只是待得姬穸进入屋内，<NL>擦肩而过之时，隐隐有新鲜血腥之气，自姬穸身上而来，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>似有所觉，却不知究竟何故……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "756f2bf08e0b2a39",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d14cc304-a290-475a-b7cd-312c0a72ce7a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1c699489-6f31-44aa-be9e-cf9935190755/EventContent": {
      "en": "The Senior sniffs, drawing the bloodgleam into himself.<NL>The foul aura dissipate, and the air is cleansed.<NL>It seems that the Senior was drawn here by the unusual blood scent...",
      "cn": "那血光遭红衣老人嗅闻吸入，<NL>污浊之气便随之散去，重复清明，<NL>如此看来，老人乃是受此地奇特血腥所引，方才直奔此处而来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d40239c0d91bf5f8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c699489-6f31-44aa-be9e-cf9935190755/Option_1": {
      "en": "Could it be that the source of the blood radiance is extraordinary...",
      "cn": "莫非血光所在之处有异……\n",
      "ru": "Может быть, источник кровавого сияния какой-то необыкновенный?..",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "37d08d9ef4746055",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c21ac6be-92d7-4242-91f3-b1774be63619/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"This is... I...<NL>I'm just too full. I really can't eat another bite...\"<NL>Jixi looks troubled as she repeatedly declines and finally flees...",
      "cn": "“此物……我……<NL>我腹中饱胀，实在吃不下了……”<NL>姬穸终是面露难色，推脱再三，自此处逃窜而去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "af082b13667be0ed",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c21ac6be-92d7-4242-91f3-b1774be63619/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6d3b9e98-948e-4143-859e-4dbab7e16141/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh... You remain calm and composed, always going with the flow.<NL>How could I not know... Let us have done with this.<NL>Once this matter is over, your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“唉……你从容自若，安时处顺，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，你我多说已是无用，<NL>此间事了，日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4064034e7478a04",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6d3b9e98-948e-4143-859e-4dbab7e16141/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "8d1b62ec-2b61-4cbb-b74c-fb572022935b/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"The Ultimate Yin Jiangshi has emerged from the tomb,<NL>originally coming for me. As long as you don't dislike me, that's enough.<NL>It's truly your style to be so carefree...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那太阴老尸如今破墓而出，<NL>原是为寻我而来，你并不厌我，便已足矣，<NL>洒脱至此，倒确是你之作风……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f387de7004aa879e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8d1b62ec-2b61-4cbb-b74c-fb572022935b/Option_1": {
      "en": "So, the truth is... I've always felt a strong familiarity with you. Could it be that we have a connection from a past life...",
      "cn": "真相原是如此……我早觉你分外熟悉，莫非你我是前世因缘……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "87b8b11d4bf4c442",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3908867d-4eb9-45c2-8dc4-26544f7d8fc5/EventContent": {
      "en": "Strange signs were everywhere, yet it was unclear if they were truly supernatural.<NL>Perplexed, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> decided to discuss the mystery with Jixi.<NL>Yet, despite searching high and low, Jixi was nowhere to be found. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> waited anxiously, but she never returned...",
      "cn": "诸多怪相，却不知是否当真有怪力乱神，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不得其解，欲与姬穸共商此事，<NL>却不料寻遍周遭，竟皆不见姬穸身影，便是苦等，亦不见归返……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "51b4bf70409bf3f7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3908867d-4eb9-45c2-8dc4-26544f7d8fc5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Not knowing where Jixi has gone...)",
      "cn": "（不知姬穸眼下去了何处……）\n",
      "ru": "(Не зная, куда делась Джикси...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f7f76f742231926d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "a2a325e5-12b4-476d-bcea-b66ea47380ce/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"...\"<NL>Jixi remains silent...",
      "cn": "“……”<NL>姬穸不语……",
      "ru": "\"...\"<NL>Джикси продолжает молчать...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "fd619c63c369480f",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "a2a325e5-12b4-476d-bcea-b66ea47380ce/Option_1": {
      "en": "This wicked creature must be the one who attacked the villagers. Fear not...",
      "cn": "想必村中妖鬼袭人之事，也是此妖邪所为，你且莫怕……\n",
      "ru": "Это злобное существо, должно быть, и есть тот, кто напал на жителей деревни. Не бойтесь...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a824b354482349ca",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/EventContent": {
      "en": "{0}",
      "cn": "{0}",
      "ru": "{0}",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "660cf56f05961bfe",
      "engine": "neutral",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_1": {
      "en": "Why are you in the tomb?",
      "cn": "你为何会在坟墓之中？",
      "ru": "Почему ты в гробнице?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "7f48bf046f5734a1",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_2": {
      "en": "Are you familiar with the Sanguine Cult?",
      "cn": "你可知血犼邪教？",
      "ru": "Вы знакомы с культом Сангвиника?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "fbff37a748d36f2d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_3": {
      "en": "The bell that awakened you?",
      "cn": "那个唤醒你的铃铛？",
      "ru": "Звонок, который разбудил вас?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1191f44a721f7076",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_4": {
      "en": "Does it refer to something in the past?",
      "cn": "往昔之事，似有所指？",
      "ru": "Относится ли это к чему-то в прошлом?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "2780efbe4fe6891e",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_5": {
      "en": "Tell me about your origins.",
      "cn": "你的身世？",
      "ru": "Расскажи мне о своем происхождении.",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c696e2132bd764c1",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "632c2608-77cf-41fd-9934-275c2710d34f/Option_6": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": "（其它话题……）\n",
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "7a159e3b76aa8968",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "327d0693-600a-4d3b-8ff1-6a75663c55ed/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> watches from the sidelines. The villagers, seemingly concerned that Jixi might not be eating well,<NL>have brought a variety of homely delicacies: chicken, duck, fish, vegetables,<NL>and numerous dainty, sweet pastries,<NL>all being pressed into Jixi's hands...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>又再观望，村民似是担忧姬穸饮食，<NL>手持之物皆是各类家常好菜，鸡鸭鱼肉，青菜白萝，<NL>更有许多精巧可爱、甜蜜点心，<NL>此时正不断往姬穸手中递……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ef361820c0b3715c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "327d0693-600a-4d3b-8ff1-6a75663c55ed/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Truly abundant...)",
      "cn": "（实在丰盛……）\n",
      "ru": "(Поистине в изобилии...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4ed0fe0ec1de7a79",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "073ee9ec-5af2-4539-9006-114edd50498d/EventContent": {
      "en": "However, Jixi changes the subject without hesitation<NL>and looks at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, nodding,<NL>\"I have long since slept in the ancient tomb. I am no longer a living person, and I naturally need to feed on human blood to survive...<NL>Before, because of my unbearable hunger, I went out at midnight and tasted the blood of several people in your village...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸却是话锋一转，未有迟疑，<NL>只望着<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，点头道：<NL>“我长眠古墓，早非活人，自然需吸食人血为生……<NL>此前确是我难耐饥饿，夜半外出，便尝了你村中几人之鲜血……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "74766cbf5f81ff40",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "073ee9ec-5af2-4539-9006-114edd50498d/Option_1": {
      "en": "No... it couldn't be you!",
      "cn": "不……岂会是你？！\n",
      "ru": "Нет... это не мог быть ты!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "dbf5a156fd894c36",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "fff1aec6-6933-4eb2-bdc3-14659ec9eb59/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"In the darkness of the ancient tomb,<NL>where there is no light, I have been peacefully resting for a long time... Moreover...<NL>I am not the only one resting in that tomb...\"",
      "cn": "“古墓之中，虽阴暗无光，<NL>长年合目安眠，倒也清静……更何况……<NL>我并非独自安眠墓中……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6e8189a88d7deb5c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fff1aec6-6933-4eb2-bdc3-14659ec9eb59/Option_1": {
      "en": "What do you mean by that?",
      "cn": "此话怎讲？\n",
      "ru": "Что ты хочешь этим сказать?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "7e692bf52ab90b4b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "37cfae27-1f19-47d9-a18d-47e9ad582a98/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The person I used to be had a change of heart after we separated.<NL>The scene of yesterday is beyond retrieval, and the pleasant moments of today will no longer come.<NL>Now I have nowhere to go, wandering everywhere. Despite my deep hatred and aversion, I can only survive by feeding on humans.<NL>It's a twisted fate, full of suffering. I only hope that someone will guide me and let my soul return to its old dream...\"<NL>The person in front of me sighed lightly, their eyes remaining calm and unruffled.",
      "cn": "“我之故人，心魂异变，<NL>自分别之后，昨日之景已是难追，今日良时亦不再至，<NL>如今我无处可去，四处游荡，纵然深恶痛绝，却亦只得食人为生，<NL>阴差阳错，百般苦痛，只盼有人渡我，令我魂归故梦……”<NL>只见眼前之人轻叹一声，鲜红双眸，始终古井无波……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "964ee16016b87bed",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "37cfae27-1f19-47d9-a18d-47e9ad582a98/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A mix of emotions in heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中慨然……）\n",
      "ru": "(Смесь эмоций в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5ecae1c6e3752f58",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6d7314de-e3e3-428c-b8f7-944c7816d3a2/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"The Ultimate Yin Jiangshi has emerged from the tomb,<NL>originally coming for me. Since paths diverge, it will be difficult to travel together again...<NL>When we met again in the past, I knew...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那太阴老尸如今破墓而出，<NL>原是为寻我而来，既是殊途，自然再难同路……<NL>昔日与你再会之时，我便知晓……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d6a371c83d0969b3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6d7314de-e3e3-428c-b8f7-944c7816d3a2/Option_1": {
      "en": "The truth is like this... Although I don't know where we met before... It seems to be destined...",
      "cn": "真相原是如此……我虽不知何处曾与你相见……想来亦是天定之缘……\n",
      "ru": "Правда такова... Хотя я не знаю, где мы встречались раньше... Кажется, это было предначертано судьбой...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "96727b819558d415",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "c578e0cb-194b-49e5-923b-44243ea4712c/EventContent": {
      "en": "With doubts in <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> heart,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> still strolls the streets, looking around,<NL>hoping to find someone <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> can stop and ask about the situation...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中疑虑，<NL>仍是信步街头，左顾右盼，<NL>只盼能寻得驻足停步之人，得以一问究竟……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f801a63803158aa9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c578e0cb-194b-49e5-923b-44243ea4712c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Even though there were no pedestrians stopping, there seemed to be idle talk ahead in the tea house...)",
      "cn": "（虽无行人驻足，前方茶寮之中，却似有人闲谈……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b4f87f2c117c6656",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aae0b3de-1463-4927-91e9-def950641406/EventContent": {
      "en": "<color=#lightgrey>(What should Jixi try...)</color>",
      "cn": "<color=#lightgrey>（要让姬穸品尝何物……）</color>",
      "ru": "<color=#lightgrey>(Что стоит попробовать Джикси...)</color>",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e03ab0e08c7afecd",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "aae0b3de-1463-4927-91e9-def950641406/Option_1": {
      "en": "Confirm",
      "cn": "确定",
      "ru": "Подтверждать",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8ed0c6b282caf17d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "aae0b3de-1463-4927-91e9-def950641406/Option_2": {
      "en": "Cancel",
      "cn": "取消\n",
      "ru": "Отменить",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "748e25d8f930bfa8",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "43c2fbec-046e-49d4-819c-3a98706e33bd/EventContent": {
      "en": "Upon hearing this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is stunned.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> had explored the tomb and Jixi had left with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>, so she wouldn't be in that tomb.<NL>As for the Red-Robed Senior—he clearly failed to pursue them. In just a short time, he had escaped...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>初听此事，心中大骇，<NL>此前自己曾于墓中一探，姬穸随自己而出，自然不会在那墓中，<NL>那红衣老人分明未能追出，不过短短时日，竟已逃之夭夭不成……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "642595f85eb9e65c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "43c2fbec-046e-49d4-819c-3a98706e33bd/Option_1": {
      "en": "(The Red-Robed Senior may come again...)",
      "cn": "（只怕红衣老人终将再来……）\n",
      "ru": "(Старший в Красном может прийти снова...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9c80b5ebb4bd2d95",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "a8edb085-4d74-4ca6-983b-463bc0afaeb2/EventContent": {
      "en": "Since Jixi came to Taiwu Village, some time had passed...<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices in a sudden<NL>that the girl <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> once knew has grown into a young woman...",
      "cn": "自姬穸来到太吾村，如今已有一些时日……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>猛地察觉，<NL>不知何时，昔日女童今日竟已长成女郎模样……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4af9d96f2750000d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a8edb085-4d74-4ca6-983b-463bc0afaeb2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi is indeed mysterious...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸如此，果然蹊跷……）\n",
      "ru": "(Джикси действительно загадочна...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6af36b70beb5d280",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "935bfc5e-3959-4d25-8f1c-fe7a0591c3e8/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> doesn't understand the meaning of his words.<NL>In the midst of complex emotions, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> intended to take care of the Senior's body,<NL>but <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees that the Senior's lifeless body is sinking slowly into the bloody soil as if being swallowed.<NL>After closer inspection, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> still doesn't know the reason for this strange situation. It seems quite unusual,<NL>as if it were caused by the evil skills practiced by the senior...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一一听闻，却是不解其意，<NL>心绪复杂之际，本欲为老人收尸善后，<NL>却见那老人本已无生息的躯体，竟陷入浸血泥土之中，缓缓下沉，如遭吞噬，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>再三细观，亦不知是何缘故，此情此景颇为奇异，<NL>竟似是老人所练邪功所致一般……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8288de083b3685dd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "935bfc5e-3959-4d25-8f1c-fe7a0591c3e8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Greatly surprised...)",
      "cn": "（大为惊异……）\n",
      "ru": "(Сильно удивлен...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "72da1f4c35abb854",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "34cce0eb-743f-483d-bf6e-e2315da20603/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, a large crow suddenly dropped a letter into <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s hand:<NL><NL>\"It's time to say goodbye, take care!\"<NL><NL>The letter was sparse with words, but the strokes were heavy, indicating countless thoughts. The signature on the letter was \"Xi.\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s heart shook with sadness...",
      "cn": "恰在此时，一只硕大的乌鸦忽然衔着一封书信扔到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>手中：<NL><NL>“终是到了分别之时，万望珍重！”<NL><NL>信中寥寥数字，却是笔划滞重，想来其中定有思虑万千，<NL>而书信的落款正是一个“穸”字，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心头一震，悲从中来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "912fb27d0ab4080d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "34cce0eb-743f-483d-bf6e-e2315da20603/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is...)",
      "cn": "（这是……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6021a17ee85ae445",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b20d16a0-034d-4ba0-8ac9-95d4d2265ff3/EventContent": {
      "en": "With a sense of parting sorrow in <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> heart,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> turns <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> head away from Jixi.<NL>At this moment, after the rain, the warm breeze was gentle,<NL>just like two people strolling hand in hand in the mountains, enjoying the beautiful scenery...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中别离愁绪，<NL>便偏过头去，不看姬穸，<NL>此时雨后初晴，温风和煦，<NL>竟恰如两人携手漫步山野、共赏美景一般……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7e456184c849d992",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b20d16a0-034d-4ba0-8ac9-95d4d2265ff3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e2e1f63d-aafc-4e59-9530-8ca07691586a/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Well... the Red-Robed Jiangshi...\"",
      "cn": "“嗯……红衣老僵……”",
      "ru": "\"хорошо... Цзянши в красном одеянии...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e62addda59ee1b20",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "e2e1f63d-aafc-4e59-9530-8ca07691586a/Option_1": {
      "en": "The Red-Robed Jiangshi?",
      "cn": "红衣老僵？\n",
      "ru": "Цзянши в красном одеянии?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8e857ef51a9cdf8a",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d2ef2144-8124-433b-9048-63818c4f1613/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi sighed lightly, then says,<NL>\"In the past and the present, a thousand stories...<NL>As expected, you still understand me after reincarnation...<NL>Now that things have come to this, I can tell you the truth about the villagers' injuries.<NL>You don't need to rack your brains to find the real culprit...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸轻叹一声，继而又道：<NL>“前尘今生，往事千端，<NL>果然……你回生转世，仍会懂我……<NL>事已至此，你若欲问村人受伤之事，我倒是知晓，<NL>你亦无需再绞尽脑汁，寻那真凶……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c026337f8b5e1369",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d2ef2144-8124-433b-9048-63818c4f1613/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Reincarnation?)",
      "cn": "（回生转世？）\n",
      "ru": "(Реинкарнация?)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9a391bb1878c687f",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "022bebee-7213-4771-9d20-bd2595e8594e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Before long, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> had carefully prepared a table full of hot dishes.<NL>As the food was served, the steam was overwhelming. Though its colors were strange and its flavors mysterious,<NL>it was a creation of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s dedicated effort...",
      "cn": "不多时，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>便悉心张罗了一桌热菜，<NL>菜肴既出，热气袭人，虽是颜色奇异，味道玄妙，<NL>却是<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>潜心之作……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5cc595f378c42486",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "022bebee-7213-4771-9d20-bd2595e8594e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Guess that's how it has to be...)",
      "cn": "（只好如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Думаю, так и должно быть...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6e390e39dac24598",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "41a0f550-b713-48f4-8106-514ced4ebfc5/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"That's a Taoist artifact that can control ghosts and spirits.<NL>However, the bell sounds have a different meaning for me...\"",
      "cn": "“那是道士的法器，可驱役鬼神，<NL>不过，那铃音于我而言，却有不同意味……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c358bae65decef3f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "41a0f550-b713-48f4-8106-514ced4ebfc5/Option_1": {
      "en": "Different meaning? Is it good or bad?",
      "cn": "不同意味？是好是坏？\n",
      "ru": "Другое значение? Это хорошо или плохо?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f76aaff266d8ddab",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "3bdedb82-6595-4aec-93f3-72ba56c46f29/EventContent": {
      "en": "As the wind subsided, the sound of the bell gradually faded away,<NL>and the eerie atmosphere in Taiwu Village disappeared almost completely.<NL>When <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> opens <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> eyes again, there is no sign of Jixi...",
      "cn": "风声未止，铃音渐远，<NL>森森鬼气亦自太吾村中消失殆尽，<NL>待得<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>再睁开眼时，已无处可寻姬穸身影……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b8fbbbe3958f0509",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3bdedb82-6595-4aec-93f3-72ba56c46f29/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Even if we meet again... things have changed...)",
      "cn": "（纵得再见……物是人非……）\n",
      "ru": "(Даже если мы встретимся снова... все изменилось...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b83be0bf2090463c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f54667c7-7486-41ca-ab30-d0b4ee5891ae/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So that's it...<NL>You were originally a hero in troubled times, wandering the Martial World,<NL>with your own ambitions, different from ordinary people...\"",
      "cn": "“原是如此……<NL>你本为乱世英杰，漂泊江湖，<NL>心中亦自有一番抱负，自与常人不同……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e61ef96082a98b99",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f54667c7-7486-41ca-ab30-d0b4ee5891ae/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's right...)",
      "cn": "（便是如此……）\n",
      "ru": "(Это верно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f06186c8fae5c592",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "552c66d6-106d-4faf-8746-b0bf8f28fa1c/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"In this world, reunions and separations are fleeting.<NL>After seeing it so many times, I feel only like a cold lamp without flames, with a heart as cold as ashes...\"",
      "cn": "“世事如此，聚散匆匆，<NL>见惯之后，便只觉寒灯无焰，心若残灰……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b14ce5922860b0b6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "552c66d6-106d-4faf-8746-b0bf8f28fa1c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1bfd0f2c-eb8a-460f-b789-bcc2fd70ef4d/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=CharacterId str=Name/> shakes <Character key=CharacterId str=GenderPossessive/> head and says,<NL>\"Rumors may be true or false, but our Sanguine Sect has its own judgment.<NL>Since our founder followed you, you must be able to talk to her. This matter can only be entrusted to you...\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=CharacterId str=Name/>却是摇头言道：<NL>“传言是虚是实，我血犼教自有定夺；<NL>只是我之祖师既随你而去，你必能与她说得上话，此事自然只能托付于你……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "44af4ee28a45ed4f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1bfd0f2c-eb8a-460f-b789-bcc2fd70ef4d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ask for details...)",
      "cn": "（询问详情……）\n",
      "ru": "(Уточняйте подробности...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "fd16ba7240a7aafe",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "09a720b4-3252-41c4-8b08-876d7586d3a8/EventContent": {
      "en": "The old man is motionless, covered in filth.<NL>Yet his dead eyes are fixed on <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> as if he is still alive, ready to attack at any moment...",
      "cn": "却见老人秽土加身，僵呆原处，并无其他动作，<NL>唯有一双浑然死目，如仍活着一般紧盯<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，不知何时便会悄然袭来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "65a33841621dfda6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "09a720b4-3252-41c4-8b08-876d7586d3a8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Wary...)",
      "cn": "（心怀警惕……）\n",
      "ru": "(Настороженно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a6d6753ece2e8e82",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "f4487302-e51c-4911-804a-f46efbeb4998/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The name Taiwu Village... must have some connection with you...<NL>Are you willing to stay in the village for a long time, to stay here and live peacefully from now on?\"",
      "cn": "“太吾村之名……想必与你颇有渊源……<NL>你可愿久居村中，长留不走，从此安稳度日？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fe5c3e89f4fee3f4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f4487302-e51c-4911-804a-f46efbeb4998/Option_1": {
      "en": "I bear heavy responsibilities, perhaps it's hard to find peace...",
      "cn": "我肩负重任，或许难求安稳……\n",
      "ru": "Я несу тяжелую ответственность, возможно, мне трудно обрести покой...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e2cc9255e9db36a2",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "067d958c-97b8-4f83-bcbe-7ecabe60e4cb/EventContent": {
      "en": "Previously in Yangzhou City, rumors of ghosts were rampant.<NL>Now that this matter has ended, with changes in the world, rumors of the Sanguine Sect have arisen again...",
      "cn": "此前扬州城内，鬼怪传言甚嚣尘上，<NL>如今此事已了，物换星移，却又起血犼教之传言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cc2f98cd12c6e340",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "067d958c-97b8-4f83-bcbe-7ecabe60e4cb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dbba8b7e-54bf-4d04-961b-a7563a10da30/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"After I leave...<NL>Remember to often visit 'the Imperial Chicken,'<NL>as well as the rash little wild boar cub in the forest...<NL>Besides, I have one last wish. Are you willing to hear it?\"",
      "cn": "“我离去之后……<NL>你可要记得，时常去看看‘大王’，<NL>还有林中那莽撞至极的山猪幼崽……<NL>除此之外，我尚有一心愿，你可愿听？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0bb97854ba513ce7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dbba8b7e-54bf-4d04-961b-a7563a10da30/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Nod quietly...)",
      "cn": "（静静点头……）\n",
      "ru": "(Тихо киваю...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a9226cf312b8b494",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "1cd9372c-727f-4c67-bffc-1e9696ca9f5a/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh... You are tender-hearted and compassionate,<NL>and I am well aware of that... Let us have done with this.<NL>Once this matter is over, your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“唉……你多情善感，心慈手软，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，你我多说已是无用，<NL>此间事了，日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "741617daebbd9963",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1cd9372c-727f-4c67-bffc-1e9696ca9f5a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": "(Укол горечи в сердце...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "da4dfa1a-a4ac-470b-95e5-7bf9ef273cf3/EventContent": {
      "en": "Since Jixi came to Taiwu Village, some time had passed...<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices in a sudden<NL>that the girl <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> once knew has grown into a young woman...",
      "cn": "自姬穸来到太吾村，如今已有一些时日……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>猛地察觉，<NL>不知何时，昔日女童今日竟已长成女郎模样……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4af9d96f2750000d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "da4dfa1a-a4ac-470b-95e5-7bf9ef273cf3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixiu is acting like this, indeed suspicious...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸如此，果然蹊跷……）\n",
      "ru": "(Цзисю ведет себя так, действительно подозрительно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "b78774648427733a",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d631593f-5839-4914-acca-e347a751b5ff/EventContent": {
      "en": "After cooking the grains and meats, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> soon had a table full of fine dishes ready.<NL>The dishes were served piping hot, a true feast for the senses with all five flavors, colors, and aromas present.<NL>Though not a rare delicacy, it could certainly be called a delicious meal...",
      "cn": "熟五谷，烹六畜，不多时，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>便悉心张罗了一桌好菜，<NL>菜肴既出，热气袭人，实是五味俱全，色香兼具，<NL>虽非珍馐，亦称得上美味佳肴……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "95fdd98d4e09f2ad",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d631593f-5839-4914-acca-e347a751b5ff/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Enjoy a fine meal together...)",
      "cn": "（共进佳肴……）\n",
      "ru": "(Насладитесь прекрасным ужином вместе...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8dafff4994e10eeb",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5e9f21f1-4b77-4dc5-a396-e165eeb128dc/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If I am not a...<NL>Perhaps, in this life and the next, we can be together for a long time...\"",
      "cn": "“若我并非……<NL>或许……前世今生，皆可与你长久相伴……”",
      "ru": "\"Если я не являюсь...<NL>Возможно, в этой жизни и в следующей мы сможем быть вместе долгое время...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "1983581095d1f859",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5e9f21f1-4b77-4dc5-a396-e165eeb128dc/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Doesn't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": "(Не понимает смысла...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8402620a8c17d479",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "dc11198f-4f74-41ef-a86f-bb9e8adb89f2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Since we parted ways, I have wandered the world.<NL>Forced to feed on humans, life has become tasteless and filled with suffering.<NL>I wish for you to come and release my soul from this torment...\"<NL>The person in front of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> sighs lightly, her eyes remaining calm and serene...",
      "cn": "“与你分别至今，我始终游荡世间，<NL>纵然深恶痛绝，却只得食人为生，自然再不可与你同去，<NL>百般苦痛，了无趣味，只盼你能再来渡我，令我魂归故梦……”<NL>只见眼前之人轻叹一声，鲜红双眸，始终古井无波……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "71d35fab221c8504",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dc11198f-4f74-41ef-a86f-bb9e8adb89f2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A deep feeling of sadness...)",
      "cn": "（心中悲切……）\n",
      "ru": "(Глубокое чувство печали...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "32102ddd90e8c5d4",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0c00b816-4064-4fde-97ec-e5e824ddfb80/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"What is this...<NL>I am not an ordinary person, and this item seems to be more useful to you...\"<NL>Jixi ponders for a moment but ultimately doesn't accept <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>...",
      "cn": "“这是何物……<NL>我非寻常之人，此物于你，似乎更有用处……”<NL>姬穸思忖片刻，仍是没有收下<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "aca92db3dd3d7276",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c00b816-4064-4fde-97ec-e5e824ddfb80/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "75711f61-8e8c-4cdb-9cae-b2c89fb455c5/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> takes Jixi's small hand and enters Taiwu Village.<NL>Jixi looks around with great interests, still frowning<NL>but resembling more of a child than before...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>随即牵着姬穸的小手进入太吾村内，<NL>姬穸兴致盎然，不时张望，虽仍是紧蹙眉头，<NL>但比之先前，倒更似个年幼孩童了……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "77141b3f7bb0e09f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "75711f61-8e8c-4cdb-9cae-b2c89fb455c5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A feeling of joy...)",
      "cn": "（心中欢喜……）\n",
      "ru": "(Чувство радости...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3f838ed54b4e1da6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "7a667528-67b9-457d-8312-31fe1f98c271/EventContent": {
      "en": "A person approached with an aura of hostility and bloodshed.<NL>The purpose was unclear...<NL>Upon seeing this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> becomes extremely cautious...",
      "cn": "只见来人杀气腾腾，浑身血腥，<NL>不知究竟是何来意，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见此情状，自是心生万分警惕……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1dcf28cb138c5e51",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7a667528-67b9-457d-8312-31fe1f98c271/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "18403428-2f90-4177-a14b-2ad089442704/EventContent": {
      "en": "Everything about the Red-Robed Senior is unnatural.<NL>A single glance is all it takes for the realization to strike <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>:<NL>Jixi consumed blood, but never murdered.<NL>The murderer is this Jiangshi Senior right in front of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>!",
      "cn": "只见那红衣老人周身迹象，皆不寻常，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只多瞧一眼，便转瞬了悟，<NL>姬穸虽曾吸食人血，却未伤人性命，害人性命者，便是眼前这僵尸老人！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5775c1111fdcb2a7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18403428-2f90-4177-a14b-2ad089442704/Option_1": {
      "en": "You wicked ghost! You deserve to die!",
      "cn": "你这恶鬼！死不足惜！\n",
      "ru": "Ты злой призрак! Ты заслуживаешь смерти!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6ed553bf70bd721c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "eb7d28a2-559e-4014-bd13-e7722bd4324d/EventContent": {
      "en": "The moment <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> feels displeased, the Sanguine Sect disciple strikes.<NL>They push the passerby aside<NL>and lunge toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> with hand claws!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中不悦，那血犼弟子也毫不相让，<NL>眉毛一横，将那知情路人甩向一旁，<NL>双手成爪，便大踏步朝<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>走来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd9a04a5e93dd4c7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "eb7d28a2-559e-4014-bd13-e7722bd4324d/Option_1": {
      "en": "Come on, you little hooligan!",
      "cn": "邪派宵小，出手便是！",
      "ru": "Ну же, ты, маленький хулиган!",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "08ad0426d5f3d46d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "eb7d28a2-559e-4014-bd13-e7722bd4324d/Option_2": {
      "en": "(This evil sect is arrogant, but for now, it's better to avoid...)",
      "cn": "（邪派猖狂，暂避一时……）\n",
      "ru": "(Эта злая Секта высокомерна, но сейчас ее лучше избегать...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "8777f43dad313602",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "77f91036-a4ab-4c47-b644-988cf2a4ff9f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Why did I intervene earlier?<NL>Because if I don't kill them, they will harm you. Since I am traveling with you, I can't just stand by and do nothing...\"",
      "cn": "“你问我此前为何出手杀敌？<NL>我不杀敌，敌便伤你，既然我随你而行，又岂会坐视不理……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7b9717cc34c8e078",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "77f91036-a4ab-4c47-b644-988cf2a4ff9f/Option_1": {
      "en": "I see...",
      "cn": "原来如此……\n",
      "ru": "Я понимаю...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c500fbb9698454bc",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "537ac657-4745-4e53-8605-38c5fa2ec2cb/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"For me, it's not a difficult task,<NL>just a natural instinct. You don't have to worry too much about it...\"<NL>Jixi shakes her head and speaks no more.",
      "cn": "“于我而言，并非难事，<NL>不过随手为之，你亦不必放在心上……”<NL>姬穸摇摇头，不再多说。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cf65fd8d677e4c8e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "537ac657-4745-4e53-8605-38c5fa2ec2cb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": "(На данный момент этого достаточно...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "0ca2fbda-931c-4da9-8543-c094edc82173/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I didn't expect that...<NL>Now I understand your intentions...\"<NL>Jixi gazes deeply at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>,<NL>her crimson eyes filled with countless emotions...",
      "cn": "“竟是如此……<NL>你的心意，我已明白……”<NL>姬穸只深深凝望<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，鲜红眸中，<NL>千言万语，再难道尽……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d8ac0f2a39b25d6b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0ca2fbda-931c-4da9-8543-c094edc82173/Option_1": {
      "en": "You should leave now. If anyone troubles you in the future... I will take care of everything...",
      "cn": "你这便走吧，此后若有人与你为难……万事有我……\n",
      "ru": "Тебе следует сейчас же уйти. Если кто-нибудь побеспокоит вас в будущем... Я обо всем позабочусь...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "616f069f201a7033",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d90176b3-0c3f-4b23-80e7-dbc40a441063/EventContent": {
      "en": "The red-robed senior has a body covered in dark and black fur,<NL>with eyes void of life, and claws as sharp as iron.<NL>On his tattered clothes, the stench of death is mixed with the scent of blood, traces of blood can be vaguely seen...",
      "cn": "眼前红衣老者，浑身青黑，长满骇人毛发，<NL>双目浑然死气，利爪削铁如泥，铜皮铁骨，庞然如山，<NL>浓浓尸气之中混杂血腥之气，破碎衣衫之上，隐约可见红褐血迹……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0a425862105aaec5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d90176b3-0c3f-4b23-80e7-dbc40a441063/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Traces of fresh blood... various abnormalities... the true culprit is revealed...)",
      "cn": "（新鲜血迹……种种异状……真凶已显……）\n",
      "ru": "(Следы свежей крови... различные отклонения... истинный виновник раскрыт...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "38cd4698adb3f006",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "5ed070d2-2fb4-4627-96a4-f9a317d516a6/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is now powerless, succumbing to darkness.<NL>Only Jixi's small figure stands alone against the daunting figure of the red-robed senior...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>此时再无力睁眼，昏黑袭来，<NL>唯余姬穸小小的身影，独面那炼化至深的红衣老人……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5d47ec035b8f13c4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5ed070d2-2fb4-4627-96a4-f9a317d516a6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "6ef8a4c5-ac1c-46f6-911e-77192f810b6d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So be it...<NL>Since I have a thirst for blood and a craving to feed on humans, there will come a day when I can no longer control my ghostly nature...\"<NL>Jixi listens to <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s words, though her expression is melancholic, she seems to have already foreseen it...",
      "cn": "“如此……也好……<NL>我既然嗜血食人，终有一日，或将鬼性难抑……”<NL>姬穸听闻<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>之话，虽神情郁郁，却似是早已料到……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f6d23094e8be65e5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ef8a4c5-ac1c-46f6-911e-77192f810b6d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": "(...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "4e5a60e0-eefd-42c0-8f05-5351886c52bd/EventContent": {
      "en": "Outmatched by the Red-Robed Senior,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> seizes a moment of distraction and slips away...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时不敌红衣老人，趁其不备，<NL>只得逃之夭夭……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "afcc71f3347d9efc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4e5a60e0-eefd-42c0-8f05-5351886c52bd/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1a019f82-ab5c-4b96-a6f5-4d9be1511bd2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh... You do as you please, with unrestrained imagination<NL>and I'm well aware of that... Let us have done with this.<NL>Once this matter is over, your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“唉……你从心所欲，天马行空，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，你我多说已是无用，<NL>此间事了，日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7772c5d58fa685b1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1a019f82-ab5c-4b96-a6f5-4d9be1511bd2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8ff8623e-a463-4365-9143-0ac2b55e2552/EventContent": {
      "en": "After the battle, Jixi can no longer hold on.<NL>Her body is stained with crimson, and her ghostly nature has dissipated. Although she falls to the ground and cannot rise again, she finally finds a peaceful state of mind, looking relieved...",
      "cn": "一战之后，姬穸再难支撑，<NL>身染猩红，鬼性散失，虽倒地难起，却是终得重归安宁般，神情释然……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2c5ff7d86d0e6793",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8ff8623e-a463-4365-9143-0ac2b55e2552/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8cf5b30c-468a-47be-b6e0-b6eaa4e6c10a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Looking at the fields ahead, Jixi softly says,<NL>\"When I lie in the ancient tomb, I didn't expect to open my eyes again<NL>and witness the world's beauty by your side...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸目光望向田野，又再轻声道：<NL>“长眠古墓之中时，未曾料及，<NL>我尚有重新睁眼，与你并肩看这世间风景之日……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d1d691ca406e1977",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8cf5b30c-468a-47be-b6e0-b6eaa4e6c10a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c3bef84a-8dc3-4874-9fbf-b1e5181bab3b/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, the Red-Robed Senior becomes even more formidable.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> senses the danger and breaks into a cold sweat. However, just at that moment,<NL>Jixi, who has been protecting <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, steps forward and stands between <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> and the Red-Robed Senior...",
      "cn": "此时的红衣老人，比之从前，更为难缠，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，冷汗已下，却就在此时，<NL>方才护在身后的姬穸已然闪身而出，挡在<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与僵尸老人之间……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ef9064241da5f92f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c3bef84a-8dc3-4874-9fbf-b1e5181bab3b/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! No!",
      "cn": "姬穸！不可如此！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4aabe7eef748e3a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2308f669-29b6-474e-8b28-45660620d816/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi sighs lightly and continues,<NL>\"If you want to know who harmed the villagers, I can tell you.<NL>You don't have to rack your brain trying to find the true culprit...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸轻叹一声，继而又道：<NL>“你若欲问村人受伤之事，<NL>我确然知晓，你亦无需再绞尽脑汁，寻那真凶……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dfccc17eb4055d76",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2308f669-29b6-474e-8b28-45660620d816/Option_1": {
      "en": "Do you know who the true culprit is?",
      "cn": "你知晓真凶是谁？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "734fa1cc9015bb5f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5bf8286d-9d91-4f99-bcce-ba39e97fe19e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If it weren't for the sound of the bell calling me,<NL>I would've been lying in my grave, never able to see the light of day again.<NL>It's fortunate that we can have this brief reunion in this life.\"<NL><NL>Jixi's final words seem to suggest that she has already learned about the meaning of life. It seems that she wants to say more but ends up falling silent.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s heart aches as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> gazes silently at her, both at a loss for words...",
      "cn": "“若非昔日铃音唤我，<NL>我本该长眠墓中，再不见天日，<NL>你我能得此短暂重聚，亦是此生之幸，纵我不在，你亦不必伤怀……”<NL><NL>姬穸最后说至此处，似是已人事看透，欲语还休，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中一痛，与她静静相望，一时亦是无言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5522dcbb47c92738",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5bf8286d-9d91-4f99-bcce-ba39e97fe19e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(The brief reunion?)",
      "cn": "（短暂重聚？）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "43ec6c3ae6aedcd5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "655b85ba-c9c4-4d2f-8335-b536c8415504/EventContent": {
      "en": "There is no time for words. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> moves to shield Jixi,<NL>pulling her clear of the ambush. As they steady themselves,<NL>they find a familiar black-and-red form—the Red-Robed Senior! He emerges from the shadows, more a corpse than before!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>未及多言，只挡在姬穸身前，<NL>携她一同闪过这始料未及的突袭，待得回过神来，定睛一望，<NL>眼前黑红身影分外眼熟，竟是已然更似尸鬼的红衣老人，不知从何处现身！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "98305e6c061d83f0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "655b85ba-c9c4-4d2f-8335-b536c8415504/Option_1": {
      "en": "As expected, it is the red-robed senior!",
      "cn": "果真是那红衣老人！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2b12319a8a604f94",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e3889606-d725-4cef-95c7-bde1feacdd19/EventContent": {
      "en": "As Jixi gazes steadily at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, murmuring some words,<NL>and before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can hear clearly, the red-robed senior attacks again...",
      "cn": "姬穸只定定望向<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，口中喃喃数语，<NL>未等<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>听清，红衣老人便已再次飞身袭来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8de3742325f937c2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e3889606-d725-4cef-95c7-bde1feacdd19/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Take on the desperate fight!)",
      "cn": "（拼死一战！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "358192440cca5e73",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "711e22a1-706a-4633-87de-7cd19f1577cf/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I have no place to return to... I would wander the heavens and earth...<NL>Our past ties are difficult to continue... Let's part ways here...\"",
      "cn": "“我已无归处……游荡天地……<NL>你我前缘已难再续……不如就此别过……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cbe726a1c421ff56",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "711e22a1-706a-4633-87de-7cd19f1577cf/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Feeling helpless...)",
      "cn": "（无可奈何……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "da35b0984e20c125",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ecd20c73-9562-4bff-bbf0-7c530f78c4b8/EventContent": {
      "en": "All things in the world, like the ever-changing tides and boundless seas, are transient.<NL>However, the people of the underworld have all fallen into slumber, as if transforming into the heavens, earth, sun, and moon, which are no longer subject to changes...",
      "cn": "世间万物，虽如桑田碧海，转瞬皆非，<NL>九冥之人，却皆已沉眠，如化天地日月，不再变换……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d3777b0d985302bf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ecd20c73-9562-4bff-bbf0-7c530f78c4b8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a34ef366-6ca2-4145-b793-481ffad4cac1/EventContent": {
      "en": "Just as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is about to inquire further, three figures suddenly flash out.<NL>One of them swiftly reaches out with hand claws, grabbing the throat of the informed passerby.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> gazes and sees that they are three disciples of the Sanguine Sect...",
      "cn": "正待细问之时，三道人影突然闪出，<NL>其中一人，倏然伸出手爪，立时便掐住了那知情路人的咽喉，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>定睛一看，来的竟是三名血犼教弟子……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4beec4fd2aa55037",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a34ef366-6ca2-4145-b793-481ffad4cac1/Option_1": {
      "en": "The Sanguine Sect?!",
      "cn": "血犼教！？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11bf1984248aa151",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4e8c1c0f-6c10-4cab-a71b-2c6e0411dcdd/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3acce883-c663-4b86-83cd-c841b6a6034e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Even if old joys are like dreams, they are now beyond reach...<NL>The world is vast, and I'm alone, not knowing where to go...\"",
      "cn": "“纵然旧欢如梦，如今无处追寻……<NL>天地浩大，我又是孑然一身，不知去往何处……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "83f979c4f21b39c7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3acce883-c663-4b86-83cd-c841b6a6034e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why is that?)",
      "cn": "（此为何故……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "63f07e4b758e62c0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "686b5ffa-cb7b-4f6f-8ec6-9101c7cbd922/EventContent": {
      "en": "Although Jixi has no smile on her face,<NL>her eyes are full of curiosity, saying,<NL>\"It seems quite similar to what I imagined, so I'll stay here for now...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸虽无笑颜，<NL>眼中却是充满好奇：<NL>“似与我想像中颇为相似，我便暂且在此处住下……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2557b9b5c1ba81b1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "686b5ffa-cb7b-4f6f-8ec6-9101c7cbd922/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Enter the village together...)",
      "cn": "（一同入村……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8296fea66433144d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "efaa92e0-6450-4e20-83c0-8a2f3b01d4f3/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can contain <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> curiosity no longer and blurts out a question.<NL>It startles the group, who have been deep in conversation. A flicker of annoyance crosses their faces...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>听得好奇，不免出声询问，<NL>饮茶数人正凝神交谈，因这突然的发问吓得一抖，神色间不免几分埋怨……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "75be506f358f9719",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "efaa92e0-6450-4e20-83c0-8a2f3b01d4f3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0c7998a-7d39-4e98-a9d5-c057542c6d77/EventContent": {
      "en": "Thinking of this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> feels that the red-robed senior seems to have mastered some kind of secret skill,<NL>but before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> can think further, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> suddenly smells the stench of blood,<NL>as if the bones and blood are being cooked in this mortal world, with a foul and rotten stench flooding everywhere.<NL>In an instant, several streams of blood-red light seep out from the ground, shrouding the mountains and fields, constantly changing.<NL>The scene looks extremely bizarre and unusual, far from ordinary...",
      "cn": "思及此处，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只觉红衣老人似是秘法已成，<NL>只是未及多想，鼻间便忽感血腥之气，<NL>分明人间天地，竟似有骨血烹煮般，腐臭异馥，翻涌四散，<NL>顷刻间，便有数道血光自地下渗出，笼罩山野，变幻不定，<NL>此情此景，极是诡谲怪异，实非寻常……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fbd31280ab5e18bc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0c7998a-7d39-4e98-a9d5-c057542c6d77/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Bewildered...)",
      "cn": "（惊异不已……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c37585dc680aa205",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "71808dbc-54e0-44b6-8294-0552e255d74c/EventContent": {
      "en": "Previously in Yangzhou City, rumors of ghosts were rampant.<NL>Now that this matter has ended, with changes in the world, rumors of the Sanguine Sect have arisen again...",
      "cn": "此前扬州城内，鬼怪传言甚嚣尘上，<NL>如今此事已了，物换星移，却又起血犼教之传言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cc2f98cd12c6e340",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "71808dbc-54e0-44b6-8294-0552e255d74c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "098c67bd-f157-4fd8-9b6c-95ba933a6381/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi seems a bit reluctant, but then decisively shakes her head, saying,<NL>\"You may forgive, but I cannot. Harming others goes against human principles.<NL>But as a ghost, I can't fight my nature—I have to kill, even when I hate it.<NL>There will be a day when I won't recognize anyone anymore, not even you.<NL><NL>If you want to kill me today, I will not resent the blow.<NL>If you don't, I vow never to set foot in Taiwu again...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸眼中几分不舍，复又决然摇头：<NL>“即便你不欲追究，我亦自知伤人之举有违天理，<NL>只是身为妖鬼，纵然违心，却终究不能抑制鬼性，只得如此害人性命，<NL>终有一日，连你，我也不会再认得……<NL><NL>今日你若要杀我，我绝无丝毫怨言，<NL>你若不愿杀我，我此生亦不会再踏入太吾村中……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b5a818809e33804c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "098c67bd-f157-4fd8-9b6c-95ba933a6381/Option_1": {
      "en": "You clearly don't want to eat people, yet you're suffering like this...",
      "cn": "你分明不愿食人，却身受此种煎熬……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c500524689e154c8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "be4f00d6-9f8e-4421-862f-40b5dad5d131/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi casually turned her face, her gaze seemingly lost in the distance.<NL>\"During these days, thank you for taking me in, providing me with food,<NL>taking care of my daily life,<NL>and allowing me to witness the gentle breeze and the myriad of creatures...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸轻轻侧过脸，视线却不知落于何方：<NL>“这些时日，多谢有你收留我在此，<NL>你予我饭食，照料我之起居，<NL>亦令我得见和风煦日，万物生灵……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "73784ab52e8edf1e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "be4f00d6-9f8e-4421-862f-40b5dad5d131/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5e523093-d5f7-4dc0-bcd9-994fe57c2358/EventContent": {
      "en": "With things coming to this point, Jixi already has the intention to leave, on the verge of parting,<NL>but torn in her heart, unable to find a way to follow her nature while living a peaceful life. Even if <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> wants to persuade her to stay, <Character key=oleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> has no words to say...<NL><NL>As they stand silently, facing each other, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> suddenly feels a cold wind blowing around them, foul and overpowering.<NL>In an instant, a pair of sharp claws fly toward them from behind!",
      "cn": "事已至此，姬穸已然心生去意，眼看别离在即，<NL>却是心中两难，求不得双全之法，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>纵要开口挽留，却亦无话可说……<NL><NL>相顾无言时，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>忽觉四周阴风大作，腐臭逼人，<NL>刹时之间，一双五指利爪自身后破空而来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cc83ababad2591c2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5e523093-d5f7-4dc0-bcd9-994fe57c2358/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Oh, no!)",
      "cn": "（暗叫不好！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5232eacaa076ceab",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fbe266d5-2d76-4be1-b932-bab09771f68c/EventContent": {
      "en": "As all settle down, the informant first expresses his gratitude and thanks,<NL>then takes a sip of tea before speaking to <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>.<NL>\"Let me explain this to you in detail...<NL>Everyone knows about the prosperity of Yangzhou City, but not long ago,<NL>there were often shadows of ghosts, sometimes appearing and disappearing.<NL>During the day, everything was all right, but at night,<NL>one could hear eerie and eerie sounds, like wailing and crying, chilling to the bone...\"",
      "cn": "待得几人坐定，那知情人先是感激拜谢一番，<NL>继而又饮茶一口，细细为<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>说道：<NL>“我且为你细说此事……<NL>世人皆知扬州繁华，不久前，<NL>却常有鬼怪之影，时隐时现，<NL>白日间倒是好些，等入了夜，<NL>便能听见阴森诡谲之声，犹如怨诉哭嚎，毛骨悚然……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b71f0f60b5e7aa03",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fbe266d5-2d76-4be1-b932-bab09771f68c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "81180be6-c56b-4ea8-b9d3-761e52bb0d4f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Feed the chickens? Let me think about it...\"<NL>Jixi's eyes widened, and she wouldn't take another step forward.<NL>As she hesitated, she even showed signs of backing away, as if she were genuinely terrified of the small chickens...",
      "cn": "“喂鸡？此事容我细思……”<NL>只见姬穸瞪大双眼，裹足不前，<NL>迟疑间，竟有后退躲闪之迹象，似乎当真怕极那小小元鸡……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "42f5eed2ad3d4716",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "81180be6-c56b-4ea8-b9d3-761e52bb0d4f/Option_1": {
      "en": "If you're really that scared, maybe we should leave for now...",
      "cn": "若你当真怕极，你我不如暂离此处……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "002925f243b28dce",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "37a79476-9ce3-464a-b1a7-8fb5ce06a5c9/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The things are the same, but it's the people who have changed...<NL>I should've known that the past is just an illusion, and the fate in the past life is difficult to continue in a new one...\"",
      "cn": "“其物如故，却是物是人非……<NL>我早该知晓，前尘旧梦本为空，他生因缘自难续……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fb791d99c25cf567",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "37a79476-9ce3-464a-b1a7-8fb5ce06a5c9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Doesn't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8402620a8c17d479",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dcad7254-ec58-4cc2-9137-d03ac4e13f02/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s investigation into the bizarre occurrences in the village has been going on for a long time.<NL>Although the truth seems to have been revealed, there are still lingering threads of mysteries that are hard to unravel...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>调查村中怪事已久，<NL>如今水落石现，似已探得究竟，却仍有丝丝缕缕，难以断明……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "704017212dfff7b3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dcad7254-ec58-4cc2-9137-d03ac4e13f02/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8a00cd07-df1a-474b-8153-748a4ecaa888/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> fought bravely, but ultimately couldn't withstand the red-robed senior.<NL>Struck in a vital spot, he collapses in a pool of blood...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>拼死一战，却终究难敌红衣老人，<NL>被击中要害，倒在了一地血泊之中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "499738daa784e3f5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8a00cd07-df1a-474b-8153-748a4ecaa888/Option_1": {
      "en": "Ugh... Argh...",
      "cn": "呃……啊……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4494168915cd4bf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e501c1c7-14da-4050-8721-80451acd4f61/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"The Ultimate Yin Jiangshi has emerged from the tomb,<NL>originally coming for me.<NL>Since you trust me so much, I'll naturally stand with you to eliminate that Jiangshi completely...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那太阴老尸如今破墓而出，<NL>原是为寻我而来，你既然如此信我，<NL>我自然与你一道，将那老尸斩草除根……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b933c043679aba05",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e501c1c7-14da-4050-8721-80451acd4f61/Option_1": {
      "en": "So that is the truth... It would be great if we can handle this together...",
      "cn": "真相原是如此……你我齐心，如此甚好……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8aa45e6d3a280d00",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f2470c72-7e1f-4cff-bc5f-4810882cdb97/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The name of Taiwu Village seems to have a deep connection with you...<NL>Could it be that this is your hometown?\"",
      "cn": "“太吾村之名……似与你颇有渊源……<NL>莫非此处便是你的家乡？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6ef125721688befa",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f2470c72-7e1f-4cff-bc5f-4810882cdb97/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Elaborate on the origins of Taiwu Village...)",
      "cn": "（详述太吾村之渊源……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4f47e862d608416a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5dca367f-55ec-46fd-9b5b-3f41a594a30c/EventContent": {
      "en": "Looking at the fresh mound in front of them and the now lifeless red-robed senior, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is still in shock, wanting to observe further, but unable to make sense of it...",
      "cn": "眼前坟冢既成，红衣老人之死显然亦无转圜，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽是惊疑未定，然再欲细观，却也不得其解……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "05e087c6f001efc8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5dca367f-55ec-46fd-9b5b-3f41a594a30c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a5844f1f-1d6e-495c-95db-79cd1deaba9a/EventContent": {
      "en": "<color=#lightgrey>(What should I give Jixi as a gift?)</color>",
      "cn": "<color=#lightgrey>（不知应当赠送姬穸何物……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "91c679f22ee4abb5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a5844f1f-1d6e-495c-95db-79cd1deaba9a/Option_1": {
      "en": "Confirm",
      "cn": "确定",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8ed0c6b282caf17d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a5844f1f-1d6e-495c-95db-79cd1deaba9a/Option_2": {
      "en": "Cancel",
      "cn": "取消\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "748e25d8f930bfa8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1535e7e2-e156-46dd-b190-38072078397f/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this very moment, Jixi's eyes meet again, and she falls into a deep slumber,<NL>her voice fading, leaving <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> to gaze at the horizon, not knowing what to think...",
      "cn": "此时此刻，姬穸又将重合双眼，陷入长眠，<NL>声息渐失之时，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>望向天边，不知作何所思……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2085af9d2d7a7409",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1535e7e2-e156-46dd-b190-38072078397f/Option_1": {
      "en": "Fleeting are the dreams of mortals, I only hope that your dreams from now on are long, happy, and free of sorrow...",
      "cn": "人间梦短，只盼你今后长梦喜乐，再无烦忧……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "79fdb1645b065dc3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b54676cd-9aed-4810-aa42-26ac8a4cdf6f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Now we part ways. Do take care of yourslef.<NL>When we meet again, if you seek to slay me, there is no need for mercy...\"<NL><NL>Jixi says and gazes at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> for a moment longer, and takes her leave...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(From now on, Jixi will not be accompanying <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>. The two part here...)</color>",
      "cn": "“如今你我就此作别，你万事保重，<NL>来日见我，若欲诛杀，亦无需手下留情……”<NL><NL>姬穸说至此处，<NL>又再凝望<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>片刻，此后便转身离去……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（今后姬穸将不再同行，两人就此分离……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c57a137d9d4a9afa",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b54676cd-9aed-4810-aa42-26ac8a4cdf6f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7fe1c526-293d-4a21-b3f2-f8e7bdb64f63/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You remain calm and composed, always going with the flow.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你从容自若，安时处顺，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "560764e7da94f306",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7fe1c526-293d-4a21-b3f2-f8e7bdb64f63/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a6be9e28-f367-497a-9090-4b5a50bee30f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"There is no thanks to be given...<NL>Your fate is not for me to know, and I fear my words may lead to your death...\"<NL>The informant shakes their head slowly, then turns their attention to the tea, falling silent.<NL>Seeing everyone at a loss for words, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> folds <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> hands to bid everyone farewell and leaves the tea house...",
      "cn": "“不知你命数几何，<NL>此言或将害你一命，又何必言谢……”<NL>知情人几番摇头，只自顾饮茶，不再言语，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见诸人皆无话可言，只得拱手道别，离了茶寮……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b0d7f7dc79234c11",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a6be9e28-f367-497a-9090-4b5a50bee30f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Leave the tea house...)",
      "cn": "（离开茶寮……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e0529fa2b9f3ac6b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3bc51a38-c962-4c4d-82e4-6e0c29b31edb/EventContent": {
      "en": "The senior's angry voice rises but <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> only hears the word \"bell\"<NL>and suddenly recalls an object in <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> bag, an rusted bell from a grave <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> discovered outside of the Sanguine Sect.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> never thought it would be the artifact of the red-robed senior...",
      "cn": "老者恶声渐起，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>却只听得“铃铛”一词，<NL>恍然想起自己行囊之中，确有此前在血犼教外，某处坟墓寻得之物，<NL>正是一破旧铃铛！彼时只觉颇不寻常，未曾料及，此物竟是红衣老人之法器……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bda1b9c0029c2a25",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3bc51a38-c962-4c4d-82e4-6e0c29b31edb/Option_1": {
      "en": "If this thing is your artifact, why would it be in the grave?!",
      "cn": "此物若是你的法器，如何会在墓中！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9073bfac094f4306",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Ever since I arrived at Taiwu Village, I've been spending my days leisurely, with a tranquil heart...<NL>Nothing concerns me...\"",
      "cn": "“自从来此太吾村，悠闲度日，心静无物，<NL>我并无心事……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "337dc496d7b7a15a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/Option_1": {
      "en": "Although you say so, your face is filled with worry, there is no need to feign strength...",
      "cn": "话虽如此，你分明愁容满面，不必逞强……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "43d846ceef080d54",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/Option_2": {
      "en": "Upon seeing your furrowed brows, my heart gets uneasy as well...",
      "cn": "见你如此愁眉不展，我亦是心绪难安……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a6b53096e8440046",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/Option_3": {
      "en": "With worry etched on your face, can you still claim to have a tranquil heart?",
      "cn": "愁思既上眉头，又怎称得上是心静无物……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "71766e042253b3bc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/Option_4": {
      "en": "If you truly have no pressing matters to discuss with me, then I shall take my leave.",
      "cn": "你若当真无甚心事要与我说，我可要走了？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "db397f12bec0995a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f99f46b0-d17f-4841-8e19-3ffd1253ef8c/Option_5": {
      "en": "Speak, and I will listen. I will take care of everything for you so you need not worry any longer...",
      "cn": "说与我听，万事有我，且不必再忧心……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4feeb1ac8e9ebbe0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "04f025f5-7eb1-48d8-b3ce-4d94607d3cc4/EventContent": {
      "en": "The Sanguine Sect disciples sealed the tomb and scoured it for their Founder, all in vain.<NL>The sect fell into turmoil, lamenting how their Founder's final resting place had come to such a wretched state.<NL>Their quest had faded into nothingness; any hope of the founder's divine protection was now a delusion.<NL>Amidst the sighs and despair, morale crumbled. Even the power of their forbidden techniques began to wane, its former menace forever diminished...",
      "cn": "血犼弟子封墓搜寻祖师，终是无果，<NL>血犼教中，一时风雨飘摇，只道祖师之墓，如今沦落至此，<NL>追寻祖师一事转眼成空，遑论求得庇佑，业已是痴心妄想，<NL>悲叹唏嘘，人不自安，竟连邪功之力亦是日益衰竭，再不复往日气焰……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b7b1a0dc87c6239d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "04f025f5-7eb1-48d8-b3ce-4d94607d3cc4/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "337bcb3b-8793-4d89-97e0-5c772e507bc4/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, the Red-Robed Senior becomes even more formidable.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> senses the danger and breaks into a cold sweat. However, just at that moment,<NL>Jixi, who has been protecting <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, steps forward and stands between <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> and the Red-Robed Senior...",
      "cn": "此时的红衣老人，比之从前，更为难缠，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，冷汗已下，却就在此时，<NL>方才护在身后的姬穸已然闪身而出，挡在<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与僵尸老人之间……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ef9064241da5f92f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "337bcb3b-8793-4d89-97e0-5c772e507bc4/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! No!",
      "cn": "姬穸！不可如此！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4aabe7eef748e3a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "92e80c01-8ecf-4aa1-a0ff-ca38040bc877/EventContent": {
      "en": "When <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> first heard this,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> couldn't help but ask Jixi why she had such an idea.<NL>Jixi frowned slightly, a troubled look on her face:<NL>\"I was walking through the village earlier when I met a chicken. It was truly startling...<NL>That chicken seems to be called the 'Imperial Chicken.' It must be quite extraordinary and not to be underestimated...\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>乍闻此事，<NL>不免询问起姬穸何故萌生此意，<NL>只见姬穸轻轻蹙眉，神色多有不安：<NL>“此前我于村中散步，偶遇一鸡，实在惊心……<NL>此鸡似乎名唤‘大王’，想必极是不凡，不可小觑……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd1770aefcb7f8ac",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "92e80c01-8ecf-4aa1-a0ff-ca38040bc877/Option_1": {
      "en": "I see...",
      "cn": "竟是如此……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c500fbb9698454bc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c1f3fd40-bcee-443c-970a-ce315947eb34/EventContent": {
      "en": "Though <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> intends to eliminate Jixi, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> is ultimately struck in a vital spot and collapses in a pool of blood...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽欲除姬穸，却终被击中要害，<NL>倒在了一地血泊之中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b1468966aac6c568",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c1f3fd40-bcee-443c-970a-ce315947eb34/Option_1": {
      "en": "Ugh... Argh...",
      "cn": "呃……啊……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4494168915cd4bf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "05222cb4-7f31-439c-a508-9e097410ac22/EventContent": {
      "en": "With time running out and the crisis at hand, Jixi sighs, but says no more.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> sees her raise her hand, concentrate, and shout loudly at the Jiangshi senior, \"I am the Lord of Ghosts, the Dominator of All Graves.<NL>Even if I'm bound by countless calamities, I won't tolerate your insolence here!\"",
      "cn": "时间紧迫，危机当前，<NL>姬穸轻叹一声，却是再无别话，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只见她抬手一挥，凝神捏诀，向那僵尸老人大喊一声：<NL><NL>“我乃千鬼之王，万墓老祖，<NL>纵受百千劫缚，也容不得你在此放肆！”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0d6e4d19a3dec387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "05222cb4-7f31-439c-a508-9e097410ac22/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi!",
      "cn": "姬穸！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a2132f13233c264e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e95a7f7a-36fe-44db-ab74-20d849b92019/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I detest the bloody cannibalism as well.<NL>Unfortunately, I'm born like this, my ghostly nature is hard to extinguish so I cannot control it...\"",
      "cn": "“嗜血食人，我亦无比憎恶，<NL>可惜我天生如此，鬼性难灭，无法自控……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ca2e132289fe1090",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e95a7f7a-36fe-44db-ab74-20d849b92019/Option_1": {
      "en": "Born like this? Could it be that you were born a ghost... That's impossible...",
      "cn": "天生如此？莫非你天生是鬼……绝无可能……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "de26e25114cfda96",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "443c723a-3aff-4788-a34f-8c8c2636cdab/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light..<NL><NL>\"I've been dead for a long time, but have returned to the world.<NL>I can only survive by feeding on human blood, there is no divine skill for me to practice...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“我身死已久，却又重回人世，<NL>方只得吸食人血为生，哪有什么神功可练……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4d5c632bf308e49b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "443c723a-3aff-4788-a34f-8c8c2636cdab/Option_1": {
      "en": "You are not an ordinary person, naturally you should not be buried in that ancient tomb...",
      "cn": "你非常人，自然不该埋没古墓之中……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a69dfae682aeeff4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/EventContent": {
      "en": "Though the rumor wasn't entirely true,<NL>it was close enough to the mark. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> didn't know whether to laugh or cry.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> also heard that the Sanguine Sect, believing the rumor, had already dispatched several disciples<NL>to stop at nothing to find out where <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> was...",
      "cn": "此种传言，虽为不实，<NL>却竟也猜了个大概，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时哭笑不得，<NL>又听闻血犼教中听信传言，业已派出数名弟子，<NL>不择手段，四处探听，势要寻得<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>如今所在……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "58665d49832f2241",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Evil doers will be punished if they come...)",
      "cn": "（作恶之徒，若来必诛……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a81f41caea7cfc38",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/Option_2": {
      "en": "(I feel guilty for endangering others...)",
      "cn": "（危及他人，心有愧疚……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d90f0abd329f0522",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/Option_3": {
      "en": "(They hold no good intention on me...)",
      "cn": "（来者不善，善者不来……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f4cc9fd3d3060204",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/Option_4": {
      "en": "(Just come get me, I'm feeling bored...)",
      "cn": "（来得正好，我正无聊……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6a24c21c5f7ae4c3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bbf2c61c-d85e-4b0f-a677-b0a533f8cfc7/Option_5": {
      "en": "(Just a bunch of ants not worth fearing...)",
      "cn": "（蝼蚁之辈，不足为惧……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f41e5902958dc16b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "31301ca7-5c25-49dc-9c73-23797e0d1cdc/EventContent": {
      "en": "Upon careful consideration, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> realizes that the Red-Robed Senior was obsessed with \"searching for the founder\" when he was alive and after he died.<NL>The eerie bloodgleams are likely related to the \"founder.\"<NL>If there are any further anomalies, maybe <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can investigate where the \"founder\" is...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>细细想来，那红衣老人生前死去，<NL>皆执念于“寻得祖师”一事，眼见如此异样血光，<NL>只怕与他口中“祖师”不无干系，若有异象再生，或许可以前往查探一番……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "26261da8d5f295e5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "31301ca7-5c25-49dc-9c73-23797e0d1cdc/Option_1": {
      "en": "Perhaps I can find where the \"founder\" is...",
      "cn": "说不得便能寻得那“祖师”何在……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "19b86c3c3e94acd2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "729c6106-e3ac-4486-8dcb-24207d625f9d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Even if old affections are like dreams, there is nowhere to seek them now...<NL>The world is vast, and I'm alone, not knowing where to go...\"",
      "cn": "“纵然旧欢如梦，如今无处追寻……<NL>天地浩大，我又是孑然一身，不知去往何处……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4474e558bff38b6a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "729c6106-e3ac-4486-8dcb-24207d625f9d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why is that?)",
      "cn": "（此为何故……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "63f07e4b758e62c0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ce9ecf9-076e-46e1-bd2c-50426b7b26e8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I have no place to return to... I would wander the heavens and earth...<NL>You're not the one I've been waiting for... Why don't we just part ways here...\"",
      "cn": "“我已无归处……游荡天地……<NL>你非我等候之人……不如就此别过……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0a6dfbf6bfd4db1c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ce9ecf9-076e-46e1-bd2c-50426b7b26e8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Guess that's how it has to be...)",
      "cn": "（只好如此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6e390e39dac24598",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b3290991-82da-44ee-8539-c2f631d50380/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> knows something is amiss and looks around.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees a woman kneeling down, leaning over the body of a recently deceased woodcutter.<NL>The woodcutter's body has been dismembered, and blood stained the ground! That woman is no one else but Jixi!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，放眼望去，<NL>正看见一个女子半跪于地，俯身看着一个刚死不久的樵夫，<NL>那樵夫身首异处，鲜血流了一地！而那女子，却不是姬穸又是何人！？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "22273c44f6db0ed2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b3290991-82da-44ee-8539-c2f631d50380/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! Why did you leave without a word...",
      "cn": "姬穸！你为何……不告而别……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4e2f2742031a9504",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ee8934e-1df6-4064-90f8-33219d7cf6da/EventContent": {
      "en": "In the Sanguine Valley, bloody wind blows.<NL>Someone died and was buried here.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> happenes to pass by and suddenly hears strange noises.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> takes a stare, only to find that a skeleton quickly emerging from a grave and pouncing at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> in an instant!",
      "cn": "血犼谷中，腥风阵阵，<NL>不知何人亡故，葬于此处，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不巧途经，却忽闻窸窣怪声，<NL>定睛一望，竟是一骷髅倏地自坟中破土而出，转瞬扑面袭来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f7e2125b0cf98d45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6ee8934e-1df6-4064-90f8-33219d7cf6da/Option_1": {
      "en": "This skeleton has come out of the grave?! (Take on fight...)",
      "cn": "这骷髅竟自坟中而出？！（迎战敌人……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d1877f60235a93b9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1e3189ca-62c7-4afd-b4b5-9969ec852040/EventContent": {
      "en": "After this night, although <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> does not know what kind of evil skills the red-robed senior has cultivated,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> knows that this person is not a ghost. The rumors of ghosts haunting Yangzhou City are false.<NL>The horrifying, ghostly things are merely rumors.<NL>The red-robed senior no longer exists in this world.<NL>Presumably, the people of Yangzhou would no longer have anything to fear...",
      "cn": "经此一夜，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽不知红衣老人究竟练就何等邪功，<NL>却知此人非是鬼怪，只道扬州城鬼影传言已破，<NL>邪祟骇人之事，不过是流言风传，<NL>红衣老人其人，也已不在世间，<NL>想必扬州百姓，再无忧惧之事……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "de0d366fecfb9504",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1e3189ca-62c7-4afd-b4b5-9969ec852040/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A sense of unease...)",
      "cn": "（隐隐不安……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11d23c69f4fa2733",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cd84f05a-6593-4de2-8bfe-f028d40500e1/EventContent": {
      "en": "The chicken strutted proudly, calm and unhurried.<NL>It neither came closer nor moved farther away, looking quite clever and cute.<NL>Jixi watched it quietly for a long time. The fear on her face faded, and she slowly nodded in agreement...<NL><NL>\"It's just feeding a chicken... Let me give it a try...\"",
      "cn": "却见元鸡昂首漫步，悠闲自得，<NL>既不靠近，亦未远去，颇有几分伶俐可爱，<NL>姬穸静静久观，面上惊惧之色一敛，缓缓点头应允……<NL><NL>“不过是饲喂元鸡……且叫我试上一试……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6dd5328b1f0aecf6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cd84f05a-6593-4de2-8bfe-f028d40500e1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Fetch some feed...)",
      "cn": "（取来饲料……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5af0ced6262fdf07",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bfb3027f-3a98-43bc-98a4-492ac5a0e220/EventContent": {
      "en": "Bizarre occurrences plague Taiwu Village, and now some innocent lie dead.<NL>After careful consideration of all the clues,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> feels compelled to speak with none other than Jixi...",
      "cn": "如今太吾村中怪事连连，更有村人遇害枉死，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>细思调查至今，种种迹象，<NL>只觉此事或可与姬穸相商一番……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ebef5e0f43baecdc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bfb3027f-3a98-43bc-98a4-492ac5a0e220/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Wonder if Jixi truly knows about it...)",
      "cn": "（不知姬穸是否当真知情……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "573e0e64116407a7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "90ea90f7-7756-49ac-97de-f674359df82c/EventContent": {
      "en": "Although <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> often reminds Jixi that she should inform <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> of where she goes, there are still times when <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> does not know her whereabouts.<NL>Today, in the early morning, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees Jixi returning from outside, not knowing where she has been to...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽常常叮嘱姬穸，却仍有不知其去向之时，<NL>今日清晨，亦是见姬穸自外归来，不知去了何处……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "26b969eea5aa7738",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "90ea90f7-7756-49ac-97de-f674359df82c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(As long as she is safe...)",
      "cn": "（无恙便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e89b457565a6d692",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "01027e74-14a1-47b1-8a2e-127c218af5b4/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The whereabouts of the 'ghost' is mysterious, and it has harmed quite some people.<NL>I've only heard that this 'ghost' haunts the graveyards, preying on night travelers.<NL>Many tomb raiders have also fallen victim to it... Alas, they steal from others' graves but also get buried there...\"",
      "cn": "“‘鬼怪’行踪诡秘，所害之人，实在难计，<NL>只听闻那‘鬼怪’时常出没坟地，别说是那路上夜行之人，<NL>更有不少盗墓贼因此惨死……唉，虽窃得他人墓，却也葬身他人墓……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d4772f87a72e6c95",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "01027e74-14a1-47b1-8a2e-127c218af5b4/Option_1": {
      "en": "It seems that the ghost came out of the graves... I can go and investigate...",
      "cn": "看来鬼怪乃是自墓穴而出……我倒可前往查探一番……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "748bf361abb4d8bb",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b97328ad-5561-4cc9-be69-08fe9b5b2d22/EventContent": {
      "en": "The two ventured deeper into the woods, the dense green making the path ahead unclear.<NL>After a few steps, they heard a rustling sound from within the layers of grass and trees...",
      "cn": "两人又再入林中，积翠蔼蔼，不知前路尚有何物，<NL>前行几步，却闻层层草木之间，似有窸窣动静……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fe289213106d7cad",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b97328ad-5561-4cc9-be69-08fe9b5b2d22/Option_1": {
      "en": "Could it be the fierce beast you were so determined to find?",
      "cn": "莫非是你一心所求之山野猛兽？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4dc45aecd7b53b4a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c0d8040-e32a-4c9b-89e8-d2a66deb77ad/EventContent": {
      "en": "With some free time recently, Jixi, having stayed in Taiwu Village for a while,<NL>had grown fond of the mountains and wilds near the village and seemed to want to go for a stroll...",
      "cn": "近日闲暇，姬穸久住太吾村中，<NL>亦对村边山野心生向往，似有前往漫步之意……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4f386fbb1541a72d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c0d8040-e32a-4c9b-89e8-d2a66deb77ad/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Go with her...)",
      "cn": "（相随前往……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "af0f7a5d968e772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "803f837c-8f10-423f-b18c-22ded22e01f3/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You...\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s breathless exclamation makes Jixi freeze for a moment.<NL>She swiftly rises to her feet, but find herself speechless, unable to explain her sudden departure.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices her inner turmoil and decides not to inquire further...",
      "cn": "“是你……”<NL>姬穸听到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>失声唤道，猛地一怔，迅速站起身来，<NL>对不告而别之事，姬穸一时无言以对，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>看出姬穸心事，也只好不再多问……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "10cac4e741a8c7dd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "803f837c-8f10-423f-b18c-22ded22e01f3/Option_1": {
      "en": "There are evil spirits harming people nearby, are you all right?",
      "cn": "此处果有妖邪害人，你可无碍？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "eaf77588af409d35",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6eb51828-9bf9-4908-a77b-8e6336456211/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Ah... You...<NL>I have always known your intentions.<NL>How could I coldly refuse? If that's the case, I'll go as you request...\"<NL>Feeling <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s determination, Jixi hesitates for a while but finally nods...",
      "cn": "“唉……你……<NL>我向来知你心意，<NL>又何忍相拒，既是如此，那便依你所言……”<NL>见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>执意如此，姬穸几番犹豫，终是点头应允……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "40b0b1b7092e542b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6eb51828-9bf9-4908-a77b-8e6336456211/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2a7bd0ce-5501-4903-895d-b12ab055f9f1/EventContent": {
      "en": "The rotten stench is approaching, with a suffocating aura of death!<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks in astonishment and finds out it is the red-robed senior, who has long turned into a Jiangshi.<NL>Now, he is hissing and lunging straight toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, his dark claws aiming for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s face!",
      "cn": "腐臭袭近，死气扑面！<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>惊而一望，竟是那早已化作僵尸的红衣老人，<NL>此时口中嘶嘶，直直朝自己扑来，青黑利爪转眼间已是直逼面门！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9ac1099d4809db64",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2a7bd0ce-5501-4903-895d-b12ab055f9f1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Take on fight!)",
      "cn": "（只得迎战！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "48760721f973de75",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4daac93-e9d6-4f8b-a121-1b3c38ac0989/EventContent": {
      "en": "Hearing this, Jixi does not show any signs of pleasure.<NL>Instead, she shakes her head gently and says with lowered eyes,<NL>\"I am no ordinary person. I never know when my ghostly nature will take over.<NL>If I continue to accompany you, one day it may lead to great disaster, causing you unbearable pain...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸闻言却不见喜意，<NL>只是轻轻摇头，垂眸道：<NL>“我既非常人，不知何时，便会鬼性发作，<NL>若继续伴你左右，有朝一日，或将酿成大祸、令你苦痛难言……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5f350b111f8a8a7b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4daac93-e9d6-4f8b-a121-1b3c38ac0989/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Persist...)",
      "cn": "（坚持如此……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "db7a86302a525ace",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4daac93-e9d6-4f8b-a121-1b3c38ac0989/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Forget it...)",
      "cn": "（还是作罢……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a39d1393e5bc4cc0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "205545fb-2deb-4e29-b1d6-2ebb3c5b231d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You are are impartial and upright.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你中正无私，刚直不阿，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e7d6af029ed03218",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "205545fb-2deb-4e29-b1d6-2ebb3c5b231d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c019279-565f-456a-92c5-1eb39d482acf/EventContent": {
      "en": "Now that things have come to this point, Jixi has already made up her mind to leave.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> wants to say something to persuade her, but suddenly, a cold wind blows and a foul odor fills the air.<NL>In an instant, a pair of sharp claws fly toward them from behind!",
      "cn": "事已至此，姬穸已然心生去意，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>再要开口挽留，却忽觉阴风大作，腐臭逼人，<NL>刹时之间，一双五指利爪自身后破空而来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "304d02a44fd4fb67",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c019279-565f-456a-92c5-1eb39d482acf/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Oh, no!)",
      "cn": "（暗叫不好！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5232eacaa076ceab",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0e5231da-827a-4024-9795-1f4436d379cb/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> knows something is amiss and looks around.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees a woman kneeling down, leaning over the body of a recently deceased woodcutter.<NL>The woodcutter's body has been dismembered, and blood stained the ground! That woman is no one else but Jixi!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心知不妙，放眼望去，<NL>正看见一个女子半跪于地，俯身看着一个刚死不久的樵夫，<NL>那樵夫身首异处，鲜血流了一地！而那女子，却不是姬穸又是何人！？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "22273c44f6db0ed2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0e5231da-827a-4024-9795-1f4436d379cb/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi! Why did you leave without a word?",
      "cn": "姬穸！你为何……不告而别……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b875dc3b74f55fe4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f4a40906-d2fd-4944-b2b2-d83e8844eb74/EventContent": {
      "en": "As their eyes met, in just a brief moment,<NL>the person immediately takes a big step forward, not attacking, but bowing deeply, saying,<NL><NL>\"Today, the Successor of Taiwu pays a visit to our Sanguine Sect, this is truly amazing!<NL>I won't hide it from you—we have a favor to ask...<NL><NL>There is a rumor in the Martial World that you, Taiwu, has entered the tomb of the Sanguine's founder,<NL>and by using some secret technique, you subdued our sect founder and make the founder an obedient follower, fulfilling any request you have...\"",
      "cn": "四目相对，不过须臾，<NL>却见那人立时大步上前，未有进犯，却是纳头便拜：<NL><NL>“太吾传人今日来我血犼，实在妙极！<NL>不瞒你说，我等却有一事相求……<NL><NL>江湖言传，太吾传人入得我血犼祖师之墓，<NL>不知使了何种秘法，竟将祖师收服麾下，不仅从此相随相伴，更是对你有求必应……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6b541ee2b8ea800a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f4a40906-d2fd-4944-b2b2-d83e8844eb74/Option_1": {
      "en": "This is a rumor indeed... a made-up story...",
      "cn": "此种传言……实乃捏造……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc9e2e5a5bd34452",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "60e3b875-32b1-4c99-b060-e0e6d3ffc5b7/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Wicked? Against the nature?<NL>Hmph, you're ignorant so just shut your mouth.<NL>As for the bell, are you returning it or not?!\"<NL>The red-robed senior appears extremely arrogant. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> does not know his true identity,<NL>but it seems that the senior is determined to obtain the bell, implying that there must be something suspicious about it...",
      "cn": "“邪法？逆天？呵，<NL>既是无知，你且不必多言，这铃铛，<NL>你还是不还？！”<NL><NL>红衣老人神情狂妄至极，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽不知其底细，<NL>只道老人对这铃铛势在必得，其中必有蹊跷之处……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "33f8b401dc5d527d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "60e3b875-32b1-4c99-b060-e0e6d3ffc5b7/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Return the rusted bell...)",
      "cn": "（交还破旧的铃铛……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a78c27294c2f636b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "60e3b875-32b1-4c99-b060-e0e6d3ffc5b7/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Refuse to return it...)",
      "cn": "（拒不交还……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c76ecc6cbfb023a6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "de27f33c-583c-4e62-adaf-d1e6d63f235e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's expression is solemn, filled with pain, but she ultimately resigns, saying,<NL>\"Even if it brings me unbearable suffering... I have no other choice...<NL>I've been tormented by this ghostly nature for thousands of years...<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, you have been with me for some time,<NL>but now I cannot stay by your side and bring you a lifetime of harm... Indecision is useless...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸面色沉沉，虽有苦痛，却终究归于死寂：<NL>“纵是痛不欲生……我亦别无他法……<NL>千百年来，我始终受此鬼性所驱，此种煎熬我早已习惯……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，从前你能陪伴我一时，<NL>如今我却不能在你身边害你一世……优柔寡断，亦是无用……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8da53371eef41b35",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "de27f33c-583c-4e62-adaf-d1e6d63f235e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(It seems a decision must be made...)",
      "cn": "（似乎必须做出抉择……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b7cb1ebead97e258",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Now that you know about this...<NL>It's natural if you despise me...\"<NL>Seeing Jixi being completely honest and admitting to her deeds,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> has a turbulent mix of thoughts and emotions...",
      "cn": "“此事既然叫你知晓……<NL>你若厌恶于我，亦是正常……”<NL>见姬穸毫无隐瞒，坦然承认，又忽出此言，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时思绪混杂，心中种种想法，起伏不定……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6be4ce43f52b611d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/Option_1": {
      "en": "I know your nature... You do not have ill intentions...",
      "cn": "我知晓你之心性……并非有心为恶……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d42746271a925c9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/Option_2": {
      "en": "We have spent our days together... Our bond cannot be false...",
      "cn": "你我曾朝夕共处……情义岂能作假……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a5e95f0389ec9f76",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/Option_3": {
      "en": "Even though our paths diverge between human and ghost, there are times we can find common ground...",
      "cn": "纵然是人鬼殊途……亦有通融之时……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dda987c53c0725d8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/Option_4": {
      "en": "I have my own likes and dislikes... You are not manipulating my mind...",
      "cn": "厌恶喜爱皆由我……岂由你说了算……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f0488b3454ad9320",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "691d859e-1efc-4d9f-8f6b-4ea188601d3b/Option_5": {
      "en": "It is just a trivial matter... Everything is under my control...",
      "cn": "不过是些许小事……尽在我之掌握……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "692c1eb0c80adae8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a7596c34-d8da-493d-bc38-ff0fe517ac75/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You... lower your head...\"",
      "cn": "“你且……低下头来……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2b943363e0a6f67a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a7596c34-d8da-493d-bc38-ff0fe517ac75/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Lower your head...)",
      "cn": "（低头……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "77359a29da6f104b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "778901c2-8937-41d2-8a62-4e0cb1b67d2d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If you don't accept my toast, then you'll drink the penalty!\"<NL>The red-robed senior shouts angrily. A cold wind surrounds him as he launches an attack!",
      "cn": "“敬酒不吃，吃罚酒！”<NL>只见红衣老人怒喝一声，周身阴风四起，霎时出手袭来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5859eff572b01853",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "778901c2-8937-41d2-8a62-4e0cb1b67d2d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Take on fight!)",
      "cn": "（迎战敌人！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "48760721f973de75",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "149410b5-a060-481a-a934-969ff0cddfc4/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, a large crow suddenly dropped a letter into <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s hand:<NL><NL>\"It's time to say goodbye, take care!\"<NL><NL>The letter was sparse with words, but the strokes were heavy, indicating countless thoughts. The signature on the letter was \"Xi.\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s heart shook with sadness...",
      "cn": "恰在此时，一只硕大的乌鸦忽然衔着一封书信扔到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>手中：<NL><NL>“终是到了分别之时，万望珍重！”<NL><NL>信中寥寥数字，却是笔划滞重，想来其中定有思虑万千，<NL>而书信的落款正是一个“穸”字，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心头一震，悲从中来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "912fb27d0ab4080d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "149410b5-a060-481a-a934-969ff0cddfc4/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is...)",
      "cn": "（这是……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6021a17ee85ae445",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "27ee5dde-3b19-4a4d-9d57-622e7e3a49fe/EventContent": {
      "en": "Although disciples of the Sanguine Sect chase after <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>,<NL>they cannot catch up due to the crowded streets. They have to reluctantly give up and return.<NL><NL>The people who were drinking tea quickly scatter as well.<NL>After the turmoil, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> finds it hard to gather any more information about the mysterious ghost.<NL>It seems <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> will have to investigate another day...",
      "cn": "血犼教弟子虽拔腿来追，<NL>奈何人群拥挤，最终只得悻悻而归，<NL><NL>方才饮茶之人也很快四散而去，<NL>一场骚乱之后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>也难以再打探消息，<NL>鬼怪之事，看来只得择日再探了……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "708a37808efc4783",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "27ee5dde-3b19-4a4d-9d57-622e7e3a49fe/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So be it...)",
      "cn": "（只得如此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "76bb94ba87e9e5c3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "abc6a7ed-cd6a-4c40-a64d-e6364f738325/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> takes a few steps forward but does not see any passerby stopping.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> looks ahead, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> notices a tea house,<NL>where a few people are sitting in the corner, holding tea cups and whispering to each other, as if discussing something in secrecy...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>前行几步，<NL>未见行人停步，又再向前张望，便见有一茶肆，<NL>其中一角寥坐数人，手捧茶盏，交头接耳之状，似是在窃窃私议……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f99ee7729bbf13ab",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "abc6a7ed-cd6a-4c40-a64d-e6364f738325/Option_1": {
      "en": "(There might be someone here who knows something about the strange occurrences in Yangzhou City...)",
      "cn": "（扬州城中异状，此处或许有人知情……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e9ea320741e3cbe5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "91e5e937-22f9-40ca-9450-6a6d10580e45/EventContent": {
      "en": "Bizarre occurrences plague Taiwu Village, and now some innocent lie dead.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> has been investigating carefully, and various signs lead <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/> to believe that<NL>although there are various clues pointing to Jixi, her nature is not evil, and the gruesome deaths are definitely unrelated to her...",
      "cn": "如今太吾村中怪事连连，更有村人遇害枉死，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>细思调查至今，种种蛛丝马迹，<NL>虽可知与姬穸有所关联，然姬穸心性非恶，那惨死村人，必与姬穸无关……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4f73f93f3383124",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "91e5e937-22f9-40ca-9450-6a6d10580e45/Option_1": {
      "en": "(There must be an unknown evil lurking in the village...)",
      "cn": "（似是另有邪祟潜入村中……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ee2c13bcb328b812",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f8caf1bf-ef47-4dd3-9bb3-fc47276e33b4/EventContent": {
      "en": "Under the dark clouds, the malevolent energy grows stronger.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> pushes on, breath quickening as the air grows cold.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> turns a corner on the forest path, a crimson flash, thick with the stench of blood, lashes out at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> face!",
      "cn": "乌云之下，阴气大盛，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>提气急奔，只觉得空气越来越冷，随着林间小道忽地一转，<NL>一道血光伴随着一阵浓重的血腥之气便就往<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>面上扑来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc08616a9f854278",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f8caf1bf-ef47-4dd3-9bb3-fc47276e33b4/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Uh oh!)",
      "cn": "（不好！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "eaef6f99663d65a6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "57dad8dd-9a86-4d65-997e-483c9c1eb948/EventContent": {
      "en": "As their eyes met, in just a brief moment,<NL>the person standing in front immediately takes a big step forward, not attacking, but bowing deeply, saying,<NL><NL>\"Today we actually come to ask you to kindly do us a favor...<NL>There is a rumor in the Martial World that you, Taiwu, has entered the tomb of the Sanguine's founder,<NL>and by using some secret technique, you subdued our sect founder and make the founder an obedient follower, fulfilling any request you have...\"",
      "cn": "四目相对，不过须臾，<NL>那领头人立时大步上前，未有进犯，却是纳头便拜：<NL><NL>“我等这番前来，实则有一事相求……<NL>江湖言传，太吾传人入得我血犼祖师之墓，<NL>不知使了何种秘法，竟将祖师收服麾下，不仅从此相随相伴，更是对你有求必应……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b074fc92d3a8d309",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "57dad8dd-9a86-4d65-997e-483c9c1eb948/Option_1": {
      "en": "This is a rumor indeed... a made-up story...",
      "cn": "此种传言……实乃捏造……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc9e2e5a5bd34452",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "08fd1ade-5855-43e8-8fbe-caf1b7c21aec/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"There are no fierce beasts in this mountain. How boring...\"<NL>After several failed \"hunts,\" Jixi's words betrayed a hint of frustration, as if she were genuinely starving...",
      "cn": "“这山中竟无猛兽，实在无趣……”<NL>姬穸几番“捕猎”无果，话语中流露几分焦躁，竟似当真饥饿难耐一般……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f239df8a6bdc320e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "08fd1ade-5855-43e8-8fbe-caf1b7c21aec/Option_1": {
      "en": "(But you don't usually seem to care much about food...)",
      "cn": "（平日却不见你费心于吃食之上……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "506870e34ef001a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b99b0cb8-b5a7-4feb-9222-3f4c93a4a15e/EventContent": {
      "en": "The red-robed senior approaches with great aggression, overpowering <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>,<NL>who falls to the ground in a pool of blood after getting struck in a vital spot...",
      "cn": "红衣老人来势汹汹，实难匹敌，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>终被击中要害，倒在一地血泊之中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d04cde74cad4b667",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b99b0cb8-b5a7-4feb-9222-3f4c93a4a15e/Option_1": {
      "en": "Ugh... Argh...",
      "cn": "呃……啊……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4494168915cd4bf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5a31b540-169d-4d0c-9f9c-1a0e916c1b90/EventContent": {
      "en": "One day, while strolling through Taiwu Village,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is drawn to a peculiar sight and stops to watch secretly...",
      "cn": "一日，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>漫步太吾村中，<NL>竟见一奇景，不免心中一动，暗中观察……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0e2c7961aa37464c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5a31b540-169d-4d0c-9f9c-1a0e916c1b90/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Hide...)",
      "cn": "（藏匿身形……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "317bbb361d7c3620",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "988ba8b7-19b2-435d-ae45-f46649f9775f/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's eyes widen, now more lively than before.<NL>She says, \"I came from an ancient tomb, how could you treat me as an ordinary child...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸旋即双目一瞪，比之方才，倒更有了几分活力：<NL>“我自古墓而出，你竟拿我当寻常孩童不成……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a8bfcb881d32bebe",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "988ba8b7-19b2-435d-ae45-f46649f9775f/Option_1": {
      "en": "Given your age, perhaps I can teach you how to write...",
      "cn": "以你之年纪，我或许可教你习字……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2bac029b1971fdd0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1bbf346f-b177-42ef-9fd8-abb6e8a8230e/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "41fd3900-26f8-4cb0-a170-e46a66cfb83e/EventContent": {
      "en": "After the commotion, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> finds it difficult to gather any more information.<NL>It seems that investigating the ghost would have to be postponed...",
      "cn": "一场骚乱之后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>也难以再打探消息，<NL>鬼怪之事，看来只得择日再探了……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "49a3117516c02d2e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "41fd3900-26f8-4cb0-a170-e46a66cfb83e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(So be it...)",
      "cn": "（只得如此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "76bb94ba87e9e5c3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "435cbe37-f399-4000-81c4-21f2c6edf5b6/EventContent": {
      "en": "There is no going back. For Jixi, consuming humans is a terrible act she never wished to commit.<NL>But no one else except <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can understand her. As the thought crosses <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> mind, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can no longer tell whether it is joy or grief that stirs within <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>...",
      "cn": "事已至此，姬穸食人虽非本心，心中苦痛，<NL>却再无旁人能知，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此处，亦不知是喜是悲……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "632acacd9e5f0366",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "435cbe37-f399-4000-81c4-21f2c6edf5b6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Ha! When did you come here?<NL>For a moment, I thought it was that ghost coming in broad daylight...\"<NL>In the person's words, there is a great sense of relief, as he slaps his chest and grabs the teacup, wolfing down the herbal tea...",
      "cn": "“嗐！你这人不知何时立在此处，<NL>我还道是那鬼怪青天白日，竟入得扬州城来了……”<NL>却见那人话语之间大松口气，直拍胸口，又抓起茶杯灌下一口凉茶……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "752ee30f4078e58d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/Option_1": {
      "en": "I was passing by, hearing you chatting about interesting things but I wonder what the \"ghost\" mean?",
      "cn": "途经此处，听闻几位闲谈趣事，却不知“鬼怪”乃是何意……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1c0503059c626b7a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/Option_2": {
      "en": "I suspected something about the ghost stuff and meant to inquire, but I didn't mean to startle you...",
      "cn": "我乃是疑心鬼怪之事，有心询问，未料唐突了几位……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5db0bf0caa6af0ce",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/Option_3": {
      "en": "I have heard that Yangzhou City is a bustling place, but I did not expect there to be rumors of ghosts...",
      "cn": "只闻扬州城乃繁华之地，原来竟还有“鬼怪”之传言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "625e22abffb1cd79",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/Option_4": {
      "en": "\"Ghost?\" If I were to say \"that's me,\" would you all run away in fear?",
      "cn": "“鬼怪”？若我说正是我也，你等便要抱头鼠窜了不成？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e1322f208fffb4c7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "18710362-24f4-4788-9eeb-95cdafd7f682/Option_5": {
      "en": "Hmph, mere \"ghost\" stuff is causing such a sensation in Yangzhou City...",
      "cn": "哼，不过区区“鬼怪”，竟然就能惊得扬州满城风雨……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6cda6f9ba1475739",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1fcbc6b1-47e6-4b08-8053-6d9d284038bd/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Like them? I wonder how they taste...\"<NL>Before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> could even speak,<NL>Jixi lunged, snatching an innocent wild rabbit in her hand with a ferocious look...",
      "cn": "“喜欢？倒是不知味道如何……”<NL>姬穸话音方落，未等<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>出言，<NL>便见她霎时出手，将那无辜野兔抓在手里，面色凶狠……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2c648bacbb74f0ae",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1fcbc6b1-47e6-4b08-8053-6d9d284038bd/Option_1": {
      "en": "You... I didn't know you liked to eat rabbit...",
      "cn": "你……我却不知你喜食兔肉……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4e89a2a7444c15d3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "74f576a5-4389-4230-9bc9-1f91adf1a14d/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's expression remains unchanged as she shakes her head and replies,<NL>\"I have never taken a life. I've consumed human blood, yes... but only when I was starving...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸仍未有惊异之色，摇头答曰：<NL>“我未曾害人性命，吸食人血，实乃饿极方才为之……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "27a1a61ed8fc0eb3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "74f576a5-4389-4230-9bc9-1f91adf1a14d/Option_1": {
      "en": "I see...",
      "cn": "原来如此……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c500fbb9698454bc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "03570933-a5c3-45ef-b330-0a64ce1851da/EventContent": {
      "en": "After pondering for a moment, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> approaches<NL>and overhears several people discussing \"ghost\" and \"death,\"<NL>some even gasping in horror. It is hard for <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> to understand what exactly they are talking about...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此处，便提步上前，<NL>只闻围坐数人，言语间皆是“鬼怪”、“丧命”等骇人之语，<NL>其中又夹杂数声惊呼，倒吸凉气，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时竟听不明白究竟何事……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0bdd836cb09c424a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "03570933-a5c3-45ef-b330-0a64ce1851da/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Speak up to inquire...)",
      "cn": "（出声询问……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "114c637070342805",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f6aac53d-8037-407e-b92b-ea463d8547c6/EventContent": {
      "en": "Even so, Jixi, after taking her seat without a word,<NL>still just tasted a bite of each dish, then slowly put down her chopsticks and ate no more.<NL>When <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> asked repeatedly, she only said her stomach was full and she couldn't eat another bite...",
      "cn": "饶是如此，姬穸虽无言落座，<NL>仍只是各尝一口，便缓缓停箸，不再多尝，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>再三问及，亦只道腹中饱胀，不可再食……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fff91c376e05a383",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f6aac53d-8037-407e-b92b-ea463d8547c6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Does it still not suit her taste?)",
      "cn": "（莫非仍不合姬穸口味？）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c05a24e28226039b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d00fb207-89e8-4797-a120-5f004063c05f/EventContent": {
      "en": "The informant lets out another sigh,<NL>and when he looks at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, there is a touch of pity in his eyes.<NL>\"Ah... The 'host' often appears after midnight. It must be because the daytime yang energy is too strong for it to manifest...<NL>From this sign, it's clear that the ghost is extremely powerful. Even with your martial prowess, it's likely to be more dangerous than beneficial for you...\"",
      "cn": "知情人又是一声叹气，<NL>再望向<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>之时，已是多了几分悲悯：<NL>“唉……那‘鬼怪’多于子夜现身，想必是白日阳气颇重，无法现形……<NL>此种迹象，可见鬼怪阴气极重，纵然你身手不凡，此去怕也是凶多吉少……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "83865a508ecb0495",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d00fb207-89e8-4797-a120-5f004063c05f/Option_1": {
      "en": "Thank you for informing me...",
      "cn": "多谢相告……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b8231f339ebb6d77",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "99b6a470-eac1-4bac-bad0-8824aecb39b5/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Hmph, of course I know how to read and write. You taught... Um, someone taught me before...\"<NL>Jixi says, her expression bearing a childlike innocence<NL>that only deepened <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s suspicion.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> knows nothing of her past—why she resembles a famale ghost, or why she slumbered in that ancient tomb...",
      "cn": "“哼，我自然识得字文，此前你……不，亦有人教过我的……”<NL>见姬穸如此说道，眉梢眼角，更有几分童稚，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中疑虑更生，<NL>不知姬穸前尘往事，又为何肖似女鬼，眠于古墓……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "27baa56a45e560ec",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "99b6a470-eac1-4bac-bad0-8824aecb39b5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Inquire about the reason...)",
      "cn": "（询问前因……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e3dd2b25be9a0f73",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8cc2a127-f3fb-47a7-b532-d7c720aadcbb/EventContent": {
      "en": "Soon after returning to Taiwu Village, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices that Jixi still doesn't have any playmates her age.<NL>Despite the care of the villagers, she often sits alone, causing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> to worry about her being lonely.<NL>One day, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> sits next to Jixi and starts a conversation...",
      "cn": "重归太吾村不久，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见姬穸仍无同龄玩伴，<NL>虽有村民关怀，时常孤身而坐，不免忧心她心中孤独，<NL>寻得一日，便坐于姬穸身侧，与她谈话……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f8244a7227eac7c3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8cc2a127-f3fb-47a7-b532-d7c720aadcbb/Option_1": {
      "en": "You are all alone here. Have you ever thought about finding your parents again?",
      "cn": "你孤身一人在此，可想再寻得父母……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a55553bae41d5da7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fe875dff-ea40-4852-97fe-821b2da45795/EventContent": {
      "en": "It is said that the disciples of the Sanguine Sect had been searching for their sect founder's tomb for a long time.<NL>And now they have finally found it.<NL>The Sanguine Sect founder, known as the Lord of Ghosts, was resurrected from the underworld by the Spirit-summoning Bell and has returned to the mortal world.<NL>As soon as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> hears about this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> knows that the so-called \"Sanguine Founder\" is none other than Jixi...",
      "cn": "据传血犼教中诸人，前仆后继，<NL>曾苦寻祖师之墓已久，如今终有所得，<NL>此血犼祖师乃鬼王老祖，盖因招魂铃动，自黄泉苏生，重临人世，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>甫一听闻此事，便知传言中所谓“血犼祖师”，正乃姬穸是也……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fa9539a29e09de30",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fe875dff-ea40-4852-97fe-821b2da45795/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5a11c862-eb09-49c2-abe6-8046480401c9/EventContent": {
      "en": "After some reassurance, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> finally led Jixi into the Chicken Coop.<NL>Chickens were raised here year-round, and although it was regularly cleaned, it was still dirty and had a peculiar smell.<NL>Jixi's expression was grim as she just stared quietly at the chickens in the coop...",
      "cn": "几番安慰之后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>才引姬穸入得元鸡舍内，<NL>此处常年饲养元鸡，虽时常打扫，仍有脏污，气味自然古怪，<NL>姬穸面色凝重，只与那屋中元鸡静静对望……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1afcafb2c311dbcd",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5a11c862-eb09-49c2-abe6-8046480401c9/Option_1": {
      "en": "It's feeding time now. How about I get some feed and we feed them together?",
      "cn": "现下正是喂鸡时辰，我取来饲料，你我一同喂鸡可好？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "06b248085534707b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e0354a42-764e-4ff3-8567-3d40e2ba2c20/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> carries Jixi with both hands, closes <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> eyes, and waits for the pain to come.<NL>But surprisingly, he feels a soft touch on his forehead, gentle as cloud and mist.<NL>Jixi's hair brushes past, and the next second she moves away...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>提起心来，双手接住姬穸，紧闭双眼，<NL>正待疼痛来临时，却只感眉间几分柔软，轻如云雾，<NL>姬穸发丝轻扫而过，转瞬便又抽身远离……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9359ac0afc0f26c7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e0354a42-764e-4ff3-8567-3d40e2ba2c20/Option_1": {
      "en": "Is it...?",
      "cn": "竟是……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7f05beefbc56d146",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "59ac615d-1602-480b-9954-a3e33179bd8d/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> witnesses this scene and starts to contemplate.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> feels that there must be a reason behind these strange occurrences,<NL>and perhaps <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> should investigate the tombs in Sanguine Valley...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见得此景，<NL>心中已有一番计较，空穴来风之事，想必事出有因，<NL>或该前往血犼谷附近墓穴一探究竟……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f24a65d70695078b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "59ac615d-1602-480b-9954-a3e33179bd8d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Go investigate...)",
      "cn": "（前往调查……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6b4d5a29c5c2a5be",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a05bc3c6-6f5e-4557-9483-e65a6380b3b3/EventContent": {
      "en": "Upon hearing this, the informant is shocked and hurriedly says,<NL>\"This is not a child's play! That 'ghost' is extremely dangerous, beyond the capabilities of ordinary people to deal with. I have a friend who once heard ghostly laughter at midnight and followed the sound, but eventually turned back halfway as he knew how challenging it could be.<NL>It seems that whether it's inside Yangzhou City or in Sanguine Valley, there is an air of strangeness everywhere. You and I should just mind our own business and take care of ourselves...\"",
      "cn": "知情人闻言大惊，急忙说道：<NL>“此事实在儿戏不得！那‘鬼怪’凶险异常，非常人能敌，<NL>我有一友也曾耳闻夜半鬼乐，循声而去，终是在半途知难而返，<NL>只道如今自扬州城内，乃至血犼谷之处，处处透着诡异，你我只当安分守己，好自为之……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8a198202d217e564",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a05bc3c6-6f5e-4557-9483-e65a6380b3b3/Option_1": {
      "en": "What connection does this have with Sanguine Valley?",
      "cn": "此事又与血犼谷有何关联？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "73c366efb2effa10",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "32d3a96a-7a77-46e5-a907-428c3a3bca95/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"This life... it's still you in the end... waking me up with the ringing of the bell... I'm glad...\"",
      "cn": "“此生……终究仍是你……<NL>摇响铃铛唤我苏醒……我很高兴……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c75a43b272204aa8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "32d3a96a-7a77-46e5-a907-428c3a3bca95/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3b6bff90-53ee-4dac-9829-b912a728f35c/EventContent": {
      "en": "As the ground around the feet gradually swallowed up the spot where the red-robed senior,<NL>layer upon layer rising up like scales, forming a small mound within a blink of an eye.<NL>It seemed like a grave that has no tombstone, with the remains of the red-robed senior contained inside...",
      "cn": "却见足下将将吞没红衣老人之处，<NL>地如鱼鳞，层层而起，不过眨眼之间，土积三尺而成丘，<NL>竟如茕茕坟墓凭空而生一般，虽无碑，亦为冢，将红衣老人尸骨收殓其中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "05dd4f8954092128",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3b6bff90-53ee-4dac-9829-b912a728f35c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "82cea779-5fe5-41b3-b335-a2d8b1205eab/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> was now extremely curious about what food Jixi might actually like.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> racked <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> brains, trying to persuade Jixi to try a few more delicious dishes...",
      "cn": "不知究竟何物能得姬穸青睐，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>此时已是好奇不已，<NL>绞尽脑汁，欲劝姬穸品尝几道美食……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4d7c621c1f8c9758",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "82cea779-5fe5-41b3-b335-a2d8b1205eab/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Choose a food...)",
      "cn": "（选择食物……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7067a0d08928cd66",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "82cea779-5fe5-41b3-b335-a2d8b1205eab/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Never mind...)",
      "cn": "（还是作罢……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "66ca81841de86fe3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2b9d032e-a62b-453b-af3d-b61bce0f5095/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"...\"<NL>Jixi remains silent...",
      "cn": "“……”<NL>姬穸不语……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fd619c63c369480f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2b9d032e-a62b-453b-af3d-b61bce0f5095/Option_1": {
      "en": "Were you also the ghost who attacked the villagers?!",
      "cn": "莫非村中妖鬼袭人之事……也是你所为？！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3627f89906d6d21b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86bd9422-57e0-413f-a8d3-567f73a66192/EventContent": {
      "en": "The past seems impossible to unravel.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> thinks of this,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> decides to abandon the thought lingering in mind and play games with Jixi along with the villagers.<NL>Although Jixi does not show a smile, her crimson eyes reveal a sense of joy...",
      "cn": "前尘往事，似难探寻，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此处，亦只得就此作罢，<NL>索性放下此念，与村人一同伴姬穸玩耍游戏，<NL>虽不见姬穸展颜，却可见鲜红眼眸之中，很是欢喜……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "aff643645fead511",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86bd9422-57e0-413f-a8d3-567f73a66192/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4a3785b2-13d0-4e00-9bd4-c599600c07f6/EventContent": {
      "en": "It is said that the disciples of the Sanguine Sect had been searching for their sect founder's tomb for a long time.<NL>And now they have finally found it.<NL>However, the ancient tomb had already been robbed, the tomb chamber damaged, devoid of all ghost energy.<NL>Their desperate search yielded only hundreds of unnamed Taoist remains; within the central coffin rested but the bones of an unknown Taoist.<NL>There is nothing else in the tomb chamber, and naturally, there is no trace of the sect founder...",
      "cn": "据传血犼教中诸人，前仆后继，<NL>曾苦寻祖师之墓已久，如今终有所得，<NL>却不料古墓早已遭人盗掘，墓室损毁，鬼气四散，<NL>寻寻觅觅，只寻得数百道人遗骸，棺椁之中，亦不过一无名道人之亡骨，<NL>古墓之中，别无他物，自然亦无血犼祖师之踪影……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f4383ce2369b6d3a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4a3785b2-13d0-4e00-9bd4-c599600c07f6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6e1dd034-adc1-4cb1-8873-1ce1d9540f81/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> ponders for a moment and decides to temporarily keep the souldew.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> knows that it would be of no use to Jixi, and she probably would not like it.<NL>It would be better to dispose of it later...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>若有所思，暂且收下血露，<NL>却深知此物于姬穸无用，她应当不喜，<NL>不若之后再自行处置便可……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2e56b5558251d7ad",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6e1dd034-adc1-4cb1-8873-1ce1d9540f81/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Let it be for now...)",
      "cn": "（暂且如此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "04ba6ab1eced9873",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f9ceeaa3-8931-4020-8c10-e4768aac9efc/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I am delighted by the sight of various living beings, such as the floras, dancing fireflies, colorful moths and hovering butterflies...<NL>But all the living creatures I see seem as fleeting as morning dew, disappearing in a blink of an eye.<NL>In this world, there seems to be no one who can accompany me for long...\"",
      "cn": "“如今溪花流萤，粉蛾蛱蝶……<NL>所见种种生灵，我无不喜爱，只是生如朝露，转眼消逝，<NL>此世间生者，想来已是再无一人，能伴我长久……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bb4af61d11bca6f2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f9ceeaa3-8931-4020-8c10-e4768aac9efc/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9a52d764-4fd7-45d8-9bcd-7226a9f30a89/EventContent": {
      "en": "The two walk side by side without saying a word.<NL>They see smoke rising in the distance, villagers enjoying their daily lives,<NL>and hear the sounds of chickens and dogs. All creates a peaceful and serene scene...",
      "cn": "两人并肩相伴，不再言语，<NL>只见远处炊烟袅袅，近处村人自逸，<NL>鸡犬相闻之声遥遥而来，俨然一幅宁静悠然之景……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "13cb7eb216dea7b0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9a52d764-4fd7-45d8-9bcd-7226a9f30a89/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3c7b94d8-0977-4ca2-a759-8cc96cafc0e9/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lets out a soft sigh, then says,<NL>\"In the past and the present, a thousand stories could be told.<NL>I only thought... that you would still understand me after reincarnation...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸轻叹一声，继而又道：<NL>“前尘今生，往事千端，<NL>我只道……你回生转世，仍会懂我……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "79d3f3072a146b25",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3c7b94d8-0977-4ca2-a759-8cc96cafc0e9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Reincarnation?)",
      "cn": "（回生转世？）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9a391bb1878c687f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1ccba4c8-ccc0-4011-aa24-68bd9c3824c1/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi does not show any astonishment and her expression remains unchanged.<NL>She says, \"My parents are deceased, and I have no relatives.<NL>Nor do I have any friends or companions left.<NL>I've searched and found nothing, and there is no need to search anymore. Now you're the only one who accompanies me...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸闻听此言，并无惊异，面色更是平静无波：<NL>“我父母亡逝，并无亲眷，<NL>友人伙伴，也再无一人，<NL>寻不得，无需寻，如今世上，不过唯有你与我相伴罢了……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9d439817e6764903",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1ccba4c8-ccc0-4011-aa24-68bd9c3824c1/Option_1": {
      "en": "You are still young. Why do you have such a sorrowful heart?",
      "cn": "你年纪尚小，怎生如此心悲……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "72f9d0efa21a9a36",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e74b3cc1-a7c4-4d90-97a2-e344242489d2/EventContent": {
      "en": "The blood mist dissipates, leaving behind a lingering ghostly aura.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> fixes <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> gaze on the figure of Jixi, seeing her fragile silhouette falling weakly.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> swiftly catches her and feels the icy coldness within <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> embrace. Jixi has reverted to her childlike appearance, her face even paler.<NL>The fight just now has clearly drained of her power and weakened her greatly...",
      "cn": "血雾散去，鬼气弥留，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>紧盯眼前姬穸身影，但见那单薄轮廓无力摔落，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>纵身一接，冰冷入怀，姬穸此时已重回女童样貌，<NL>如今面色更是灰败，显然是耗尽灵力，虚弱非常……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a16dabf378834c92",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e74b3cc1-a7c4-4d90-97a2-e344242489d2/Option_1": {
      "en": "This battle... I will not fail you...",
      "cn": "此战……我必不辜负你……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7971fcaaa0d35f0a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c01a6ad2-e604-4a9d-8ea7-9c240506da71/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The cycle of karma and reincarnation is an abstract matter.<NL>I wouldn't want to burden you now with its weight...\"",
      "cn": "“因果轮回，本是缥缈之事，<NL>如今说与你听，徒增烦恼……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9816c42c395043e3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c01a6ad2-e604-4a9d-8ea7-9c240506da71/Option_1": {
      "en": "The cycle of karma and reincarnation... Could it be... that we knew each other in a past life?",
      "cn": "因果轮回……莫非……你我前世相识？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b89d7e5951140d38",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/EventContent": {
      "en": "{0}",
      "cn": "{0}",
      "ru": "{0}",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "660cf56f05961bfe",
      "engine": "neutral",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Drain Qi and drink blood...)",
      "cn": "（汲气饮血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ee6f16d52062b502",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_2": {
      "en": "Why are you in the tomb?",
      "cn": "你为何会在坟墓之中？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7f48bf046f5734a1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_3": {
      "en": "Do you know about the Sanguine Cult?",
      "cn": "你可知血犼邪教？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "74be1220fc690a97",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_4": {
      "en": "The bell that awakened you?",
      "cn": "那个唤醒你的铃铛？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1191f44a721f7076",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_5": {
      "en": "The past? What do you know?",
      "cn": "往昔之事，似有所指？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b9cae919fdf22da1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_6": {
      "en": "What is your origin?",
      "cn": "你的身世？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d5f59dd0b1bf28d3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_7": {
      "en": "(Why the bloodlust...)",
      "cn": "（为何嗜血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7524c5277772a81f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_8": {
      "en": "(Why kill enemies...)",
      "cn": "（为何杀敌……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "15c6ff11cb49c154",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_9": {
      "en": "(Observe Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（观察姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "478b1caf1eea285a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_10": {
      "en": "(Talk for a moment...)",
      "cn": "（交谈片刻……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1851f58b26af4f80",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_11": {
      "en": "(Present a beast...)",
      "cn": "（赠送野兽……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5fde214aef61c8f3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_12": {
      "en": "(Execute Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c7d975e34a78c9d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_13": {
      "en": "(Temporarily part ways...)",
      "cn": "（暂且分离……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d21d5b5818005d33",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d0be2824-4e4b-439a-82c2-8850865dcc64/Option_14": {
      "en": "(Nothing to say...)",
      "cn": "（无话要说……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0daf539539c52322",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3b156c5b-3459-4093-999c-4dc724757395/EventContent": {
      "en": "The scenery in the mountains is beautiful in every season.<NL>At this moment, a gentle breeze was blowing under a clear, warm sky.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> and Jixi strolled along, all their worries seemed to melt away...",
      "cn": "山野之景，四时皆佳，<NL>此时清风徐徐，晴空和煦，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与姬穸漫步其中，百般烦忧皆可抛诸脑后……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0ce6eb78a672faed",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3b156c5b-3459-4093-999c-4dc724757395/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi seems much happier than before...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸似乎比之前快乐许多……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1327230175c0fbfc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4e7d3490-a88d-4cca-aa22-c856af54a434/EventContent": {
      "en": "In such a beautiful scenery, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is savoring every moment,<NL>but <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> notices that people walking by have anxious expressions, not interested in the beauty, and are hurrying back home.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> also often overhears whispered conversations filled with fear and unease.<NL>There must be someone in the city who knows what is going on, someone <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> can seek for information...",
      "cn": "如此好景，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>正细细品味，<NL>却见行路之人面色竟多有惶恐，无心风月，早早归家。<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>更是时常闻得私语之声，其中忧惧难掩，几分不安，<NL>想来此种异状，城中应有知情之人，或可寻人打听一番……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c2645ad1cee58f20",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4e7d3490-a88d-4cca-aa22-c856af54a434/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Inquire and gather information...)",
      "cn": "（寻人探听……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b4a32737a59bf77e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c0afdd60-d3d3-4b34-92e3-e1f6d3f5f564/EventContent": {
      "en": "Thinking about this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> realizes that the Red-Robed Senior seems to have completed his secret technique.<NL>However, it remains unknown how he will find his revered Sanguine \"founder\"...",
      "cn": "思及此处，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只觉红衣老人似是秘法已成，<NL>只是不知，此人又要如何寻得念念不忘之血犼“祖师爷”……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ad9937b42eb75ede",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c0afdd60-d3d3-4b34-92e3-e1f6d3f5f564/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4b572cd4-74af-4d14-bdbe-606ee297fa7e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You're holding the Fuyu Hilt, and it shares a deep connection with my old friend...<NL>If I were to die by your hand, it would be acceptable...<NL>But my ghostly nature is hard to control, and if you attack, I might lose control and fight back...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi has a bloodthirsty nature and eat people. How to deal with her...?)</color>",
      "cn": "“你手持伏虞剑柄，与我那故人渊源颇深……<NL>若是死于你之手中，亦无不可……<NL>只是我鬼性难灭，你若出手，我免不了失控反抗……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸嗜血食人，不知应当如何处置……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b7fc092710638683",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4b572cd4-74af-4d14-bdbe-606ee297fa7e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why the bloodlust...)",
      "cn": "（为何嗜血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7524c5277772a81f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4b572cd4-74af-4d14-bdbe-606ee297fa7e/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Execute Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c7d975e34a78c9d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4b572cd4-74af-4d14-bdbe-606ee297fa7e/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Let her stay here...)",
      "cn": "（任她在此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11453b8b96ff09be",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I came all this way, only to find that it was you...<NL>You took away my Ultimate Yin Remold artifact! Give it back to me now, and I may spare your life!\"<NL>The red-robed senior sneers, his voice full of vigor, exuding a powerful aura that does not resemble that of a vengeful ghost...",
      "cn": "“我一路寻来，原来竟是你，<NL>夺了我那太阴炼形之法器！还不速速交还于我，如此我便饶你不死！”<NL>那红衣老人冷哼一声，说话间中气十足，浑然不似厉鬼再世……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "990d1a9f6f879157",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/Option_1": {
      "en": "I do not know anything about an artifact. Stop spouting such nonsense!",
      "cn": "我并不知什么法器，你莫要在此血口喷人！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "520146433ee89648",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/Option_2": {
      "en": "Hold on, even if I do not know anything about that artifact, I can help you retrieve it...",
      "cn": "且慢，我虽不知此事，倒是也能助你寻回法器……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3d4e85c43fb00109",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/Option_3": {
      "en": "I have never seen you before, so how could I have taken your artifact?",
      "cn": "我此前从未见过你，又如何能夺了你的法器？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5125a467d4f1b5e9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/Option_4": {
      "en": "What artifact? Why not call out its name and see if it responds?",
      "cn": "什么法器？你先叫它一声，且看它答应吗？",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "24256373242687e3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e9b7f0be-a8cb-40a3-ac87-eaeb01412ed3/Option_5": {
      "en": "I don't know anything about this artifact... If there's truly a treasure, then it belongs to the strong!",
      "cn": "且莫说我不知什么法器，但有宝物，自该能者得之！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f4f5331da21571c9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e385827e-842e-455f-b53e-69526114a43e/EventContent": {
      "en": "On that day, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is traveling on the road, and suddenly, in the dark night,<NL>glimpses a figure in red robe passing by, bearing a striking resemblance to the rumored \"red robed ghost\" in Yangzhou City...",
      "cn": "是日，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>行路途中，<NL>只觉夜色沉沉，停云昏昏，抬头望向前路，<NL>眼前忽而闪过红衣之影，却正似是扬州城内传闻的“红衣鬼怪”……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "23e4b5ace178b8ca",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e385827e-842e-455f-b53e-69526114a43e/Option_1": {
      "en": "I have heard about it a lot before, but now I have actually encountered it...",
      "cn": "此前多有听闻，今日却叫我撞见了……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "085a2d31c40696c9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "54e46ea1-751b-486a-b335-95377fc192a9/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi casually turned her face, her gaze seemingly lost in the distance.<NL>\"During these days, thank you for taking me in, providing me with food,<NL>taking care of my daily life,<NL>and allowing me to witness the gentle breeze and the myriad of creatures...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸轻轻侧过脸，视线却不知落于何方：<NL>“这些时日，多谢有你收留我在此，<NL>你予我饭食，照料我之起居，<NL>亦令我得见和风煦日，万物生灵……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "73784ab52e8edf1e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "54e46ea1-751b-486a-b335-95377fc192a9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "09f0aef2-270c-4e5a-8a45-dc885c01b353/EventContent": {
      "en": "The villagers are adoring and sincere, known for their simplicity.<NL>Seeing Jixiu suddenly freeze and gawk upon receiving care and attention, not knowing what to do, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> feels warmth fill <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> heart and smiles...",
      "cn": "村民热忱，向来淳朴，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>见姬穸忽受关怀，神情呆愣，一时竟手足无措，<NL>心中一暖，亦是不免眉花眼笑……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2babb3e732f6e0b3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "09f0aef2-270c-4e5a-8a45-dc885c01b353/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Do nothing...)",
      "cn": "（暂且作罢……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8a59862e5d3adb2c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fbd89be7-af84-4f03-bdc1-c4d855f76ae2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You don't need to understand.<NL>My beloved friend is no longer here, and from now on, I'll be alone...\"<NL>The girl's expression turns melancholic, she mumbles a few words before falling into silence...",
      "cn": "“你亦不必听懂，<NL>我之故人，如今不再返归，此后不过再余我孤独一人……”<NL>只见眼前之人神色微恸，喃喃数语后，终是归于寂静，再无波澜……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fc2d0ca5b776b91f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fbd89be7-af84-4f03-bdc1-c4d855f76ae2/Option_1": {
      "en": "Now... where are you heading...?",
      "cn": "如今……你要去往何处……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b1c2f492d3071a32",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86ccf914-49a0-4ae5-96f2-54afcd9628fb/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lowers her head and ponders for a moment. It is unclear what she has realized, but her expression gradually becomes calm.<NL>As a gust of cold wind blows, she finally looks up and meets <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s gaze, saying,<NL>\"I pursued all the way here, only to see this scene. It must be related to the strange events of that rainy night...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸闻言，低头思索片刻，也不知想到了什么，神情逐渐变得平静，<NL>待得一阵阴风吹过，终于再又抬起头来与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>对视道：<NL>“我追至此处，方才见得此景，想必与那雨夜异事不无关联……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "44d878803c5cde40",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86ccf914-49a0-4ae5-96f2-54afcd9628fb/Option_1": {
      "en": "I am puzzled and do not know the truth...",
      "cn": "我心中疑惑，不知真相究竟为何……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "01c8820f72409e7d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c2d49e6e-f1e7-499f-a0a1-e99fd7aef0c6/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> continues to inquire Jixi about details,<NL>seeking to understand why she was trapped in the ancient tomb of Sanguine Sect, how she possesses the skills to resist the red-robed senior,<NL>and the reason behind her previous weakness without any injuries...<NL><NL>However, Jixi shakes her head repeatedly, remaining silent about each and every question...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>又再细细询问姬穸，<NL>何以困于血犼教古墓之中，又如何有这能与红衣老人抗衡之身手，<NL>此前身体虚弱却非伤病，又是何故……<NL><NL>姬穸却频频摇头不语，桩桩件件，皆不得解……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e78ac8a648da9f9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c2d49e6e-f1e7-499f-a0a1-e99fd7aef0c6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ec5f8503-33be-4b94-93ce-1ee928d537ab/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You're holding the Fuyu Hilt, and it shares a deep connection with my old friend...<NL>If I were to die by your hand, it would be acceptable...<NL>But my ghostly nature is hard to control, and if you attack, I might lose control and fight back...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi has a bloodthirsty nature and eat people. How to deal with her...?)</color>",
      "cn": "“你手持伏虞剑柄，与我那故人渊源颇深……<NL>若是死于你之手中，亦无不可……<NL>只是我鬼性难灭，你若出手，我免不了失控反抗……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸嗜血食人，不知应当如何处置……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b7fc092710638683",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ec5f8503-33be-4b94-93ce-1ee928d537ab/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why the bloodlust...)",
      "cn": "（为何嗜血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7524c5277772a81f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ec5f8503-33be-4b94-93ce-1ee928d537ab/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Execute Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c7d975e34a78c9d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ec5f8503-33be-4b94-93ce-1ee928d537ab/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Let her stay here...)",
      "cn": "（任她在此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11453b8b96ff09be",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "20392614-765a-465f-98f5-e2c4c2a8e7fe/EventContent": {
      "en": "Inside Yangzhou City, fear spreads among people.<NL>They claim that some passersby saw the tomb cracked from the inside out,<NL>and a ghost has awakened from the tomb, intending to harm people. However, no one knows where the ghost is now...<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> further inquires and learns that the ghost tomb is located at the very place<NL>where the Red-Robed Senior's corpse sank after the battle with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Perhaps it would be appropriate to investigate Sanguine Valley...)</color>",
      "cn": "扬州城内，百姓惊惧，<NL>皆道是有路人途径，曾见此坟自内而外破开，<NL>必是鬼怪出坟，意欲害人，却不知鬼怪此时又在何方……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>又再探听详细，听闻鬼坟所在之处，<NL>竟正是自己当日与红衣老人交战、老人亡骸陷落之地……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（或许应当前往血犼谷查探一番……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fd30db36a027797e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "20392614-765a-465f-98f5-e2c4c2a8e7fe/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "64c5a966-0c90-4256-9bd8-e9c7e82a8a4b/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot bear to look closely.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> knows that although Jixi is a ghost, she is not heartless.<NL>There's a hint of warmth speading on <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> palm, which saddens <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> even more...<NL><NL>Jixi is reaching her limit, covered in blood, and eventually falls into <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s arms...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不忍细看，<NL>只觉姬穸虽是妖鬼，却非冷血，<NL>几分暖意落于手上，更令<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心中哀恸……<NL><NL>姬穸此时已再难支撑，<NL>身染猩红，终是跌落<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>怀中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dc205f7796e967d4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "64c5a966-0c90-4256-9bd8-e9c7e82a8a4b/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "427a014a-666e-4bd3-beca-a020b4e09118/EventContent": {
      "en": "Ignoring the sense of loss and filled with doubt,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks around and sees a crow carrying a message flying toward the dark clouds in the north...",
      "cn": "顾不得怅然有失，满心疑虑，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>举目四望，只见送信的乌鸦正往北面阴云密布之处飞去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6126f43897915649",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "427a014a-666e-4bd3-beca-a020b4e09118/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Follow the direction of the crow...)",
      "cn": "（循着乌鸦的方向追去……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fe5afbbee3a36ca5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b2bea182-9757-44b8-b514-1c92dbada95a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Under the dark clouds, the malevolent energy grows stronger.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> pushes on, breath quickening as the air grows cold.<NL>As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> turns a corner on the forest path, a crimson flash, thick with the stench of blood, lashes out at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> face!",
      "cn": "乌云之下，阴气大盛，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>提气急奔，只觉得空气越来越冷，随着林间小道忽地一转，<NL>一道血光伴随着一阵浓重的血腥之气便就往<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>面上扑来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bc08616a9f854278",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b2bea182-9757-44b8-b514-1c92dbada95a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Uh oh!)",
      "cn": "（不好！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "eaef6f99663d65a6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f6177035-661d-4f8a-921a-af2a94f0cc48/EventContent": {
      "en": "The place is filled with eerie blood flashes,<NL>and the stench is unbearable, making one want to vomit.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> does not understand the senior's intentions and can only endure silently, observing the situation.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> finds the red-robed senior sniffing around,<NL>and in an instant, a faint red blood light, floating like smoke, is sucked into his nose...",
      "cn": "此地诡谲血光涌动，<NL>腥腐难闻，令人几欲作呕，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不解老人之意，只得隐忍不发，静观其变，<NL>只见眼前红衣老人几番嗅探，须臾间，竟可见绯红血光，<NL>丝丝袅袅，如烟雾般被老人吸入鼻中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dd73dcdf9a72f37d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f6177035-661d-4f8a-921a-af2a94f0cc48/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Greatly appalled...)",
      "cn": "（心中大骇……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fac475444e9d189b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8007ef8e-f470-4746-a6c9-c66349b51419/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It is said... that the Ultimate Yin Jiangshi can become an immortal after a long period of cultivation...<NL>The truth of this matter is hard to discern... One shouldn't take it lightly...<NL>If the Jiangshi is released, it'll inevitably bring disaster to the world...\"<NL>Jixi's expression is hard to discern. Be it sorrowful or dilighted, it is difficult to tell her true thoughts...",
      "cn": "“相传……太阴活尸炼化久之，可得道成仙……<NL>此事虚实难辨……且当不得真……<NL>若活尸出世，必会为祸人间……”<NL>说至此处，姬穸神情莫测，悲喜难辨，不知心中究竟作何想法……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8164da27e07c84f9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8007ef8e-f470-4746-a6c9-c66349b51419/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c9b52cbe-0f8f-4ec2-affb-9c4fe7a20838/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If you had listened earlier and handed over my artifact, you wouldn't lose your life in vain!<NL>It's pity that you are not a disciple of our sect... Even if you die, I won't utilize your body...\"<NL>In a daze, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can only hear the senior's triumphant laughter, followed by a few sighs.<NL>Before <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can make out the words clearly, they have already faded away with the ringing sound of the bell...",
      "cn": "“若是早些听话，交出我之法器，又何必枉丢了性命！<NL>只可惜你非我教中弟子……纵是殒命……不堪用之……”<NL>恍惚之中，只闻老人得意大笑，却又有几声叹息，<NL>未及听清，便已伴随铃音一道远去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "559793d46e99dfd7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c9b52cbe-0f8f-4ec2-affb-9c4fe7a20838/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fcdce3d4-b6a6-48db-9dc7-70a51847e8ec/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Boars are indeed ugly and often attack people,<NL>so there would be no harm in hunting it for food today...\"<NL>Jixi frowned, and though she spoke these words, she didn't harm the little boar...",
      "cn": "“山猪确是丑陋，时常凶猛伤人，<NL>若今日猎之为食，亦无不可……”<NL>姬穸眉头紧皱，口中虽如此所言，却并未取那小山猪性命……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fdf4e1bdd0e4c6ee",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "fcdce3d4-b6a6-48db-9dc7-70a51847e8ec/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Wait silently...)",
      "cn": "（静观其变……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1d5c519788599df2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "467b7387-0594-46ad-b217-66fae19dbdff/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"The Ultimate Yin Jiangshi has emerged from the tomb,<NL>originally coming for me. I know how capable you are.<NL>It's just that since I'm a ghost from the underworld, I might have to be taken back...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“那太阴老尸如今破墓而出，<NL>原是为寻我而来，我自然信你能耐滔天，<NL>只是我已是妖鬼，难返人世，此事你却做不得主了……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1baa8547fc754ed7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "467b7387-0594-46ad-b217-66fae19dbdff/Option_1": {
      "en": "So this is the truth... But how do you know I can't go to the underworld and bring you back?",
      "cn": "真相原是如此……岂知我不能身去地狱，带你返归？\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "acd63c0970f146ca",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1fd20f5b-c1ce-40a3-9860-4c549cc911f3/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I've thought it over and decided to go and observe them.<NL>Only then can I come up with a foolproof plan to deal with this chicken's divine might...\"<NL>Jixi's words were serious, not at all like a joke. Although <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> found it both funny and frustrating, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> decided to accompany her to the Chicken Coop...",
      "cn": "“我再三思索，决意前去观察，<NL>如此方可思量出个万全之策，以应对此鸡神威……”<NL>姬穸言辞认真，不似玩笑，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>虽觉哭笑不得，亦决定陪伴姬穸前往元鸡舍……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2d17e5753feb35de",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1fd20f5b-c1ce-40a3-9860-4c549cc911f3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Go with her...)",
      "cn": "（相随前往……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "af0f7a5d968e772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "97942a3c-a730-47e4-9f87-dab555c62aa6/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi is sitting still in the village, motionless, her brows furrowed,<NL>surrounded by a crowd of villagers,<NL>all speaking their words of concern for her...",
      "cn": "只见姬穸此时正坐于村中，眉头紧蹙，僵直不动，<NL>四周包围，皆是太吾村中村民，<NL>七嘴八舌，尽是关切之言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "56f5f6b03c11913a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "97942a3c-a730-47e4-9f87-dab555c62aa6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ed1ac545-bac7-4b2a-9881-8e648b91bc74/EventContent": {
      "en": "On a rainy night, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> hurries forward with a serious expression.<NL>The gloominess here seems to linger, but no traces of ghosts or demons can be seen.<NL>Just as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is about to return home, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> catches a glimpse of Jixi's figure, swiftly passing by from not far away...",
      "cn": "雨夜，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>匆匆前行，神情凝重，<NL>此处阴森之气未散，却似乎已无妖异之状，<NL>待<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>欲要返归居所时，竟似是瞥见姬穸身影，自不远处一掠而过……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "df612565e6dc6a65",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ed1ac545-bac7-4b2a-9881-8e648b91bc74/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Perhaps it is just an illusion...)",
      "cn": "（或许是错觉……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9bb9857983ebc550",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "562f47c5-55e6-4e1e-a0ea-6721a483a5a6/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is struck by the red-robed senior on <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> vital spot, falling into a pool of blood.<NL>In <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> last moments, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees the rusted bell in <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> bag being snatched away by the senior...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>被红衣老人击中要害，倒在了一地血泊之中，<NL>弥留之际，只望着行囊中那破旧的铃铛，也叫那红衣老人一把夺了去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "64a68cbd5ed8b883",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "562f47c5-55e6-4e1e-a0ea-6721a483a5a6/Option_1": {
      "en": "Ugh... Argh...",
      "cn": "呃……啊……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c4494168915cd4bf",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a9a5e619-22c2-4990-894b-6ef01f05c519/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oink... oink...\"<NL>A small wild boar, looking like it had just been weaned,<NL>burst out of the woods, staring blankly at Jixi and <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "“哦咿……哦咿……”<NL>只见一只似是断奶不久的山猪幼崽，横冲直撞，<NL>自那山林之中钻了出来，茫然地盯着眼前姬穸与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9e82dc936c6b1552",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a9a5e619-22c2-4990-894b-6ef01f05c519/Option_1": {
      "en": "It's... a boar...",
      "cn": "竟是……山猪……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "96bed5eba7177c3a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8e649596-46c1-4d2b-a600-30a87d621456/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You are tender-hearted and compassionate,<NL>and I am well aware of that... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你多情善感，心慈手软，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "21c68d1e15990141",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8e649596-46c1-4d2b-a600-30a87d621456/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5e9e1d4d-2f81-4315-8100-7dde2418c284/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I was physically weak since childhood and died at the age of seven.<NL>When I was alive, I did not receive the love of my mother.<NL>It was only at my funeral that my father wept and said, 'I did not know I had a girl until now. Today, I finally see her, but at her funeral.'<NL>Now is dusk time and I'll name her Xi, meaning the dusk...<NL>Taiwu, this is my origin...\"",
      "cn": "“我自幼体弱，七岁夭亡，<NL>生时不得母后宠爱，至死方得父王起名，<NL>葬礼上，父王泣道：此女生来，余未知悉，今日得见，却是下葬，<NL>此刻已是黄昏，便以‘穸’为名罢……<NL>太吾，这便是我的身世了……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f327b0ac204d75c1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "5e9e1d4d-2f81-4315-8100-7dde2418c284/Option_1": {
      "en": "You were named by your father after death... I never thought that although you were a descendant of an emperor, you could be so... so...",
      "cn": "至死方得父王起名……想不到，你虽是帝王之后……却也如此……如此……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "881ab149e98921ab",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aa41ddfb-7486-4936-a4e0-95de149e0866/EventContent": {
      "en": "In recent days, strange incidents have been happening in Taiwu Village.<NL>Villagers complain to <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> that there are ghostly shadows at night, difficult to trace.<NL>Also, there are strange sounds coming from empty houses, but they are not from rats, ants, or wild animals.<NL>And in the morning, mysterious bloodstains can be seen in the houses, with no apparent source...",
      "cn": "太吾村中，近日常有怪事频发，<NL>时有村民向<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>抱怨，夜有鬼影，难辨踪迹，<NL>无人空房内却有怪异响动，既非鼠蚁，亦非野兽，<NL>待得清晨，更可见家中诡异血迹，不知从何而来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "553367da0b0b6554",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aa41ddfb-7486-4936-a4e0-95de149e0866/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is indeed very strange...)",
      "cn": "（此事实在蹊跷……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2a8f9970d9bc68e2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8bfea1a5-4816-42bf-8918-96b9ac50e44a/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"May I have a pleasant dream in the underworld... and no longer wake up...\"<NL>Just as Jixi closes her eyes lightly, she slowly sinks into the soaked, bloodied soil.<NL>This peculiar scene seems as if the underworld is embracing her and granting her peaceful slumber...",
      "cn": "“黄泉好梦……再不欲醒……”<NL>只见姬穸双目轻阖，缓缓沉入浸血泥土之中，<NL>此情此景虽是奇异，却似九冥拥她入怀，予她安眠……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "19ba43d14d63cad3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8bfea1a5-4816-42bf-8918-96b9ac50e44a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot bear to end her life, shaking <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> head repeatedly.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> only wishes to let Jixi go, but she is surprised and asks,<NL>\"I'm the Lord of Ghosts and feed on humans. If you seek to kill me later, my ghost nature will not allow me to yield.<NL>Are you... truly not going to kill me?\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>终究不忍痛下杀手，几番摇头，<NL>只愿放任姬穸离去，姬穸闻言，颇是诧异：<NL>“我乃鬼王，以人为食，将来你再要除我，我鬼性发作，必不会顺从就死，<NL>你……当真不杀我？”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6cfd8f8dc8a84e1e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/Option_1": {
      "en": "You spared lives and helped me eliminate evil. There is no need to exterminate you...",
      "cn": "今日你未曾害人性命，又助我除恶，何必赶尽杀绝……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f6c43f622610c812",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/Option_2": {
      "en": "We have been together for so long, day and night. I am not a heartless person...",
      "cn": "你我相伴至今，朝夕共处，我又岂是铁石心肠之人……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "bf09105e0b21987e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/Option_3": {
      "en": "I know your nature is not evil, yet you are bound by fate. It is futile to resist...",
      "cn": "我知你心性非恶，天意令你如此，不过是无可奈何……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f197ea4f600f4739",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/Option_4": {
      "en": "I wish only to grant you freedom in this world, but it is a pity that I cannot go with you...",
      "cn": "我只愿予你自在天地，只是可惜，尚不能随你而去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5f337831cbd4b939",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0c3a4c97-809d-4033-a6e1-6beeba27bd31/Option_5": {
      "en": "I want to set you free, who dares to intervene? We can meet again in the future and settle this then...",
      "cn": "我欲放你，谁敢置喙？待日后再见，尽可再做了断……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "46ae4fbedde992f3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e3df9190-3f62-4796-ac8a-38914e4f2f93/EventContent": {
      "en": "There is no time for words. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> moves to shield Jixi,<NL>pulling her clear of the ambush. As they steady themselves,<NL>they find a familiar black-and-red form—the Red-Robed Senior! He emerges from the shadows, more a corpse than before!",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>未及多言，只挡在姬穸身前，<NL>携她一同闪过这始料未及的突袭，待得回过神来，定睛一望，<NL>眼前黑红身影分外眼熟，竟是已然更似尸鬼的红衣老人，不知从何处现身！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "98305e6c061d83f0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e3df9190-3f62-4796-ac8a-38914e4f2f93/Option_1": {
      "en": "You old rotten corpse! How dare you attack us!",
      "cn": "太阴老尸！竟仍敢袭来！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "be639e63bc27010a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c337854c-768f-448c-89bb-3deb1168fd4e/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "68208a24-c2ee-4aee-baab-af39b8d520a6/EventContent": {
      "en": "With some free time recently, Jixi, having stayed in Taiwu Village for a while,<NL>suddenly became curious about the village's chickens and seemed to want to go observe them...",
      "cn": "近日闲暇，姬穸久住太吾村中，<NL>忽对村中元鸡心生好奇，似有前往观察之意……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9754d211f744ce7b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "68208a24-c2ee-4aee-baab-af39b8d520a6/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ask for the reason...)",
      "cn": "（问及缘故……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "58cdbabae6d3083e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6a1e491e-4514-40b4-9dfe-babe756af066/EventContent": {
      "en": "Everything about the Red-Robed Senior is unnatural.<NL>A single glance is all it takes for the realization to strike <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>:<NL>Jixi consumed blood, but never murdered.<NL>The real murderer is this Jiangshi Senior right in front of <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>!",
      "cn": "只见那红衣老人周身迹象，皆不寻常，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只多瞧一眼，便转瞬了悟，<NL>姬穸虽曾吸食人血，却未伤人性命，害人性命者，却应是眼前这僵尸老人！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "65d81eb2d1447fb1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6a1e491e-4514-40b4-9dfe-babe756af066/Option_1": {
      "en": "You wicked ghost! You deserve to die!",
      "cn": "你这恶鬼！死不足惜！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6ed553bf70bd721c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6dcef7c8-5998-4d94-ae25-33db3c5fc49a/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"That's right...<NL>I have an indomitable ghostly nature now.<NL>If I get close to you again, I'll ultimately become a great danger. Don't forget this...\"<NL>Jixi sighs lightly and falls silent...",
      "cn": "“是了……<NL>我如今鬼性难除，<NL>若再与你接近，终是大患，你且莫忘……”<NL>姬穸轻叹一声，不再多言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8150ebe485511104",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6dcef7c8-5998-4d94-ae25-33db3c5fc49a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "81f6b5f6-4c15-48fd-84de-2640d9c59920/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Hmph, I am the ghost from that grave.<NL>What else in this world... can make me feel scared?\"<NL>Jixi snorts coldly. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks into her eyes, which are clear and determined, but <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> cannot tell if her words are true or false...",
      "cn": "“哼，我自己便是那墓中鬼怪，<NL>这世上……又有何物能叫我害怕？”<NL>姬穸冷哼一声，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>观其眼神，澄澈坚定，却不知此言虚实……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f193c2029268f60a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "81f6b5f6-4c15-48fd-84de-2640d9c59920/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9f7bfe6f-1137-4440-8ecd-b2e3c4254090/EventContent": {
      "en": "{0}",
      "cn": "{0}",
      "ru": "{0}",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "660cf56f05961bfe",
      "engine": "neutral",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "9f7bfe6f-1137-4440-8ecd-b2e3c4254090/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f394df50-99ab-47a7-a42d-c29225b73119/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lowers her head and ponders for a moment. It is unclear what she has realized, but her expression gradually becomes relieved.<NL>When a gust of cold wind blows, she finally raises her head and looks at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, saying,<NL>\"I chased after the murderer and just witnessed this scene. I just don't know why you never doubted me...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸闻言，低头思索片刻，也不知想到了什么，神情逐渐变得释然，<NL>待得一阵阴风吹过，终于再又抬起头来与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>对视道：<NL>“我追至此处，方见此景，只是不知你为何未曾疑心于我……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "697d25d6185782eb",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f394df50-99ab-47a7-a42d-c29225b73119/Option_1": {
      "en": "I don't know the truth behind it all but I know you would never harm anyone...",
      "cn": "我虽不知真相究竟为何，却知你绝不会害人性命……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "296726acec6e3865",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e866b9c7-bd78-4e6d-af48-b294eebedf20/EventContent": {
      "en": "After reading through it carefully, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> becomes even more shocked.<NL>The Red-Robed Senior did mention searching for the sect founder and the Ultimate Yin Remold before.<NL>But <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> did not expect that the senior resorted to using his own body as a material after failing to remold the disciples of the Sanguine Sect.<NL>Now, he has turned into a Jiangshi...",
      "cn": "细细读完，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>更为大惊，<NL>所谓寻觅祖师、太阴炼形之语，此前亦曾听闻红衣老人提及，<NL>未曾想到，炼化血犼教弟子不成，红衣老人竟不惜以自身为秘法材料，<NL>如今竟已化作僵尸不成……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b2356a24d6413cc5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e866b9c7-bd78-4e6d-af48-b294eebedf20/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4dc2cc2-2066-4a85-8b3e-230a5f9562c9/EventContent": {
      "en": "The matter with Jixi has come to an end, leaving <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> with a sense of melancholy and unease.<NL>But in Taiwu Village, there is no longer any ghostly aura, and peace has returned...",
      "cn": "此间姬穸之事已了，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心有怅然，暂难舒怀，<NL>而太吾村中，自此亦再无鬼气，重归宁静……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ec63554bda1982ae",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b4dc2cc2-2066-4a85-8b3e-230a5f9562c9/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "97bd319f-d656-47de-a0c0-4445e54e09c4/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> takes a few steps forward and stands side by side with Jixi.<NL>However, Jixi seems slightly relaxed, with a lingering hint of sorrow between her eyebrows...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>上前几步，与姬穸并肩而立，<NL>却见姬穸似是略有放松，眉间仍是愁绪不解……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1221fff4363b2ea2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "97bd319f-d656-47de-a0c0-4445e54e09c4/Option_1": {
      "en": "If you have something on your mind, feel free to tell me...",
      "cn": "若有心事，不妨说与我听……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4991dcfcde9be13c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3ae1d682-a1d3-47d1-b18b-ba0161d69108/EventContent": {
      "en": "The informant just shakes his head gently, saying,<NL>\"Ah... You don't know...<NL>That red-robed 'ghost' rarely comes near Yangzhou City. It often lingers in the Sanguine Valley.<NL>As you draw near the graves there, the atmosphere grows vastly more bloody and terrifying. It's a world apart from the ordinary...",
      "cn": "知情人只是徐徐摇头：<NL>“唉……你有所不知……<NL>那红衣‘鬼怪’倒也不常来扬州城外，只是时常徘徊于血犼谷之中，<NL>若你离血犼谷中几处墓地近些，便更有血腥骇人之气息，与寻常大不相同……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5c3235d4cecb2cd0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3ae1d682-a1d3-47d1-b18b-ba0161d69108/Option_1": {
      "en": "So it seems that the ghost appears in a tomb chamber of the Sanguine Valley...",
      "cn": "如此看来，那鬼怪似是出没于血犼谷墓穴之中……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ac7a14e37defde21",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "33a43279-4662-471a-91bb-f8cbd7365f92/EventContent": {
      "en": "Since Jixi came to Taiwu Village, some time had passed...<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices in a sudden<NL>that the girl <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> once knew has grown into a young woman...",
      "cn": "自姬穸来到太吾村，如今已有一些时日……<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>猛地察觉，<NL>不知何时，昔日女童今日竟已长成女郎模样……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4af9d96f2750000d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "33a43279-4662-471a-91bb-f8cbd7365f92/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi is indeed mysterious...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸如此，果然蹊跷……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6af36b70beb5d280",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c07e2f27-511a-4bee-a403-5163a84e374c/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, a large crow suddenly dropped a letter into <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s hand:<NL><NL>\"It's time to say goodbye, take care!\"<NL><NL>The letter was sparse with words, but the strokes were heavy, indicating countless thoughts. The signature on the letter was \"Xi.\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s heart shook with sadness...",
      "cn": "恰在此时，一只硕大的乌鸦忽然衔着一封书信扔到<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>手中：<NL><NL>“终是到了分别之时，万望珍重！”<NL><NL>信中寥寥数字，却是笔划滞重，想来其中定有思虑万千，<NL>而书信的落款正是一个“穸”字，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心头一震，悲从中来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "912fb27d0ab4080d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c07e2f27-511a-4bee-a403-5163a84e374c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is...)",
      "cn": "（这是……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6021a17ee85ae445",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f8d58258-2e1f-4c4b-af8e-42fac75e23e3/EventContent": {
      "en": "The sinister and bizarre Sanguine's wicked skill is creepy... There must be something unusual about thee bell-shape artifact.<NL>Having realized this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> firmly refuses the senior, causing the red-robed senior's expression to turn cold instantly...",
      "cn": "血犼邪法，诡谲怪诞，此铃铛法器必然有异，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此，断然拒绝，红衣老人见索要不成，当即脸色一变……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1305e60f6eca8792",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f8d58258-2e1f-4c4b-af8e-42fac75e23e3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Alright...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "098a99cc2ad62a4b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "23cd3d45-263f-4b28-8b2f-cf02858f6767/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"...\"<NL>Jixi remains silent...",
      "cn": "“……”<NL>姬穸不语……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fd619c63c369480f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "23cd3d45-263f-4b28-8b2f-cf02858f6767/Option_1": {
      "en": "Could it be that the ghost's attack on the village is related to this?!",
      "cn": "那村中妖鬼袭人之事，莫非与此事有关？！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5ccbdf70d21121a1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7064f4fb-8a8d-4de1-babe-2c5b8670bed7/EventContent": {
      "en": "Unable to withstand <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s assault,<NL>the red-robed senior was struck in a vital spot, spewing out blood and falling into a pool of blood.<NL>Before he exhales his last breath, it seems that he still has some lingering words, murmuring incessantly...",
      "cn": "红衣老人不敌<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，<NL>竟被<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>击中要害，口中喷出鲜血，倒在一地血泊之中，<NL>气若游丝间，似乎仍有执念之语，喃喃不止……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "559051cd341dc5c2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "7064f4fb-8a8d-4de1-babe-2c5b8670bed7/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Get closer and listen carefully...)",
      "cn": "（凑近细听……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "89cfa59bda521624",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bc1b64c9-1f66-46cc-bfa3-8b950220e6f5/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I have lost my loved ones and have no attachment in my heart.<NL>Now I wander through the world, despite my deep disgust and pain, forced to feed on humans for survival.<NL>I've endured countless sufferings and have become as lifeless as a dead tree, only hoping for someone to free me, to let my soul return to its good old days...\"<NL>The senior sighs lightly, with crimson eyes that remain calm and serene.",
      "cn": "“我故人已逝，心中了无牵挂，<NL>如今游荡世间，纵然深恶痛绝，却只得食人为生，<NL>百般苦痛，早已心如槁木，只盼有人渡我，令我魂归故梦……”<NL>只见眼前之人轻叹一声，鲜红双眸，始终古井无波……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "382e462b12c71e8e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bc1b64c9-1f66-46cc-bfa3-8b950220e6f5/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Feel a surge of emotions in heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中慨然……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b0b6c6dca5d9f21b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4aa90de0-7b2a-4eaa-ada2-21ec09d55093/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi ate very little, as if she never felt hunger,<NL>yet she showed no signs of weakness. Perhaps she really did have a tiny appetite.<NL>Thinking this, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> didn't insist further.<NL>Instead, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> invited the villagers to share the meal. Jixi didn't seem annoyed; in fact, she seemed to think it was a good idea... ",
      "cn": "姬穸饮食甚少，如同不知饥饿，<NL>却未见因此虚弱，或许确是饭量极小，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>思及此处，便不再强求，<NL>遂相邀村民同享餐食，姬穸并非厌烦，似是亦觉如此甚好…… ",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d02d95d1232c7396",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4aa90de0-7b2a-4eaa-ada2-21ec09d55093/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Never mind...)",
      "cn": "（无可奈何……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "66ca81841de86fe3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "081a8b9a-f743-4fe0-94a5-cf3be2b73c7e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Why do you say this...<NL>You know that I crave blood and feed on humans and you're still willing to accompany me?\"<NL>Upon hearing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s words, Jixi's face reveals surprise, appearing somewhat unsure and not knowing what to do...",
      "cn": "“如何忽有此言……<NL>你知我嗜血食人，却仍愿与我同行吗……”<NL>姬穸听闻<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>之话，面露愕然，似有几分无措……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "78f4e37b486feb14",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "081a8b9a-f743-4fe0-94a5-cf3be2b73c7e/Option_1": {
      "en": "Regardless of the circumstances, I only hope that you can stay by my side...",
      "cn": "无论世事如何，只盼你能伴我左右……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a635c9aec58b3e40",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f1ce7b43-8ab5-4c4d-8396-4b8ff2b14874/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I fear that one day I might lose control and harm you.<NL>From now on, I'll be wherever you can find me. Together, we'll go to the end of the world...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(From now on, Jixi will accompany Taiwu on the journey...)</color>",
      "cn": "“我唯恐有朝一日，失控伤你，<NL>今后我便在你能寻见之处，伴你左右，与你一道，去那天涯海角……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（今后姬穸将随行左右，一道踏上旅途……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5937366786c65a02",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f1ce7b43-8ab5-4c4d-8396-4b8ff2b14874/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Now... you have taken up the Fuyu Hilt again. Good...</color>But my ghostly nature is hard to suppress. If you attack me, I can't guarantee that I won't resist...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi has a bloodthirsty nature. How to deal with her...?)",
      "cn": "“如今……你再次执起伏虞剑柄，很好……<NL>只是我鬼性难灭，你若出手，我免不了失控反抗……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸嗜血食人，不知应当如何处置……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d2d5a376c4d1716f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why the bloodlust...)",
      "cn": "（为何嗜血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7524c5277772a81f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Execute Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c7d975e34a78c9d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Ask how she's been...)",
      "cn": "（问及近况……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "100e6db78e5e71fe",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_4": {
      "en": "(Present a beast...)",
      "cn": "（赠送野兽……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5fde214aef61c8f3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_5": {
      "en": "(Accompany me...)",
      "cn": "（与我同行……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f20e8843cdefb219",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4df65d7-1c30-445b-8cd9-feea7c86fbf1/Option_6": {
      "en": "(Let her stay here...)",
      "cn": "（任她在此……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "11453b8b96ff09be",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cf2f6468-ca66-424c-8758-653dcddba073/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It's you... you've come again...<NL>Now you should know that the past and old dreams are all empty, previous life and fate cannot be continued...\"",
      "cn": "“是你……你又来了……<NL>如今你也该知晓，前尘旧梦本为空，他生因缘自难续……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a7b5745782fdb72b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cf2f6468-ca66-424c-8758-653dcddba073/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Why is that?)",
      "cn": "（此为何故……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "63f07e4b758e62c0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c856915-ac6d-43c2-b01f-376c2f4a2dc3/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"This... is good...<NL>I don't know why... at this moment, I suddenly...<NL>understand how it feels to be warm...\"<NL>Jixi murmurs a few words, trying hard to reach out her hand toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "“如此……甚好……<NL>不知为何……此时此刻，我竟然……<NL>重又知晓何为温暖……何为……”<NL>姬穸此时，喃喃数语，又竭力朝<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>伸出手来……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "27d23fb3d5952849",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1c856915-ac6d-43c2-b01f-376c2f4a2dc3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Doesn't understand the meaning...)",
      "cn": "（不解其意……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8402620a8c17d479",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b95f4ed3-86e8-450e-83ef-be766906056e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Afterward, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> buries the Spirit-summoning Bell with Jixi,<NL>along with all the past memories. Although <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> does not know the past they shared,<NL>everything has been buried and will never be mentioned again...",
      "cn": "此后，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>又将那招魂铃与姬穸同葬一处，<NL>落土纷纷之时，此前种种浮上心头，虽不知姬穸口中两人前尘往事，<NL>然而旧事零落，悉数掩埋，日后亦再无人重提……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "139745778ed61c4c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b95f4ed3-86e8-450e-83ef-be766906056e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1d047c3d-cd21-498e-8210-fc7e04bfa597/EventContent": {
      "en": "The next day at noon, after resting, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can sleep no more.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> steps outside the house and sees that the rain has stopped, but the dark clouds in the sky have not dissipated...",
      "cn": "次日正午，<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>休憩之后，再无睡意，<NL>出至屋外，雨霁风停，唯有天边阴云仍未散去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "98ca113d81644ffc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1d047c3d-cd21-498e-8210-fc7e04bfa597/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bf33786f-d592-495f-9895-8b3f20f65c0c/EventContent": {
      "en": "After leaving the Tea House, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> walks through the streets and alleys.<NL>The people <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> sees are all in a rush, looking frightened.<NL>It seems that the rumors of \"ghost\" has already spread throughout Yangzhou City...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>自茶寮离开，漫步街巷，<NL>所见之人皆是行色匆匆，神情惊惶，<NL>想来如今扬州城内，“鬼怪”流言早已四起……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5d9bcb365fb97f71",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "bf33786f-d592-495f-9895-8b3f20f65c0c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ponder...)",
      "cn": "（若有所思……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "959e1bb1cb37f5a5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b1d3f29b-b46e-465d-8cec-bf0ce1e5ca4a/EventContent": {
      "en": "{0}",
      "cn": "{0}",
      "ru": "{0}",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "660cf56f05961bfe",
      "engine": "neutral",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-21T21:21:05.664Z"
    },
    "b1d3f29b-b46e-465d-8cec-bf0ce1e5ca4a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Observe...)",
      "cn": "（观察……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "678bce38f22f2331",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b1d3f29b-b46e-465d-8cec-bf0ce1e5ca4a/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Talk...)",
      "cn": "（交谈……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cbf0dc5b40bd47bb",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b1d3f29b-b46e-465d-8cec-bf0ce1e5ca4a/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Gift...)",
      "cn": "（赠送……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "522496a74d35b8a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b1d3f29b-b46e-465d-8cec-bf0ce1e5ca4a/Option_4": {
      "en": "(No words...)",
      "cn": "（无话……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7ac820faf63093bb",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "736ca3a9-6a9f-42df-adda-9bafda9b0e29/EventContent": {
      "en": "As Jixi falls to the ground, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> hears her sigh deeply, and <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> consciousness suddenly fades into darkness...",
      "cn": "倒地之时，竟闻姬穸长叹之声，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>神思恍然，终是堕入昏黑之中……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8bf7ac9c2f87469",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "736ca3a9-6a9f-42df-adda-9bafda9b0e29/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0d16a332-cf95-4ae2-899f-a70a2c432048/EventContent": {
      "en": "However, Jixi changes the subject without hesitation<NL>and looks at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, nodding,<NL>\"I have long since slept in the ancient tomb. I am no longer a living person, and I naturally need to feed on human blood to survive...<NL>Before, because of my unbearable hunger, I went out at midnight and tasted the blood of several people in your village...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸却是话锋一转，未有迟疑，<NL>只望着<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，点头道：<NL>“我长眠古墓，早非活人，自然需吸食人血为生……<NL>此前确是我难耐饥饿，夜半外出，便尝了你村中几人之鲜血……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "74766cbf5f81ff40",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0d16a332-cf95-4ae2-899f-a70a2c432048/Option_1": {
      "en": "No... it couldn't be you!",
      "cn": "不……岂会是你？！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "dbf5a156fd894c36",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2241b605-45ac-418e-9bfc-27406bbaf1e3/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this point, words are meaningless and infertile.<NL>Just as <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is about to speak, a sudden gust of wind blows, bringing a rotten stench.<NL>In an instant, a pair of sharp claws fly toward them from behind!",
      "cn": "事已至此，万般话语，已是枉然，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>再要开口，却忽觉阴风大作，腐臭逼人，<NL>刹时之间，一双五指利爪自身后破空而来！",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5851e809486506b9",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "2241b605-45ac-418e-9bfc-27406bbaf1e3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Oh, no!)",
      "cn": "（暗叫不好！）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5232eacaa076ceab",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c40860e1-2006-4a24-8eb8-0be65eba7ba6/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ad20bb47-b3aa-4092-8a07-b623f563e079/EventContent": {
      "en": "With time running out and the crisis at hand, Jixi sighs, but says no more.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> sees her raise her hand, concentrate, and shout loudly at the Jiangshi senior, \"I am the Lord of Ghosts, the Dominator of All Graves.<NL>Even if I'm bound by countless calamities, I won't tolerate your insolence here!\"",
      "cn": "时间紧迫，危机当前，<NL>姬穸轻叹一声，却是再无别话，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>只见她抬手一挥，凝神捏诀，向那僵尸老人大喊一声：<NL><NL>“我乃千鬼之王，万墓老祖，<NL>纵受百千劫缚，也容不得你在此放肆！”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0d6e4d19a3dec387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ad20bb47-b3aa-4092-8a07-b623f563e079/Option_1": {
      "en": "Jixi!",
      "cn": "姬穸！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a2132f13233c264e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "65a671e9-90b3-40ec-8c8c-c0e61b5abec2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It's cute... I suppose it is cute...<NL>But that wild rabbit is too weak. Let's let it go.<NL>We can catch and eat something uglier and fiercer when we find it...\"<NL>Jixi snorted. She watched the rabbit disappear into the forest before continuing on...",
      "cn": "“若说可爱……确是可爱……<NL>那野兔太过弱小，不如放它一命，<NL>等猎到丑陋凶猛些的野兽，再捉去吃了……”<NL>姬穸冷哼一声，看那野兔隐于山林之中，复又继续前行……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "34f03cf0ce8a5958",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "65a671e9-90b3-40ec-8c8c-c0e61b5abec2/Option_1": {
      "en": "(I wonder if there are any fierce beasts on this mountain...)",
      "cn": "（不知此山间可有凶猛野兽……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b79dbb4410484702",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "172904b7-eaed-46c4-b95f-5967c6683e0e/EventContent": {
      "en": "The passerby who has mentioned the \"ghost\" earlier is now trembling in fear.<NL>With a glance, the Sanguine Sect disciple spots <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> and snarls,<NL>\"And you! You look familiar! What are you snooping around for? You wanna die?\"",
      "cn": "此前言及“鬼怪”的知情路人，<NL>此时早已被吓得瑟瑟发抖，<NL><NL>血犼弟子眼珠一转，瞥见<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>，忽然出言喝道：<NL>“还有你！好生眼熟，四处探听些什么！？活腻味了吗！”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9d7f2b9849afec91",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "172904b7-eaed-46c4-b95f-5967c6683e0e/Option_1": {
      "en": "Such a domineering disciple! How arrogant!",
      "cn": "好个威风的“神教”弟子，竟如此蛮横！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "2c2f7fe277d16a82",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "59427e08-dbb3-47ad-b2d7-2e571d4582d8/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot understand her words and lowers <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> head.<NL>As Jixi approaches, her blood-red eyes have lost their radiance.<NL>She musters all her strength and gently kisses <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s forehead,<NL>but the kiss is fleeting, barely touching.",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>不解其意，仍是低垂头颅，<NL>此间近在咫尺，姬穸血红眼中，光彩渐失，<NL>却见她用尽力气，轻轻一吻，落于<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>眉心，<NL>只是未及停留，转瞬即逝，终是轻擦而过……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "33e9b91621ae6b41",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "59427e08-dbb3-47ad-b2d7-2e571d4582d8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4d96adb8-61e1-4696-a26a-9f0f138ab2bb/EventContent": {
      "en": "The matter with Jixi has come to an end, leaving <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> with a sense of melancholy and unease.<NL>But in Taiwu Village, there is no longer any ghostly aura, and peace has returned...",
      "cn": "此间姬穸之事已了，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心有怅然，暂难舒怀，<NL>而太吾村中，自此亦再无鬼气，重归宁静……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ec63554bda1982ae",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "4d96adb8-61e1-4696-a26a-9f0f138ab2bb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1ca93e84-f357-457a-80b0-ce3bba0e100e/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> is overwhelmed.<NL>Knocked down by the Sanguine Sect disciple, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> cannot get up...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>一时不敌，<NL>竟被那血犼教弟子打倒在地，再难起身……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4e5c43ae0474b0a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1ca93e84-f357-457a-80b0-ce3bba0e100e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b43c83c8-ac00-40a9-ab50-86bd1105c904/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> stops and quietly waits for Jixi to speak.<NL>\"Ah... it's not that I'm worried. It's just that after living here for a long time, I often think about the past...<NL>In this village, there is peace and tranquility, and you and the villagers have treated me so well. Now there are no more troubles...\"",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>停留此处，只是静待姬穸开口：<NL>“唉……非我心忧，只是久居村中，常常念及往事……<NL>此处鸡犬桑麻，恬静自在，你与村人皆待我极好，如今再无任何烦扰……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7fbbd9a79bacf26e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "b43c83c8-ac00-40a9-ab50-86bd1105c904/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Listen attentively...)",
      "cn": "（细细倾听……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cfaf177221e5f2e8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "269932d4-738b-4cf2-b525-598c60c51824/EventContent": {
      "en": "While malevolent ghosts slaughter the innocent,<NL>people from the Sanguine Sect blindly and fervently feast upon the chaos.<NL>They worship their founder, burning incense and chanting empty prayers every day—lost in heresy and senseless taboos...<NL><NL>Such are the practices in the Sanguine Sect. They are engaged in sinister rituals and merciless slaughter; their power grows through cruelty.<NL>And now, calling upon stars and ghosts, their dark influence spreads like a shadow...",
      "cn": "世间正有鬼怪杀生，生灵涂炭，<NL>血犼教诸人却趋之若鹜，狂热崇信，<NL>奉得祖师，“烧一炷香，谩礼三拜”，歧路设忌，一无所解……<NL><NL>诸如此类，血犼教中邪法祭祀，屠戮不仁，邪功势壮，惨无人理，<NL>如此不一而足，更是呼星召鬼，一时气焰大盛……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5b2562362c5625f4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "269932d4-738b-4cf2-b525-598c60c51824/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0b4a4dd7-4e70-4665-805c-398090db1fb0/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, having a brief conversation with Jixi, feels a sense of unease,<NL>but seeing Jixi seemingly unaffected, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> thinks it might be unnecessary worry.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> says goodbye to Jixi and watches her silhouette fade into the distance...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与姬穸共话片刻，<NL>心中虽有隐忧，却又见姬穸并无异常，<NL>只觉多虑，便与姬穸道别，目送她离去之背影……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "9a0665ed474b3cd6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0b4a4dd7-4e70-4665-805c-398090db1fb0/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi seems to have grown up a lot...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸似乎……长大了不少……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f935388983989674",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aeac47c4-7e67-41f7-b285-4d7441fd9021/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It would be ultimately self-deception.<NL>As long as I stay in this village, in this world, there will be hundreds, thousands of people who suffer because of me.<NL>When the time comes, it'd be too late for us to figure out a solution...\"",
      "cn": "“此举说来，终究只是自欺欺人，<NL>只要我在这村中一日，在这人世一日……<NL>便会有百人千人受我所害，到得此时，你我却再难寻得解法……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "418b7512fe664457",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "aeac47c4-7e67-41f7-b285-4d7441fd9021/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Speechless...)",
      "cn": "（无言以对……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c929634184862ab6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "29e098a4-f636-4379-84b3-03fa9fcf1f7e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Ignoring the sense of loss and filled with doubt,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> looks around and sees a crow carrying a message flying toward the dark clouds in the north...",
      "cn": "顾不得怅然有失，满心疑虑，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>举目四望，只见送信的乌鸦正往北面阴云密布之处飞去……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6126f43897915649",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "29e098a4-f636-4379-84b3-03fa9fcf1f7e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Follow the direction of the crow...)",
      "cn": "（循着乌鸦的方向追去……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fe5afbbee3a36ca5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d7299202-cf5d-4087-a7e4-1cf5625c0d81/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I am delighted by both you and Taiwu Village...<NL>However, the world is ever-changing, and nothing lasts forever.<NL>Today, I will sacrifice myself for you, as a gratitude for your company, fulfilling my final wish...\"",
      "cn": "“你与太吾村，我皆甚是欢喜，<NL>只是阴晴圆缺，世上圆满终无长久，<NL>今日此战，我舍身为你，就当是谢你朝夕相伴，圆我一梦……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3d026b4be5e1abe4",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d7299202-cf5d-4087-a7e4-1cf5625c0d81/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5cfb1968e963bd9b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a922e20b-d838-4583-9e06-a75866c8b78e/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"So desolate?<NL>But I don't think so...<NL>My father, the king, loved evildoers and brought calamity to our country. In the end, my home was destroyed by normadic invaders.<NL>I never met him during my lifetime, and perhaps that was not such a bad thing...\"<NL><NL>As Jixi finishes speaking, her eyes grow dim, clearly reluctant to talk on...",
      "cn": "“如此凄凉？<NL>我却不这么想……<NL>父王他宠爱妖人，祸害家国，终被蛮夷所灭，<NL>我生时未曾与他谋面，想来却也不是什么坏事……”<NL><NL>姬穸说完，眼中黯淡无光，显然难以再多言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0178e1ad72b08be2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a922e20b-d838-4583-9e06-a75866c8b78e/Option_1": {
      "en": "(That's enough for now...)",
      "cn": "（到此为止……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5e1adbf7eb3bcd69",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f3d62111-f3f4-41fa-b4eb-fa0a0d17b8ff/EventContent": {
      "en": "The two of them went deep into the forest and encountered more creatures,<NL>a few lone monkeys, or a small flock of pheasants.<NL>Jixi still moved first, swiftly grabbing the animals, but after examining them for a moment, she found them cute too.<NL>In the end, she released the monkeys and pheasants back into the woods, ending up with nothing...",
      "cn": "两人一路深入林中，再遇生灵，<NL>或是几只落单狨猴，或是三两成群雉鸡，<NL>姬穸仍是先行出动，猛地将那动物抓捕在手，打量片刻又觉可爱，<NL>终是将狨猴雉鸡，皆一一放归山林，毫无所获……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5f93147e213b6bb0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "f3d62111-f3f4-41fa-b4eb-fa0a0d17b8ff/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Does Jixi intend to hunt a tiger or something...)",
      "cn": "（姬穸莫非意欲捕猎猛虎不成……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "d362b5d1d30f8463",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0825cc2-c38d-48e6-b514-68e26c8b7bd2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"The past is gone, there's no need to mention it again...<NL>I still vividly remember the sight of you leaving before.<NL>I'm afraid that being close to me now would disturb your spirit and make ghostly energy haunt you<NL>and that you would take the evil path again...\"<NL>Jixi's expression changes a bit and after murmuring a few words, she falls silent, no longer feeling disturbed...",
      "cn": "“旧事已逝，不必再提……<NL>昔日你离去之景，我仍历历在目，<NL>只怕如今与你接近，再叫你神魂动摇，鬼气缠身，重又堕入魔道……”<NL>却见姬穸神色微恸，喃喃数语后，终是归于寂静，再无波澜……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8e6d28dcd59773d1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0825cc2-c38d-48e6-b514-68e26c8b7bd2/Option_1": {
      "en": "If that is the case... Where do you plan to go now?",
      "cn": "若是如此……如今……你要去往何处……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "82bab699b898c89a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1f55792d-0cee-4fe4-8cfc-9bd14cc8bc0f/EventContent": {
      "en": "It has been a while since Jixi arrived in Taiwu Village. Today, walking through the village,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> notices Jixi standing alone by the fields. While she looks toward the farmland, she looks as if she is concerned about something, her eyebrows furrowed...",
      "cn": "自姬穸住进太吾村以来，已有一段时日，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>此日漫步村中，却见姬穸独自立于田野边，<NL>虽望向农田之中，却似是心有忧思，双眉不展……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "498ee826965538a3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "1f55792d-0cee-4fe4-8cfc-9bd14cc8bc0f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Approach to inquire...)",
      "cn": "（上前询问……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "199ea4f658cabb63",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dc644cf2-8aa4-4dc4-abe7-095eef1ef9c3/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Our past is settled. Our bond is severed.<NL>If one day, you desire to end my torment of harming others against my will,<NL>even if it takes you to the ends of the earth, come find me... and kill me. Now we shall part ways...\"<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> does not open <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> eyes, only hearing Jixi's voice close to <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> ear.<NL>For a moment, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> does not know what to say, only feeling a bitter ache...",
      "cn": "“前尘已了，缘分已尽，<NL>若有朝一日，你欲了结我违心伤人为食之苦，<NL>纵是天涯海角，亦要来寻我……杀我……你我就此别过……”<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>未再睁眼，只闻姬穸之声近在耳边，<NL>一时不知是何心绪，酸涩难言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "25d355d174c66c60",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dc644cf2-8aa4-4dc4-abe7-095eef1ef9c3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c236a5a2-11be-46ac-a2dc-8ee93e9ea92c/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>'s heart feels heavy, and <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> closely examines the blood-stained words on the senior's red robe.<NL>They are already faded and almost black now...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>心下戚戚，凝眉细看红衣老人衣衫，<NL>只见上书几行潦草血字，如今早已凝黑：",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "42c99c20ddda458a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "c236a5a2-11be-46ac-a2dc-8ee93e9ea92c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Read carefully...)",
      "cn": "（细细阅读……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7482bec5a2d92cba",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You're here...\"<NL>Jixi's expression is gloomy, as if she has countless words in her heart.<NL>Facing <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>, it seems that she has anticipated this day long ago...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Jixi has a bloodthirsty nature. How to deal with her...?)",
      "cn": "“是你来了……”<NL>姬穸神情不郁，心头似有万般话语，<NL>与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>相望之时，却似是早已料见今日……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（姬穸嗜血食人，不知应当如何处置……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "27fd8a2a99bc949b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Drain Qi and drink blood...)",
      "cn": "（汲气饮血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ee6f16d52062b502",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Why the bloodlust...)",
      "cn": "（为何嗜血……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "7524c5277772a81f",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Execute Jixi...)",
      "cn": "（诛杀姬穸……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0c7d975e34a78c9d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_4": {
      "en": "(Leave her be...)",
      "cn": "（任她在此……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a8a37506f858c30d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_5": {
      "en": "(Ask how she's been...)",
      "cn": "（问及近况……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "100e6db78e5e71fe",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_6": {
      "en": "(Present a beast...)",
      "cn": "（赠送野兽……）",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5fde214aef61c8f3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "67412846-5926-48dc-994c-67f5868bf81f/Option_7": {
      "en": "(Accompany me...)",
      "cn": "（与我同行……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f20e8843cdefb219",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6c8a3802-b811-4c49-a266-92c811c52e47/EventContent": {
      "en": "There stands a senior in a tattered red robe,<NL>his body stiff and lifeless, with a pale, ashen complexion. His eyes are devoid of any spark, and his hands,<NL>upon closer inspection, are adorned with sharp, dark nails that send shivers down one's spine.<NL>A piercing chill fills the air, accompanied by a rotten stench. Clearly, this is no living being...",
      "cn": "眼前红衣老者，衣衫早已褴褛，<NL>其身僵直，死气难掩，面容则雪青泛白，双目更已浑而无神，<NL>细观老者双手，更毛骨悚然，竟已长出青黑尖锐之长甲，<NL>稍一靠近，只觉寒凉逼人，腐臭不止，俨然绝非活人……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "00c74f138474d7c8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6c8a3802-b811-4c49-a266-92c811c52e47/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Greatly appalled...)",
      "cn": "（心中大骇……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "fac475444e9d189b",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e4ceeef3-2251-49d1-b0a7-d3d9b6975921/EventContent": {
      "en": "nan",
      "cn": "\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910ba46f7648772c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8fdcccb0-58e8-4827-8065-833cd43c7e82/EventContent": {
      "en": "The person chuckles at the words<NL>and speaks in a mysterious and secretive tone, saying,<NL>\"Hmph, just look at your appearance and clothing, how could you be the 'red robed ghost'?<NL>This is a long story, and if you are to hear the details, you would be too scared to take a step outside...\"",
      "cn": "那人闻言，嗤笑一声，<NL>又显出一副神秘鬼祟的神情说道：<NL>“哼，以你面貌衣着，又怎会是那‘红衣鬼怪’？<NL>此事说来话长，只怕你听了详细，亦是吓得再不敢出门半步……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4cc53eb7e5943a96",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "8fdcccb0-58e8-4827-8065-833cd43c7e82/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Ask for more details...)",
      "cn": "（细细询问……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5e91e882c637c1a2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "99fa9991-0873-4c59-99a4-7c9862f80b00/EventContent": {
      "en": "As they walked through the open woods, wild rabbits would occasionally leap across their path.<NL>Squirrels and other small animals often darted out from the bushes to stare at them.<NL>The creatures here seemed unafraid of people, moving about freely and quite charmingly...",
      "cn": "两人穿行林野之中，时有野兔跃过，<NL>又有松鼠一类，常常窜出草丛，与人对视，<NL>此间生灵似是皆不怕人一般，来往自在，颇为可爱……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "f254d4bca76d5888",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "99fa9991-0873-4c59-99a4-7c9862f80b00/Option_1": {
      "en": "The animals in the mountains are so lively and cute. Don't you like them...",
      "cn": "山间动物活泼可爱，你可喜欢……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "452a35bc3836372a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9f5a5219-5bde-4330-93ef-9a9f25c56d63/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> originally thought that a fight was inevitable,<NL>but later sees that the red-robed senior moves slowly and shows signs of sniffing and searching for something.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> cannot comprehend his intention...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>本以为不免一战，<NL>却见红衣老人行动迟缓僵滞，并未出手袭来，<NL>反倒显出四处嗅闻寻物之态，不知意欲为何……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "5284fe1b4e2cc345",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "9f5a5219-5bde-4330-93ef-9a9f25c56d63/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Wait silently...)",
      "cn": "（静观其变……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1d5c519788599df2",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cdade10b-9e2c-4bdb-9175-f2c65a3054b3/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi hesitated for a long while.<NL>The hunger in her eyes was suppressed again and again before finally fading.<NL>At last, she reached out and gently stroked the little boar's still-growing bristles.<NL><NL>\"This little boar is so reckless. It's not afraid of me at all.<NL>For some reason, my heart is leaping with joy. Do you know why that is?\"",
      "cn": "却见姬穸几分犹豫，迟疑良久，<NL>眼中饥饿之意再三压抑，继而散去，<NL>终是伸出手来，轻抚小山猪尚未长齐的鬓毛……<NL><NL>“这山猪幼崽，莽撞得很，竟丝毫不惧我，<NL>我心不知为何，生出雀跃，你可知这是何故……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cdde3b124b7e77ba",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "cdade10b-9e2c-4bdb-9175-f2c65a3054b3/Option_1": {
      "en": "All living things in this world have a spirit. How could one not be happy to see a living creature...",
      "cn": "世间万物，生则有灵，见到有生之物，哪有不欢喜的道理呢……\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "b87313374f14a4c7",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86f7f724-7afa-4297-8508-e840e8f575d3/EventContent": {
      "en": "In the moment of great shock,<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> tries to stop the senior from being devoured by the soft, rotten red mud, but <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> cannot find a way.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> can only watch as the senior's body sinks into the ground and disappears...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>大骇之际，<NL>欲要阻拦那软烂红泥吞噬之势，<NL>却不得其法，只得眼看老人尸体全然没入泥土之中，消失不见……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "910120550065d7fc",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "86f7f724-7afa-4297-8508-e840e8f575d3/Option_1": {
      "en": "(...)",
      "cn": "（……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3c5b97dd623d6a45",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dcdc3b64-3b28-452e-a38b-0f1a7a770c81/EventContent": {
      "en": "At this moment, Jixi's expression subtly changes, her eyes shimmering with uncertain light.<NL><NL>\"You don't know why that old Jiangshi came here.<NL>Perhaps it has been following my trail and brought trouble to you...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸此时神情终有几分变换，眸中微光，闪烁不定：<NL><NL>“你不知那老尸因何而来，<NL>许是追寻我之踪迹，方为你惹来麻烦……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0e5cf28337dab8ac",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "dcdc3b64-3b28-452e-a38b-0f1a7a770c81/Option_1": {
      "en": "Anyone who intends to harm you is my enemy!",
      "cn": "犯你者，岂不亦是犯我者！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "071d7f61a7fe67b3",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d4d82d8a-3793-4717-9236-672013eba548/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It's just you... Be careful in everything you do.<NL>Don't... end up like before, losing your life so easily...\"<NL>Jixi's words hint at something left unsaid, but she falls silent soon...",
      "cn": "“倒是你……万事小心为上，<NL>可别……像以前，匆匆丢了性命……”<NL>姬穸话至此处，似仍有未尽之言，却不再开口……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "ff57c4ec909d2b42",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "d4d82d8a-3793-4717-9236-672013eba548/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Like before?)",
      "cn": "（以前？）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "273313c95f7c94f1",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "69d12911-b1aa-4a9a-a45b-44f2de0b575d/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If it weren't for the sound of the bell calling me,<NL>I would've been lying in my grave, never able to see the light of day again.<NL>It's fortunate that we can have this brief reunion in this life.\"<NL><NL>Jixi's final words seem to suggest that she has already learned about the meaning of life. It seems that she wants to say more but ends up falling silent.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> and she silently gaze at each other, a moment of speechlessness passing between them...",
      "cn": "“若非昔日铃音唤我，<NL>我本该长眠墓中，再不见天日，<NL>你我能得此短暂重聚，亦是此生之幸……”<NL><NL>姬穸最后说至此处，似是已人事看透，欲语还休，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>与她静静相望，一时亦是无言……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "767617acce3eb908",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "69d12911-b1aa-4a9a-a45b-44f2de0b575d/Option_1": {
      "en": "(The brief reunion?)",
      "cn": "（短暂重聚？）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "43ec6c3ae6aedcd5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ac8e652d-677d-4b38-80d8-08a575cdfde0/EventContent": {
      "en": "The red-robed senior has a body covered in dark and black fur,<NL>with eyes void of life, and claws as sharp as iron.<NL>On his tattered clothes, the stench of death is mixed with the scent of blood, traces of blood can be vaguely seen...",
      "cn": "眼前红衣老者，浑身青黑，长满骇人毛发，<NL>双目浑然死气，利爪削铁如泥，铜皮铁骨，庞然如山，<NL>浓浓尸气之中混杂血腥之气，破碎衣衫之上，隐约可见红褐血迹……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "0a425862105aaec5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "ac8e652d-677d-4b38-80d8-08a575cdfde0/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Fresh blood stains... These abnormalities... Could it be...)",
      "cn": "（新鲜血迹……种种异状……莫非……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "92c2ef754dee09c0",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "300f7567-3d0f-447a-871e-c433e7eb503c/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"You've deviated from the right path, indulging your desires.<NL>How could I not know... Anyway, once this matter is over,<NL>your people in Taiwu Village... will never have to live in fear...\"",
      "cn": "“你离经叛道，从心所欲，<NL>我又岂会不知……罢了，此间事了，<NL>日后你太吾村中之人，便再也不必提心吊胆……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1ed5c76f44dfafb5",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "300f7567-3d0f-447a-871e-c433e7eb503c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(A pang of bitterness in the heart...)",
      "cn": "（心中酸涩……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c8245bc97b443387",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "05840724-f432-4c2b-8847-4080a192e2db/EventContent": {
      "en": "With a disappointed expression, Jixi sighs softly, saying,<NL>\"This is like clouds and smoke passing by and having an old dream again...<NL>You don't have to mind. I know, you have always been by my side...\"",
      "cn": "只见姬穸闻听此言，神色怅然，却未见几分喜意：<NL>“云烟过眼……再逢旧梦……<NL>你不必在意，我自然知晓，你始终在我身边……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "3717bf4be40fb7ff",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "05840724-f432-4c2b-8847-4080a192e2db/Option_1": {
      "en": "(What is the old dream?)",
      "cn": "（何为旧梦……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a343ed881a9cc79c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0ea5e29-1957-4aad-af9a-d998d51b48fb/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"What a valiant one, today we have witnessed your extraordinary skills!\"<NL><NL>The surrounding crowd cheer and return to the teahouse.<NL>The informant <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> saw earlier also relaxes<NL>and invites <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> over to sit down for a chat...",
      "cn": "“侠骨豪杰，今日好生见识了一番！”<NL><NL>周围众人见此，<NL>皆欢呼出声，重回茶肆，<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>此前所见那知情人，此时也神情一松，<NL>邀请<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>同坐细聊……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "6d0fb6e1c1d020f6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "a0ea5e29-1957-4aad-af9a-d998d51b48fb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Sit down...)",
      "cn": "（顺势坐下……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4b565888203c749e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6af86306-690a-4b9e-9773-e2d8b6ae8585/EventContent": {
      "en": "As <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> ponders deeply,<NL>the red figure suddenly pauses and then rushes toward <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderObject/>.<NL>In an instant, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderSubject/> is within its reach!<NL><NL>Out of vigilance, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> takes a few steps back and observes its face.<NL>The rumored \"red-robed ghost\" turns out to be a solemn old man in a crimson robe...",
      "cn": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>正心生探究时，<NL>只见那红衣之影先是一顿，<NL>倏忽奔而袭来，须臾便已近在咫尺！<NL><NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>警觉之际，后撤几步，仍细观其面貌，<NL>传言神乎其神，如今得见，此“红衣鬼怪”竟不过是一红袍加身、面容肃穆之老者……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "86b8fe5cd84a0813",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "6af86306-690a-4b9e-9773-e2d8b6ae8585/Option_1": {
      "en": "He is not a ghost...?!",
      "cn": "非是鬼怪……？！\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "8a12792a19c93fb8",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "28284352-5524-49e5-a455-2e6e3378c6a5/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lets out a soft sigh, her expression tinged with loneliness.<NL>\"When you're not by my side, I feel lonely...<NL>I often enjoy watching the birds and other adorable animals in the mountains, as they roam freely and bring me joy.<NL>If I could keep them as companions, it would surely bring me comfort...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸轻叹一声，话中似有几分寂寥：<NL>“如今无你在我身边，独自一人，实在无聊……<NL>我素日无事，常爱看那山野之中飞禽走兽，逍遥自在，颇是可爱。<NL>若是能与它们作伴，想来……亦能舒心不少……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "c5ff1a2c4e9f069e",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "28284352-5524-49e5-a455-2e6e3378c6a5/Option_1": {
      "en": "I see... If you enjoy being with wild beasts, I will find some for you.",
      "cn": "原来如此……若你喜爱野兽，我自能为你寻来。\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "41ea67edf0cc8203",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "38682701-a114-4f1d-a4ca-2135988bb090/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Really? Then I'll be waiting for you to bring them to me...\"<NL>Jixi smiles and her eyes sparkle with anticipation.<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(From now on, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can capture wild beasts and give them to Jixi...)</color>",
      "cn": "“此话当真？我便等你为我寻来……”<NL>姬穸闻言，立时一笑，眉眼间更显出期待之色……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>今后可将捕获的野兽代步，赠予姬穸……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "03be37fd574c5fd6",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "38682701-a114-4f1d-a4ca-2135988bb090/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3cc310fe-d9d4-4db6-a0fe-67235dfe506a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi showes anticipation on her face and says,<NL>\"Have you found any wild beasts that can accompany me?<NL>Don't forget, even if they are wolves, tigers, or bears, I won't be afraid! Just bring them to me!\"",
      "cn": "姬穸面露期待：<NL>“你可曾寻得野兽，能与我为伴？<NL>你莫要忘了，即便是狼虎巨熊，我也不怕，尽管送来便是！”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "395cba67d7a4f17a",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "3cc310fe-d9d4-4db6-a0fe-67235dfe506a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(I should find wild beasts for Jixi as soon as possible...)",
      "cn": "（应早日为姬穸寻来野兽……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "61331416dc979c3d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0fec3795-605c-430e-8c54-001d484071b1/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's eyebrows relaxed, seemingly in a joyful mood, as she calmly said, \"The <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/> you brought me before was gentle and obedient. It accompanies me on countless journeys through mountains and across waters, reminding me of past joy...Thank you for fulfilling my wish. Although our companionship may not be long-lasting, the <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/> has qualities similar to yours and is equally adorable...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸眉头微松，似是心情畅快，悠然道：<NL><NL>“此前你为我寻来的<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>，极是温驯乖巧，<NL>每日伴我行千山，踏万水，令我常常想起旧时之乐……<NL><NL>多谢你圆我心愿，虽无法长久相伴，那<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>可爱之处，倒也似你一般……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "e774fa875b847d29",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "0fec3795-605c-430e-8c54-001d484071b1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(This is good...)",
      "cn": "（如此便好……）\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "cd8e5cb2900ce236",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "101037f5-edd1-4913-8df7-519bbd839e1e/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi keeps silent, simply gazing at <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...",
      "cn": "姬穸不语，静静与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>相望……",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "1d8c7941e8a8708d",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
