    "d27a9f34-4693-4908-82f7-94c8f52cc3c1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It's... It's actually a <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>!<NL>You really remember what I told you before...<NL>This <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/> is so adorable, I'm so happy! Let me have a chat with it and give it a name...\"<NL><NL>Jixi's expression is filled with love and surprise as she sees <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>, she is clearly delighted...",
      "cn": "“这是……原来是<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>！<NL>我此前与你诉说之话，你果真未曾忘记……<NL>这<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>好生可爱，我十分欢喜！且待我与它细谈一番，再取个名姓……”<NL><NL>姬穸见到<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>，顿感喜爱，惊喜之意溢于言表……",
      "ru": null,
