    "e6e6af81-7584-4f65-943a-7b37e2c9e3d0/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi lets out a soft sigh, her expression tinged with loneliness.<NL>\"Now I'm traveling with you but I cannot assist you in eradicating demons... I feel bored...<NL>I often enjoy watching the birds and other adorable animals in the mountains, as they roam freely and bring me joy.<NL>If they could accompany us along the way, wouldn't it be like adding flowers to brocade, making this journey even more joyful?\"",
      "cn": "姬穸轻叹一声，话中似有几分寂寥：<NL>“如今我虽与你同行，却不能助你除魔，实有几分无聊……<NL>我素日无事之时，常爱看那山野之中飞禽走兽，逍遥自在，颇是可爱。<NL>这一路若能与它们作伴，岂不是锦上添花，更加快活……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "a6ee9f67a975a78c",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "e6e6af81-7584-4f65-943a-7b37e2c9e3d0/Option_1": {
      "en": "I see... If you enjoy being with wild beasts, I will find some for you.",
      "cn": "原来如此……若你喜爱野兽，我自能为你寻来。\n",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "41ea67edf0cc8203",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
    },
    "435f43c9-b044-4c65-8e17-64798965ef02/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Really? Then I'll be waiting for you to bring them to me...\"<NL>Jixi smiles and her eyes sparkle with anticipation.<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(From now on, <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> can capture wild beasts and give them to Jixi...)</color>",
      "cn": "“此话当真？我便等你为我寻来……”<NL>姬穸闻言，立时一笑，眉眼间更显出期待之色……<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>今后可将捕获的野兽代步，赠予姬穸……）</color>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
