    "f42c9876-6613-448c-9f7e-ee0ba984ca4a/EventContent": {
      "en": "Jixi's brows ease a bit, she seems to be in a joyous mood and leisurely says,<NL><NL>\"The <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/> you found for me before is incredibly mild and well-behaved.<NL><NL>Thank you for fulfilling my wish. Have you noticed that the <Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/> is adorable as you are...\"",
      "cn": "姬穸眉头微松，似是心情畅快，悠然道：<NL><NL>“此前你为我寻来的<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>，极是温驯乖巧。<NL>多谢你圆我心愿，你可曾见，那<Item key=SelectItemKey str=ColorName/>可爱之处，倒也似你一般……”",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "373feaf6f82bdc1f",
